    MC "哦，对对对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:614
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_c3b02e80:

    # "{i}{u}YouTube Video" "But that's not all! I built him his own little custom surfboard!"
    "{i}{u}YouTube 视频" "But但还不止这个！我还给他做了一块专属冲浪板！

# game/script2.rpyc:615
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_4cb1cd1b:

    # MC "HOLY SHIT!"
    MC "我的天！"

# game/script2.rpyc:619
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_cb62ce88:

    # g "You're still good to come to my swim meet, right?" (multiple=2)
    g "你还是会来我的游泳比赛吧？" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:620
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_9ae836dd:

    # MCt "A frog in a suit?! This is the craziest thing I've ever seen!" (multiple=2)
    MCt "一只穿西装的青蛙？！这是我见过最疯狂的事！" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:624
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_60346a71:

    # g "Remember the swim meet is in two days."
    g "记住，游泳比赛还有两天。"

# game/script2.rpyc:631
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_d60d420d:

    # MC "Haha, look at his little shoes."
    MC "哈哈，看他的小鞋子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:632
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_5fc08c2a:

    # g "Are you seriously pulling your phone out mid-conversation?!"
    g "你真的要在聊天时掏出手机吗？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:635
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_625edae9:

    # g "You nodded along every time I brought it up."
    g "每次我提到它，你都在点头。"

# game/script2.rpyc:636
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_a9273994:

    # g "It's too late to back out now."
    g "现在想反悔也晚了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:637
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:638
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_f22c06c0:

    # MC "How do you think they got those shoes onto his flippers?"
    MC "你觉得他们是怎么把鞋子穿到青蛙的脚上的？"

# game/script2.rpyc:639
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_d660c08c:

    # g "We're going. Now."
    g "我们走。现在。"

# game/script2.rpyc:640
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_2d204a49_2:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:641
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_3e6cef26:

    # MC "I guess we are."
    MC "我想也是。"

# game/script2.rpyc:644
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_0d9c5d4e:

    # g "It's time to move."
    g "该出发了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:645
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_a454eb2d:

    # g "You guys good over there?"
    g "你们在那边没事吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:648
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_291a4270:

    # m "Oh, don't worry about us! We can handle this."
    m "别担心我们！我们能应付。"

# game/script2.rpyc:649
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_d71960ea:

    # m "We're fine!"
    m "我们很好！"

# game/script2.rpyc:650
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_ae9be0ef:

    # MC "Aight, cool. See ya'. Grace and I are heading out."
    MC "好，酷。回头见。格蕾丝和我要出门了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:651
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_6ef8946c:

    # g "Peace."
    g "走好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:657
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_eccec7e6:

    # C "{i}Are{/i} we, Miya?"
    C "{i}我们{/i}没事吗，米娅？"

# game/script2.rpyc:658
translate schinese m12afterchoice3_bf908210:

    # C "{i}Are{/i} we fine?"
    C "{i}我们{/i}真的没事吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:667
translate schinese main13_0c517f94:

    # MC "I'd appreciate a rundown, so I know what I'm in for."
    MC "给我简单说说情况吧，这样我知道自己会面对什么。"

# game/script2.rpyc:668
translate schinese main13_845bba53:

    # MC "How long it's gonna take, how many races there are. Stuff like that."
    MC "要花多久、有几场比赛之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:671
translate schinese main13_d2a77365:

    # g "It's not all about you, you know?"
    g "你知道，不是所有事都围着你转吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:672
translate schinese main13_fe799a05:

    # g "{i}I'm{/i} the one with pressure on them here."
    g "{i}我{/i}才是这里承受压力的人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:673
translate schinese main13_1145c0e7:

    # MC "I just wanna know when my race starts."
    MC "我只想知道我的比赛什么时候开始。"

# game/script2.rpyc:674
translate schinese main13_114c6e53:

    # g "Uh-huh. Where's your swimsuit?"
    g "嗯哼。你的泳衣呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:675
translate schinese main13_240e104c:

    # MC "Yeah, about that; I thought it'd be better off if I borrow yours."
    MC "对，说起来，我觉得借你的比较好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:676
translate schinese main13_b1138572:

    # MC "I felt that if I wore it upside down the extra boob room could accommodate my massive balls."
    MC "我觉得如果反着穿，多出来的胸部空间也许能容纳我的巨蛋。"

# game/script2.rpyc:684
translate schinese main13_db5d8d8c:

    # g "They're as big as these? You should probably get that checked out."
    g "有这么大？你可能该去检查一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:685
translate schinese main13_41f47c41:

    # MC "Okay, maybe not {i}that{/i} big, but they'd surprise you."
    MC "好吧，也许没{i}那么{/i}大，但它们会吓到你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:686
translate schinese main13_6d195e51:

    # g "Mmhm. I'm {i}suuuure{/i} they would."
    g "嗯哼。我才{i}非常{/i}相信呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:693
translate schinese main13_6f52d1b1:

    # gt "I've actually seen your balls, though..."
    gt "不过，我其实见过你的蛋蛋……"

# game/script2.rpyc:702
translate schinese main13_19e2f867:

    # g "Jokes aside, this is an interschool tournament, split into school years that are further split into subgroups."
    g "玩笑归玩笑，这是校际锦标赛，按年级分组，还会再分成小组。"

# game/script2.rpyc:703
translate schinese main13_222bb5cc:

    # g "Simple rules, the team with the most points at the end wins. Higher placement in a race means more points."
    g "规则很简单，最后积分最高的队伍获胜。比赛名次越高，积分越多。"

# game/script2.rpyc:706
translate schinese main13_b015e108:

    # g "We've got several race types to deal with. Various strokes, distances, a few relays."
    g "我们有几种比赛项目：不同泳姿、不同距离，还有几项接力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:707
translate schinese main13_1723aae5:

    # g "I'm up for a singles freestyle race. Four-hundred meters."
    g "我参加男子四百米自由泳。"

# game/script2.rpyc:708
translate schinese main13_da7f6083:

    # g "Not my best stroke, I'm actually most proficient at breaststroke. Keep your dirty jokes to yourself."
    g "这不是我最强的泳姿，我其实最擅长蛙泳。把你那些黄色笑话留着自己用吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:709
translate schinese main13_1e28dfbb:

    # g "But alas, we've also determined that I'm the best fit for the freestyle race."
    g "但没办法，我们认定我是自由泳比赛的最佳人选。"

# game/script2.rpyc:710
translate schinese main13_93aa8843:

    # g "You play with the hand you've been dealt. C'est la vie."
    g "拿到什么牌就打什么牌，这就是生活。"

# game/script2.rpyc:713
translate schinese main13_25fa5a4e:

    # g "So to address your first question-"
    g "所以回答你的第一个问题——"

# game/script2.rpyc:721
translate schinese main13_e79ed82a:

    # MC "Huh?"
    MC "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:731
translate schinese main13_968ceaff:

    # MC "NOOOO! Mr. Floppington's World of Froggy Fashion!"
    MC "不——！弗洛平顿先生的青蛙时尚世界！"

# game/script2.rpyc:736
translate schinese main13_19dac13e:

    # g "So as I was saying..."
    g "所以我刚才说……"

# game/script2.rpyc:737
translate schinese main13_f9797d17:

    # g "I'm on {i}second to last{/i}."
    g "我排在{i}倒数第二{/i}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:738
translate schinese main13_e572c7b4:

    # g "So sorry, you're gonna have to wait until the end to get back to your dear Mr. Floppington."
    g "抱歉，你得等到最后才能回去见你亲爱的弗洛平顿先生。"

# game/script2.rpyc:739
translate schinese main13_b5e4efa8:

    # g "Besides, even if I was up first, we'd still have to wait around to find out if we won or not."
    g "而且就算我第一个出场，也得等结果出来才知道我们赢没赢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:742
translate schinese main13_0863339a:

    # MC "Does it matter if your team wins?"
    MC "你们队赢不赢重要吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:743
translate schinese main13_3b0db847:

    # g "There are prizes."
    g "有奖品。"

# game/script2.rpyc:744
translate schinese main13_460c9cd0:

    # MC "Anything {i}I{/i} can make use of?"
    MC "有{i}我{/i}能用的东西吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:745
translate schinese main13_16b38a90:

    # g "Nope. No straight jackets or ball-gags."
    g "没有。没有紧身衣，也没有口球。"

# game/script2.rpyc:748
translate schinese main13_88fd1f99:

    # g "[size20small]Or cat toys..."
    g "[size20small]也没有猫玩具……"

# game/script2.rpyc:749
translate schinese main13_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:750
translate schinese main13_c94d1b76:

    # g "Say, you-"
    g "我说，你——"

# game/script2.rpyc:751
translate schinese main13_4b340443_1:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:752
translate schinese main13_06017526:

    # g "You and Cadence are pretty close..."
    g "你和凯登丝关系挺好……"

# game/script2.rpyc:755
translate schinese main13_484c8ab1:

    # MC "I guess."
    MC "我猜。"

# game/script2.rpyc:756
translate schinese main13_d041f4ec:

    # g "\"I guess\" he says."
    g "他说‘大概’。"

# game/script2.rpyc:757
translate schinese main13_2e731267:

    # MC "I know. I know."
    MC "我知道，我知道。"

# game/script2.rpyc:758
translate schinese main13_7872ce1c:

    # MC "She clearly looks up to me after what happened."
    MC "发生过那件事后，她明显更仰慕我了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:761
translate schinese main13_870940cf:

    # MC "She looks to me for a feeling of safety. Like a parent or something."
    MC "她把我当成安全感来源，像父母之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:762
translate schinese main13_a1e54d16:

    # MC "Not to mention I was the first friendly face she saw in years."
    MC "更别说我是她多年里见到的第一张友善面孔。"

# game/script2.rpyc:763
translate schinese main13_9c1619b1:

    # MC "She probably feels like she owes me. You know, despite the fact that I tell her she doesn't."
    MC "她可能觉得欠我什么。你知道，尽管我告诉她她不欠。"

# game/script2.rpyc:764
translate schinese main13_7b6005a7:

    # MC "We get on fine, though. She's capable of banter, normal conversations."
    MC "不过我们相处得很好。她能开玩笑，也能正常聊天。"

# game/script2.rpyc:765
translate schinese main13_ae265782:

    # MC "I got it across to her in an exiguous amount of time that she has free will."
    MC "我只花了极短的时间就让她明白，她有自由意志。"

# game/script2.rpyc:766
translate schinese main13_f0fad3cc:

    # MC "So we interact like real people. The only thing that worries me is that if I wanted to be a tyrant, she'd go along with it."
    MC "所以我们像真正的人一样互动。唯一让我担心的是，如果我想当暴君，她也会照做。"

# game/script2.rpyc:767
translate schinese main13_0cae6931:

    # MC "Though she's been conditioned to think like that. So it could be less about our circumstances or about me. More so her mental state."
    MC "不过她已经被训练成这样思考了。所以这可能不太取决于我们的处境或我，而更多取决于她的心理状态。"

# game/script2.rpyc:768
translate schinese main13_9da95a6a:

    # MC "So no. I'm not pretending to be oblivious. I'm aware of what's going on. It's complicated, she needs to work on a few things about herself."
    MC "所以不。我没有假装迟钝。我知道正在发生什么。这很复杂，她需要改善自己的一些地方。"

# game/script2.rpyc:771
translate schinese main13_4b340443_2:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:772
translate schinese main13_3ebe697f:

    # g "The fuck does \"exiguous\" mean?"
    g "“极小的”到底是什么意思？"

# game/script2.rpyc:775
translate schinese main13_6ddcebd9:

    # MC "Cool word, right?"
    MC "很酷的词，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:776
translate schinese main13_9a109a45:

    # MC "I learned it yesterday and I really wanted to use it."
    MC "我昨天学的，特别想用一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:777
translate schinese main13_6010a835:

    # MC "It means super small."
    MC "意思是超级小。"

# game/script2.rpyc:778
translate schinese main13_6140f6e7:

    # g "You really didn't need to go out of your way to use it."
    g "你真的没必要特意用它。"

# game/script2.rpyc:779
translate schinese main13_b6846225:

    # g "Anyway-"
    g "总之——"

# game/script2.rpyc:782
translate schinese main13_b53c3389:

    # g "Nice little psycho-analysis, my little therapist."
    g "不错的小型心理分析，我的小治疗师。"

# game/script2.rpyc:783
translate schinese main13_b6dbfb7f:

    # g "I had no idea you were so socially intelligent."
    g "我都不知道你社交能力这么强。"

# game/script2.rpyc:784
translate schinese main13_5f12c6a2:

    # MC "My perspective of the interpersonal battlefield shifts dramatically once I've been deployed on the front lines."
    MC "一旦被部署到前线，我对人际战场的看法就会彻底改变。"

# game/script2.rpyc:785
translate schinese main13_f10697f6:

    # g "Oh, wow. What a metaphor to use, and only moments after uttering \"exiguous\"."
    g "哇。这个比喻真够夸张的，而且你刚说完“极小的”没几秒。"

# game/script2.rpyc:786
translate schinese main13_67a292a1:

    # g "What turned you into a scholar this week? Slave ownership give you a new perspective on life?"
    g "是什么让你这周突然变成学者的？当奴隶让你对人生有了新看法？"

# game/script2.rpyc:789
translate schinese main13_4f7e5249:

    # MC "Thankfully the slave ownership is more like a slave adoption."
    MC "幸好这里更像是收养奴隶，而不是拥有奴隶。"

# game/script2.rpyc:790
translate schinese main13_1f34f27b:

    # MC "Slavery is kinda cringe. I'm glad Cadence and I have nipped that in the bud."
    MC "奴隶制挺让人尴尬的。幸好凯登丝和我及时制止了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:791
translate schinese main13_146606ec:

    # MC "I'm relieved, too. I was worried my whole relationship with Cadence was gonna suck-"
    MC "我也松了口气。我之前担心我和凯登丝的关系会变得很糟——"

# game/script2.rpyc:798
translate schinese main13_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:799
translate schinese main13_813901c3:

    # MC "My whole relationship with Cadence was gonna blow-"
    MC "我和凯登丝的关系会爆炸——"

# game/script2.rpyc:804
translate schinese main13_0d36b562:

    # MC "..." (multiple=2)
    MC "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:805
translate schinese main13_27651c64:

    # g "..." (multiple=2)
    g "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:806
translate schinese main13_db445a54:

    # MC "It's going well."
    MC "现在进展很好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:807
translate schinese main13_0d36b562_1:

    # MC "..." (multiple=2)
    MC "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:808
translate schinese main13_27651c64_1:

    # g "..." (multiple=2)
    g "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:809
translate schinese main13_d8dc2ae6:

    # MC "Uh..."
    MC "呃……"

# game/script2.rpyc:810
translate schinese main13_65266ed8:

    # MC "The prizes?"
    MC "奖品呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:811
translate schinese main13_8ff8e98c:

    # g "Right."
    g "没错。"

# game/script2.rpyc:815
translate schinese main13_767ee74a:

    # g "So other than qualifying for nationals, first place gets tickets for a weekend stay at a five-star hotel."
    g "除了晋级全国赛，第一名还能获得五星级酒店周末住宿券。"

# game/script2.rpyc:816
translate schinese main13_61fe9a1a:

    # g "Pretty cool, right?"
    g "挺厉害的吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:817
translate schinese main13_a20579a7:

    # MC "Eh. I guess. Good for you."
    MC "嗯……算是吧。恭喜你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:820
translate schinese main13_566ee4d9:

    # g "Oh, and I forgot to mention."
    g "哦，还有件事忘了说。"

# game/script2.rpyc:821
translate schinese main13_08a835d6:

    # g "Each of us get an extra ticket for a plus one."
    g "我们每个人都能多拿一张带一名同伴的票。"

# game/script2.rpyc:822
translate schinese main13_b0943ec6:

    # g "I haven't decided who I'd take yet. But surely it'll be whoever my biggest supporter is."
    g "我还没决定带谁。但肯定是我最大的支持者。"

# game/script2.rpyc:826
translate schinese main13_c17cba42:

    # MC "That could be anyone."
    MC "可能是任何人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:829
translate schinese main13_6635c2e9:

    # g "*Sigh*"
    g "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:830
