    # v "Vineeta."
    v "维妮塔。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1111
translate schinese m13choice1_1_c6e2de2e:

    # MC "No, I meant your last name."
    MC "不，我问的是你的姓。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1112
translate schinese m13choice1_1_fffebc3f:

    # v "Don't be silly, [name]."
    v "别傻了，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1113
translate schinese m13choice1_1_00a0d6c5:

    # v "No-one in this game has a last name."
    v "这个游戏里没人有姓。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1114
translate schinese m13choice1_1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1115
translate schinese m13choice1_1_513b97b3:

    # MC "What about Dr. Bashford?"
    MC "巴什福德博士呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1116
translate schinese m13choice1_1_867100a6:

    # v "I'm gonna pretend I didn't hear that."
    v "我就当没听见。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1121
translate schinese m13choice1_2_a67bccb7:

    # MC "I have absolutely no idea what your name is. I know there's a V in there."
    MC "我完全不知道你的名字叫什么。我只知道里面有个 V。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1122
translate schinese m13choice1_2_f9e39446:

    # "{i}{u}Vin Diesel?" "..."
    "{i}{u}维·迪塞尔？" "..."……

# game/script2.rpyc:1125
translate schinese m13choice1_2_e77472bf:

    # "{i}{u}Vin Diesel?" "*Giggling* Haha!"
    "{i}{u}维·迪塞尔？" "*Gigg*咯咯笑* 哈哈！

# game/script2.rpyc:1126
translate schinese m13choice1_2_0bb5952e:

    # "{i}{u}Vin Diesel?" "*Sigh*"
    "{i}{u}维·迪塞尔？" "*Sigh*叹气*

# game/script2.rpyc:1129
translate schinese m13choice1_2_cc095254:

    # v "It's Vineeta."
    v "是维妮塔。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1130
translate schinese m13choice1_2_65261dfd:

    # v "I appreciate you not beating around the bush. I like a good communicator."
    v "我很欣赏你不绕弯子。我喜欢沟通顺畅的人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1131
translate schinese m13choice1_2_abf4b47e:

    # v "Sorry for laughing, it's just that interrupting me with such a question was unexpected."
    v "抱歉笑出声，只是你突然拿这种问题打断我，出乎意料。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1133
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_9459bbc6:

    # v "Anyway-"
    v "总之——"

# game/script2.rpyc:1134
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_96a2fc75:

    # v "You're friends with Grace?"
    v "你和格蕾丝是朋友？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1135
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_ff1e6401:

    # MC "For a long time. I mean, I live with her and her family for the time being, you know."
    MC "认识很久了。我的意思是，我现在和她以及她家人住在一起，你懂的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1138
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_65cabcbf:

    # v "..."
    v "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1139
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_3bfc7d9b:

    # v "Wait wait wait! Grace is Chloe's {i}sister{/i}?!"
    v "等等等等！格蕾丝是克洛伊的{i}姐姐{/i}？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:1140
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_0e6d003f:

    # MC "You didn't know?"
    MC "你不知道吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1141
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_c9d7f00d:

    # v "They're so unalike. I'm surprised."
    v "她们一点都不像。真意外。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1142
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_8f3610ee:

    # MC "She'll mention me but won't tell you about her sisters?"
    MC "她会提到我，却不告诉你她还有姐妹？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1145
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_50775b8b:

    # v "Does she perhaps have a poor relationship with them?"
    v "难道她和她们关系不好？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1146
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_152755fe:

    # MC "Not poor as much as non-existent. They're honestly more like roommates sometimes."
    MC "与其说不好，不如说根本不存在。她们有时候更像室友。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1147
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_b25c2a58:

    # MC "Short exchanges of words if they ever cross paths. And usually if it's Noelle, the other sister, the conversation is more like one between parent and child."
    MC "如果碰面，也只会交换几句简短的话。而且通常是诺艾尔这个妹妹和另一个姐姐说话时，更像家长和孩子之间的对话。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1150
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_b0467202:

    # v "Oh, thank goodness! That sounds typical for Chloe. I'm relieved to hear that there isn't anything going on at home."
    v "哦，太好了！这听起来很克洛伊。听到家里没发生什么奇怪的事，我放心了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1151
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_c9333c06:

    # MC "You really care for Chloe, don't you?"
    MC "你真的很在乎克洛伊，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1154
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_8a977de3:

    # v "She's my best and only friend. It's only natural."
    v "她是我最好也是唯一的朋友。这是理所当然的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1155
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_9a09e699:

    # MC "\"Only friend\"? I find that hard to believe."
    MC "“唯一的朋友”？我很难相信。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1158
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_bf8b39a0:

    # v "Why? I'm just as unapproachable as Chloe. We're perfect together."
    v "为什么？我和克洛伊一样难以接近。我们天生一对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1159
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_5c6d0b9c:

    # MC "Chloe I get, but what makes you think {i}you're{/i} unapproachable?"
    MC "克洛伊我理解，但你怎么觉得自己{i}也{/i}难以接近？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1160
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_69c772cf:

    # v "It must be the lack of approaching."
    v "大概是因为没人接近我吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1161
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_186e0f43:

    # v "Not to mention I'm rich in self awareness. I know how my attitude can be a turn-off."
    v "更不用说我很善于自我反省。我知道自己的态度可能让人却步。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1162
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_699a98d1:

    # MC "That's what you think?"
    MC "你这么认为？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1165
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_79e6987e:

    # MC "You seem perfectly approachable to me. And so far you haven't turned me off."
    MC "对我来说，你完全很容易接近。而且到目前为止，你还没让我讨厌。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1166
translate schinese m13afterchoice1_73175537:

    # v "Hmm... And what makes me so approachable, then?"
    v "嗯……那我为什么这么容易接近呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1170
translate schinese m13choice2_1_efbbb60b:

    # MC "Honestly, I'm loving the conversation. You're witty and skip platitudes."
    MC "老实说，我很喜欢这段对话。你很机智，也不会说套话。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1171
translate schinese m13choice2_1_2fa6726f:

    # MC "The conversation hasn't paused for a second."
    MC "对话一秒都没有停下来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1172
translate schinese m13choice2_1_ea3c6acc:

    # MC "You carry yourself with such confidence that I already feel like I wouldn't be stepping on your toes by saying anything."
    MC "你身上那种自信，让我觉得自己说什么都不会踩到你的雷区。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1175
translate schinese m13choice2_1_d7ebddd6:

    # MC "You feel down to Earth and realistic and I want to keep talking to you."
    MC "你让人觉得脚踏实地、真实，我想继续和你聊下去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1176
translate schinese m13choice2_1_6ea95aa2:

    # MC "That's what I think makes you so approachable."
    MC "我觉得这就是你如此容易接近的原因。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1180
translate schinese m13choice2_2_8b9481bb:

    # MC "Have you seen yourself in a mirror?"
    MC "你看过镜子里的自己吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1181
translate schinese m13choice2_2_6270bf2a:

    # v "I have. Whatever could you be implying?"
    v "看过。你想暗示什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1182
translate schinese m13choice2_2_326be978:

    # MC "I don't know how to say this, but you're like..."
    MC "我不知道该怎么说，但你是那种……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1183
translate schinese m13choice2_2_965f033e:

    # MC "Crazy attractive."
    MC "疯狂地有魅力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1186
translate schinese m13choice2_2_b9903ebb:

    # v "Oh, my! How bold!"
    v "哦，我的天！好大胆！"

# game/script2.rpyc:1187
translate schinese m13choice2_2_90f82972:

    # v "I was not aware of this. Could you please describe in great detail what about me is \"crazy attractive\"?"
    v "我之前完全没意识到。能不能请你详细描述一下，我哪里“疯狂地有魅力”？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1188
translate schinese m13choice2_2_10556699:

    # MC "You're absolutely playing with me right now. Do you want to stroke your ego? Is that it?"
    MC "你现在绝对是在耍我。你想满足自己的虚荣心，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1191
translate schinese m13choice2_2_aedf19ee:

    # v "Of course not! I've never been called attractive in my life, the prospect is simply alien to me."
    v "当然不是！我这辈子从没被说过有魅力，这种可能性对我来说简直太陌生了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1192
translate schinese m13choice2_2_843ec917:

    # v "Do tell. What is it?"
    v "请告诉我。到底是哪里？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1193
translate schinese m13choice2_2_010e96f8:

    # MC "Your eyes."
    MC "你的眼睛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1194
translate schinese m13choice2_2_12acfc5e:

    # v "My eyes?"
    v "我的眼睛？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1195
translate schinese m13choice2_2_0c611ccc:

    # MC "Amongst other things."
    MC "这只是其中一点。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1197
translate schinese m13choice2_2_22cf44a2:

    # v "You know a lot of people find attractiveness to be an intimidating trait?"
    v "你知道很多人觉得“有魅力”是一种让人害怕的特征吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1198
translate schinese m13choice2_2_e0420705:

    # v "If what you say is true, it could be one reason why I don't get approached often."
    v "如果你说的是真的，那也许能解释为什么我很少被人搭讪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1202
translate schinese m13choice2_3_3b6c46ea:

    # MC "I like intelligence. You seem to be brimming with it."
    MC "我喜欢聪明人。你看起来聪明得快要溢出来了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1203
translate schinese m13choice2_3_b7b5938f:

    # MC "Pretty sure Chloe has mentioned your grades, too."
    MC "我敢肯定克洛伊也提过你的成绩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1206
translate schinese m13choice2_3_8afc770d:

    # v "It's flattering that you like such a trait but can you really say that you would have approached me without Chloe's involvement?"
    v "你喜欢这种特质当然挺加分，但如果没有克洛伊牵线，你真的会说会来接近我吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1207
translate schinese m13choice2_3_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1208
translate schinese m13choice2_3_45062fbe:

    # v "You couldn't have even known if you weren't informed of me beforehand."
    v "要不是她提前告诉我，我根本不会知道你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1209
translate schinese m13choice2_3_6a5be244:

    # v "And besides, many people conflate intelligence with being condescending."
    v "而且很多人会把聪明和居高临下混为一谈。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1211
translate schinese m13choice2_3_b4c47248:

    # v "But thank you."
    v "不过还是谢谢你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1215
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_2f01415a:

    # v "You certainly have a way with words, don't you?"
    v "你确实很会说话，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1216
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_8d7c16d4:

    # MC "I try."
    MC "我尽量。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1217
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_360f0545:

    # v "Is this how you won Chloe over, I wonder?"
    v "我想知道你就是这么赢得克洛伊好感的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1218
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_e49d47eb:

    # MC "Won her over?"
    MC "赢得她的好感？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1219
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_00cf84b6:

    # v "Funny how she fails to mention any of her sisters, yet I knew about you in detail from her."
    v "有意思，她从不提自己的姐妹，但我却从她那里详细了解了你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1220
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_7910ed2e:

    # v "A symptom of favoritism, perhaps?"
    v "也许是偏爱造成的症状？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1221
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_04fdbd86:

    # MC "You're reading too much into it."
    MC "你想太多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1222
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_6441658a:

    # v "Am I?"
    v "是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1223
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_6570fbaa:

    # v "I've heard about you on and off for... I don't know, ten... eleven years."
    v "我断断续续听说你已经……十……十一年了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1224
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_3f169c70:

    # MC "That long?"
    MC "那么久？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1227
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_5918af06:

    # MC "Well, when she was a kid she was a lot more open and friendly with all of us. But even then I don't think I was a special case."
    MC "她小时候对我们所有人都更开放、更友好。但即使那时，我也不觉得自己是特别的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1228
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_b9de892b:

    # v "Are you absolutely certain? No special moments you've shared? No reason for her to look up to you in particular."
    v "你确定吗？没有你们分享过的特别时刻？没有她特别敬仰你的理由？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1229
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1232
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_319bbace:

    # MC "There's... one thing..."
    MC "有……一件事……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1233
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_58909f73:

    # MC "I didn't think much of it but..."
    MC "当时没放在心上，但是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1240
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_e3e96d3a:

    # MC "Does Chloe always wear those headphones to school?"
    MC "克洛伊总是戴那副耳机去学校吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1241
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_3e4ffde9:

    # v "She's made it part of her uniform. I can't remember the last time I saw her without them."
    v "她已经把它当成校服的一部分了。我不记得上次没戴它是什么时候。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1249
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_c714c2d3:

    # MC "It was a long time ago. We were both kids, Miya was babysitting me for a few days because uh... I don't remember, it doesn't matter."
    MC "那是很久以前的事了。我们都还是孩子，米娅因为呃……照顾我几天。我不记得了，也不重要。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1256
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_b1fc6714:

    # MC "Chloe must have been about... eight, I wanna say."
    MC "克洛伊那时大概……八岁吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1257
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_16a49c22:

    # MC "It was during an intense thunderstorm."
    MC "那是一场很猛烈的雷暴。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1259
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_7e435b63:

    # v "A thunderstorm?"
    v "雷暴？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1260
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_9981ad00:

    # v "Where was your old house?"
    v "你以前的房子在哪里？"

# game/script2.rpyc:1261
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_aca77c51:

    # MC "Still in the city. I know what you're getting at. Rain is rare enough here let alone storms."
    MC "还在城市里。我知道你想说什么。这里连雨都很少，更别说暴风雨了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1262
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_002c1f6d:

    # MC "I've been in two storms in my life. This was the second."
    MC "我这辈子只经历过两场暴风雨。这是第二场。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1263
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_9febb37c:

    # v "I can't say I remember it."
    v "我不记得那件事了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1264
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_5faa859f:

    # MC "You probably slept through it. It didn't start until super late."
    MC "你大概睡过去了。直到很晚才开始下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1271
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_658d9a02:

    # MC "Regardless, I was staying up. I went to the bathroom and I heard it through the cracks of lightning."
    MC "不管怎样，我一直醒着。我去卫生间，从门缝里听见了外面的闪电声。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1274
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_19abf82e:

    # MC "Muffled screams coming from Chloe's room."
    MC "克洛伊房间传来压抑的尖叫声。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1281
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_6116e466:

    # c "*Scream*"
    c "*尖叫*"

# game/script2.rpyc:1282
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_1990b6a2:

    # MCpas "Chloe?" (multiple=2)
    MCpas "克洛伊？" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:1283
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_b2b645fa:

    # MCpres "She's terrified of lightning." (multiple=2)
    MCpres "她害怕闪电。" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:1284
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_5158ea6a:

    # MCpres "Like nothing I've ever seen before. Something beyond simply being scared by sudden, loud noises."
    MCpres "我从来没见过这种情况。不只是被突然的巨响吓到。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1285
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_b93ee8fe:

    # MCpres "It's like she felt that she was in immediate, life-threatening danger."
    MCpres "她像是觉得自己正面临立即的生命危险。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1286
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_4431923b:

    # MCpres "Oh, it's uh... it might not be a good idea to tell Chloe I told you about this..."
    MCpres "呃……可能最好不要告诉克洛伊，是我告诉你的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1287
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_d71d1a20:

    # v "My lips are sealed."
    v "我守口如瓶。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1290
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_a98dc1d2:

    # MCpres "I spent the whole night with her. She was paralyzed as the rain beat down throughout the night."
    MCpres "我陪了她整整一夜。雨整夜都在敲打窗户，她却动弹不得。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1291
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_0a611504:

    # MCpres "The lightning was subsiding. Even though there hadn't been a strike in a while, Chloe was completely unresponsive. Yet..."
    MCpres "闪电已经渐渐平息。虽然有一阵子没有再劈，但克洛伊完全没有反应。然而……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1294
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_29a66ab6:

    # MCpres "Her eyes were wide open."
    MCpres "她的眼睛睁得大大的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1295
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_8d83a144:

    # MCpres "I didn't know if she could hear me. If she was listening. Hell, I don't even know if she was aware that I was there."
    MCpres "我不知道她能不能听见我，是否在听。见鬼，我甚至不知道她是否意识到我在那里。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1296
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_ade37765:

    # MCpres "Still, I didn't leave."
    MCpres "尽管如此，我还是没有离开。"

# game/script2.rpyc:1297
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_7be95368:

    # MCpres "I'd stroke her hair. Say reassuring things. I avoided mentioning the lightning, things like \"You're safe\" and \"I'm here\". Again, I don't know if she heard any of this..."
    MCpres "我会抚摸她的头发，说些让人安心的话。我不提闪电，只说“你安全了”、“我在这里”之类的。我还是不知道她有没有听见……"

# game/script2.rpyc:1298
translate schinese m13afterchoice2_b78d1e89:

    # MCpres "And as I thought the storm was coming to its end..."
    MCpres "就在我认为暴风雨快要结束时……"

