    MC "不过分量很少，只够用一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2044
translate schinese m13choice8_2_0193ff90:

    # v "Let's make a deal. You can't find a use for that before the end of the meet, and you give it to me."
    v "我们做个交易吧。要是直到大会结束你都没用上它，就把它给我。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2045
translate schinese m13choice8_2_00499ab6:

    # v "I'd love to try it out."
    v "我很想试试看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2047
translate schinese m13choice8_2_bb165493:

    # MC "Too bad for you but I think I already have a use for this."
    MC "真不凑巧，不过我想我已经知道这东西该怎么用了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2048
translate schinese m13choice8_2_a7d13a67:

    # v "Interesting. Lead the way to this use of yours."
    v "有意思。带我去看看你的用法吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2050
translate schinese m13choice8_2_2543de57:

    # MC "Deal."
    MC "成交。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2051
translate schinese m13choice8_2_ca56d616:

    # v "Excellent, lets move on, shall we?"
    v "太好了，那我们继续吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2055
translate schinese m13choice7_2_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2056
translate schinese m13choice7_2_0f10e933:

    # MC "Please?"
    MC "拜托？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2060
translate schinese m13choice7_2_bd6dde0f:

    # v "I'm sorry, [name], but I really don't want to risk embarrassing myself like that."
    v "抱歉，[name]，但我真的不想冒那种丢脸的风险。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2061
translate schinese m13choice7_2_aef9ec32:

    # v "Or in the worst case scenario, incurring someone's wrath."
    v "或者更糟糕的情况——惹怒了什么人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2062
translate schinese m13choice7_2_0cc9162b:

    # MCt "Damn it."
    MCt "该死。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2066
translate schinese m13choice7_2_ab761516:

    # v "Oh, you're just too cute to turn down."
    v "噢，你太可爱了，让人无法拒绝。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2067
translate schinese m13choice7_2_db6ad7ab:

    # MC "This is being cute?"
    MC "这叫可爱吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2068
translate schinese m13choice7_2_2a94d8e7:

    # v "No. I just like saying sweet things sometimes."
    v "不是。我只是偶尔喜欢说些甜言蜜语。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2078
translate schinese m13choice7_2_43fd9c73:

    # lexi "Hey!"
    lexi "喂！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2079
translate schinese m13choice7_2_ba179a0f:

    # v "Ah, sorry, I wasn't paying attention."
    v "啊，抱歉，我刚才没注意。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2083
translate schinese m13choice7_2_1107f7ab:

    # v "Oww!" (multiple=2)
    v "哎哟！" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:2084
translate schinese m13choice7_2_643fac21:

    # lexi "Watch where you're going, twerp!" (multiple=2)
    lexi "走路看着点，小鬼！" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:2087
translate schinese m13choice7_2_05a2707c:

    # v "Here's the clip, [name]."
    v "这是那个夹子，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2088
translate schinese m13choice7_2_d6145642:

    # v "Its acquisition merely required the sacrifice of my frontal bone's integrity."
    v "为了拿到它，我可是牺牲了我额骨的完整性啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2089
translate schinese m13choice7_2_ba74e6dd:

    # MC "You'll live."
    MC "你死不了的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2090
translate schinese m13choice7_2_70c4c975:

    # v "Oh, but I don't think I will."
    v "噢，可我觉得我会死呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2091
translate schinese m13choice7_2_b871f092:

    # v "Please kiss it better, I need it oh so badly!"
    v "快亲亲它帮我治治吧，我太需要这个了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2092
translate schinese m13choice7_2_4bebaf1b:

    # MC "Uh huh. And how would you react if I jumped at the opportunity?"
    MC "是啊是啊。如果我真的顺势而为，你会作何反应？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2093
translate schinese m13choice7_2_1b2124b1:

    # v "I would become flustered and plead for you to stop in a panicked manner."
    v "我会变得手忙脚乱，惊慌失措地求你停下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2094
translate schinese m13choice7_2_4bfa830a:

    # MC "You really jump between teasing and honesty at the blink of an eye."
    MC "你真的能在戏谑和坦诚之间瞬间切换。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2097
translate schinese m13choice7_2_32ef26b0:

    # v "As a consolation prize she's parted with this oil."
    v "作为安慰奖，她把这瓶油交了出来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2098
translate schinese m13choice7_2_760d9faa:

    # MC "That looks kind of expensive."
    MC "看起来挺贵的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2099
translate schinese m13choice7_2_ca2b8796:

    # v "Transitively enhanced... mind focusing... muscle repairing..."
    v "传导增强……精神集中……肌肉修复……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2100
translate schinese m13choice7_2_f4210914:

    # v "It's light, though. Only enough for one application."
    v "不过分量很少，只够用一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2101
translate schinese m13choice7_2_0193ff90:

    # v "Let's make a deal. You can't find a use for that before the end of the meet, and you give it to me."
    v "我们做个交易吧。要是直到大会结束你都没用上它，就把它给我。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2102
translate schinese m13choice7_2_00499ab6:

    # v "I'd love to try it out."
    v "我很想试试看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2104
translate schinese m13choice7_2_cc720a9c:

    # MC "Too bad for you but I think I already has a use for this."
    MC "真不凑巧，但我已经想好这东西怎么用了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2105
translate schinese m13choice7_2_a7d13a67:

    # v "Interesting. Lead the way to this use of yours."
    v "有意思。带我去看看你的用法吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2107
translate schinese m13choice7_2_2543de57:

    # MC "Deal."
    MC "成交。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2108
translate schinese m13choice7_2_ca56d616:

    # v "Excellent, lets move on, shall we?"
    v "太好了，那我们继续吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2111
translate schinese m13choice7_3_33332ebc:

    # MCt "Fuck!"
    MCt "操！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2112
translate schinese m13choice7_3_c6bc31c5:

    # MCt "If I go for it now and get caught, there's probably no way we'll be able to get it again."
    MCt "如果现在动手却被发现，恐怕就再也没机会弄到手了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2113
translate schinese m13choice7_3_f82d9a87:

    # MC "We should try to get it at another time. Keep an eye on her for another opportunity."
    MC "我们应该找个别的时机。继续盯着她，等待下一个机会。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2114
translate schinese m13choice7_3_dffa31bb:

    # v "I don't think there will be another."
    v "我觉得不会再有机会了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2117
translate schinese m13choice7_3_9c33ceec:

    # v "It's gone."
    v "没戏了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2118
translate schinese m13choice7_3_19570c32:

    # MC "What?"
    MC "什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2119
translate schinese m13choice7_3_126c51ad:

    # v "Her gait. It pushed the hair clip deeper into her swimsuit."
    v "是她的步态——发夹又往泳衣深处陷了一截。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2120
translate schinese m13choice7_3_18c7894a:

    # v "For all we know the clip has gone {i}inside{/i} her."
    v "谁知道呢，也许发夹已经钻进她{i}体内{/i}了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2121
translate schinese m13choice7_3_1bf11f4e:

    # MC "Yeah, there's no way I'm believing that."
    MC "我才不信呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2122
translate schinese m13choice7_3_a838e2b7:

    # v "Well, why don't you go check for yourself."
    v "那你何不自己去看看呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2123
translate schinese m13choice7_3_14ad655c:

    # MC "I don't want to go to jail."
    MC "我可不想坐牢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2126
translate schinese m13choice7_3_fa446544:

    # v "We're going to have to hope that Hannah can cope without it."
    v "我们只能指望汉娜在没有它的情况下也能应付得来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2127
translate schinese m13choice7_3_81dde655:

    # v "I hope she's trained efficiently."
    v "希望她受过有效的训练。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2128
translate schinese m13choice7_3_bacff008:

    # v "C'mon. Let's move on."
    v "来吧，我们继续。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2139
translate schinese m13choice7_3_e18e88b3:

    # kidg "Hey, boss. You sure Mikey's got the stuff?"
    kidg "嘿，老大。你确定迈基能搞定吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2140
translate schinese m13choice7_3_00bb8fb0:

    # kidb "Mikey will come through. He always has done so far."
    kidb "迈基会搞定的。他以前从没让人失望过。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2141
translate schinese m13choice7_3_55b1a1e8:

    # kidg "*Tsk* You always say that, boss. What about the last guy? Joey One Nose?"
    kidg "*啧*，老大，你总是这么说。那上一个家伙呢？“独鼻乔伊”？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2142
translate schinese m13choice7_3_52f3edbd:

    # kidg "And the guy before that? Frankie?"
    kidg "还有再上一个呢？弗兰基？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2145
translate schinese m13choice7_3_eb862de7:

    # kidb "Like I said..."
    kidb "就像我说的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2146
translate schinese m13choice7_3_05f37f4b:

    # kidb "Mikey will come through. Because if he don't..."
    kidb "迈基会搞定的。因为如果他不这么做……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2147
translate schinese m13choice7_3_07a5407a:

    # kidb "We break his legs."
    kidb "我们就打断他的腿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2148
translate schinese m13choice7_3_bd62045b:

    # kidb "Besides. He's got an easy task. Ain't no way he can mess this up."
    kidb "再说，这活儿简单得很，他绝不可能搞砸。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2151
translate schinese m13choice7_3_260776a7:

    # kidgo "I dunno about this one, boss."
    kidgo "老大，这事儿我有点拿不准。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2152
translate schinese m13choice7_3_aca6a9e6:

    # kidb "Can it, Vinnie!"
    kidb "闭嘴，维尼！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2153
translate schinese m13choice7_3_6211dd23:

    # kidgo "Doooh!"
    kidgo "呃！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2156
translate schinese m13choice7_3_c466aba4:

    # kidg "Hey, so what kinda stuff are we slippin' her?"
    kidg "嘿，那我们要给她下什么药？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2157
translate schinese m13choice7_3_e22b7b8e:

    # kidb "Just a little something-something."
    kidb "就一点点小玩意儿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2158
translate schinese m13choice7_3_983403c9:

    # kidb "Don't wanna arouse any suspicion, what with the blues being on our tails."
    kidb "毕竟条子正盯着咱们呢，可不能引起怀疑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2159
translate schinese m13choice7_3_98e556e2:

    # kidb "It's a tiny depressant is all. Gonna hit her just enough so she loses for sure, but in a realistic way."
    kidb "只是一种微量的抑制剂。药效刚好能让她输掉比赛，而且看起来还挺自然的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2160
translate schinese m13choice7_3_28f837ad:

    # kidg "Ey, a depressant? I'm all for doping her up but ain't making her depressed a little evil compared to our usual shtick?"
    kidg "嘿，抑制剂？给她下药我没意见，但让她变得抑郁……跟咱们平时的手段比起来，这会不会有点太缺德了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2164
translate schinese m13choice7_3_7cf7550c:

    # kidb "That ain't what a depressant does, dumbass. It slows reaction times."
    kidb "抑制剂可不是那个意思，你个蠢货。这会减慢反应速度。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2165
translate schinese m13choice7_3_07f87dd6:

    # kidb "Are you skipping out on biology class or something?"
    kidb "你们这是逃了生物课还是怎么着？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2166
translate schinese m13choice7_3_92b8b2d8:

    # kidgo "Yeah, you tell him, boss!"
    kidgo "说得好，老大！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2167
translate schinese m13choice7_3_5f8bb8cc:

    # kidb "Shut it, Vinnie!"
    kidb "闭嘴，维尼！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2168
translate schinese m13choice7_3_6211dd23_1:

    # kidgo "Doooh!"
    kidgo "呃！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2172
translate schinese m13choice7_3_15fb725f:

    # MC "These kids have no self awareness..."
    MC "这些孩子真是一点自知之明都没有……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2173
translate schinese m13choice7_3_5417a588:

    # v "Indeed. We're not even hiding, yet they're airing their dirty laundry like a couple on the brink of divorce."
    v "确实。我们甚至都没藏起来，他们却像一对濒临离婚的夫妻一样，把家丑全都抖落出来了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2174
translate schinese m13choice7_3_1c4a6ed1:

    # MC "Who do you think their target is?"
    MC "你觉得他们的目标是谁？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2175
translate schinese m13choice7_3_9e07001d:

    # v "No idea. It's one of the girls swimming today, clearly."
    v "不知道。显然，那是今天参赛的其中一名女生。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2176
translate schinese m13choice7_3_9e28e146:

    # v "If it's one of ours, that's big trouble."
    v "如果是我们这边的人，那就麻烦大了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2177
translate schinese m13choice7_3_2530b31f:

    # v "Conversely, if it isn't, that's a boost to our chances."
    v "反之，如果不是，那对我们来说反而是个利好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2178
translate schinese m13choice7_3_4e92faea:

    # MC "It makes sense that they'd target someone who already has high chances."
    MC "他们把目标锁定在胜算较高的人身上，这倒也合情合理。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2179
translate schinese m13choice7_3_9e07696a:

    # MC "You think it's Grace?"
    MC "你觉得是格蕾丝吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2180
translate schinese m13choice7_3_56044ea4:

    # v "Possibly."
    v "有可能。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2181
translate schinese m13choice7_3_75955423:

    # MC "Then we should..."
    MC "那我们应该……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2182
translate schinese m13choice7_3_40d14200:

    # v "Find this Mikey and put a stop to this plan."
    v "找到那个叫迈基的人，阻止这个计划。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2184
translate schinese m13choice7_3_86a30341:

    # MC "I uh... I think I know where this Mikey is."
    MC "我……呃……我想我知道迈基在哪儿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2185
translate schinese m13choice7_3_eb40eab1:

    # v "Good. That makes our lives easier."
    v "很好。这下事情就简单多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2186
translate schinese m13choice7_3_29498adb:

    # v "Lead the way."
    v "带路吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2188
translate schinese m13choice7_3_ae16aefb:

    # v "We should start moving in case we bump into him."
    v "我们该出发了，免得错过了他。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2199
translate schinese m13grace_f60accb8:

    # g "*Nghh*"
    g "*唔*"

# game/script2.rpyc:2200
translate schinese m13grace_bb32251e:

    # "{i}{u}Swimmer" "Hey, 'Neeta. Thanks for coming."
    "{i}{u}游泳者" "Hey,嘿，妮塔。谢谢你过来。

# game/script2.rpyc:2201
translate schinese m13grace_2b8cf8e5:

    # v "I wouldn't want to miss this now, would I, Freda?"
    v "我怎么会错过这个呢，芙蕾达？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2202
translate schinese m13grace_1eb309d9:

    # freda "And who's this with you? Nice to meet you, I'm Freda."
    freda "这位跟你一起来的是谁？很高兴见到你，我是芙蕾达。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2203
translate schinese m13grace_5668a760:

    # MC "[name]."
    MC "[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2204
translate schinese m13grace_74336503:

    # MC "I'm actually not with Vineeta, I'm with Grace. My pairing with Vineeta is a happy accident."
    MC "其实我不是和维妮塔一队的，我是和格蕾丝一队的。我和维妮塔搭档纯属巧合。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2205
translate schinese m13grace_a2a11936:

    # MC "That makes four team members I've encountered. Is that all of you?"
    MC "这样我就遇到四个团队成员了。就你们四个吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2208
translate schinese m13grace_710c35d8:

    # freda "For today's meet, yeah. Four races, I'm up last."
    freda "就今天的比赛而言，是的。一共四场比赛，我是最后一个上场。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2209
translate schinese m13grace_b885ce67:

    # MC "Is that a good or bad thing for you? It's a lot of pressure, but you get to know exactly what place you need to secure a win, or if a win is even possible."
    MC "这对你来说是好事还是坏事？压力很大，但你能确切知道自己需要拿到什么名次才能锁定胜局，或者甚至判断是否还有获胜的可能。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2210
translate schinese m13grace_45450aa5:

    # freda "Well, I don't have a choice. I'm the captain. We all do the last one."
    freda "嗯，我没得选。我是队长，最后一棒都是由我来跑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2211
translate schinese m13grace_a65af2c8:

    # MC "You're the captain? Cool! So you coordinate the whole team?"
    MC "你是队长？太酷了！那你负责统筹整个团队吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2212
translate schinese m13grace_94265dd2:

    # freda "Almost the whole team..."
    freda "差不多是整个团队吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2215
translate schinese m13grace_e285de95:

    # freda "Geniuses don't need coordinating."
    freda "天才是不需要协调的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2216
translate schinese m13grace_ffc6c8d5:

    # freda "I don't even need to think about Grace. Honestly she should be more qualified than I am to be captain given her abilities."
    freda "我根本不用操心格蕾丝的事。老实说，论能力，她比我更有资格当队长。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2217
translate schinese m13grace_ed9e582b:

    # freda "She's also a fantastic instructor. She can spot flaws in techniques from a mile away."
    freda "她也是位出色的指导教练，一眼就能看出技术动作里的瑕疵。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2218
translate schinese m13grace_718edca1:

    # freda "But no. Her leadership skills are lacking, and while her organization skills are great, she's only good at organizing herself. Give her a team of girls and it quickly becomes a mess."
    freda "但问题在于，她缺乏领导力。虽然她很擅长安排事务，但也仅限于安排她自己；一旦让她带队，场面很快就会变得一团糟。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2219
translate schinese m13grace_5a9df84f:

    # freda "Her dietary and lifestyle advice is... How do I put this?"
    freda "至于她在饮食和生活方式上的建议……该怎么说呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2220
translate schinese m13grace_4594d755:

    # freda "Wrong."
    freda "完全是错的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2223
translate schinese m13grace_178c82e4:

    # freda "Anyway, I don't mean to waste your time. You're here to see Grace, aren't you?"
    freda "总之，我不想浪费你的时间。你是来找格蕾丝的吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2227
translate schinese m13choice3_1_dfa2e7e7:

    # freda "She's all yours. I guess I'll swap her out for Vineeta."
    freda "她就交给你了。我想我会换维妮塔来接替她。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2228
translate schinese m13choice3_1_3df0522d:

    # v "Oh, please be gentle."
    v "噢，请务必手下留情。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2233
translate schinese m13choice3_1_3ae11330:

    # MC "Grace. How you holding up?"
    MC "格蕾丝。你感觉怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2234
translate schinese m13choice3_1_a779e3d7:

    # g "[name]."
    g "[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2235
translate schinese m13choice3_1_0654b1f3:

    # MC "Yes?"
    MC "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2236
translate schinese m13choice3_1_f7e16cfc:

    # g "We had a good run."
    g "我们这一路走来很精彩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2237
translate schinese m13choice3_1_f4d3315f:

    # MC "I don't think I understand."
    MC "我不太明白你的意思。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2241
translate schinese m13choice3_1_b1cba495:

    # g "I just want you to know that you're my best friend."
    g "我只是想让你知道，你是我最好的朋友。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2242
translate schinese m13choice3_1_43728caa:

    # g "I'm going to miss you."
    g "我会想你的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2243
translate schinese m13choice3_1_468e33dc:

    # MC "Oh, don't be so dramatic. You'll be fine."
    MC "噢，别这么煽情。你会没事的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2244
translate schinese m13choice3_1_63ff9305:

    # MC "If anything, you're {i}over{/i} preparing. I don't see anyone else getting in last-minute stretches."
    MC "说真的，你准备得有点过头了。我没见别人还在做最后的拉伸运动。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2250
translate schinese m13choice3_1_21c8c684:

    # g "Eh... you're right... I'm doing it to stay calm..."
    g "嗯……你说得对……我这么做是为了让自己保持冷静……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2251
translate schinese m13choice3_1_40ec54f0:

    # g "I haven't been keeping track of time."
    g "我都没留意时间。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2252
translate schinese m13choice3_1_e3d37c75:

    # g "Do you think I should stop?"
    g "你觉得我该停下来吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2255
translate schinese m13choice4_1_1c495496:

    # MC "Probably. You might tire yourself out before you even begin."
    MC "大概吧。你可能会在还没开始之前就把自己累垮了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2258
translate schinese m13choice4_1_7173f465:

    # MC "Do you always get this worked up about these big events?"
    MC "面对这种大型活动，你总是这么紧张吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2259
translate schinese m13choice4_1_47a95899:

    # g "I don't know. This is my first non-exhibition one."
    g "我不知道。这是我第一次参加非表演性质的比赛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2262
translate schinese m13choice4_1_87185600:

    # mer "Who cares?"
    mer "谁在乎呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2263
translate schinese m13choice4_1_e9add90e:

    # g "Meryl?"
    g "梅瑞尔？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2264
translate schinese m13choice4_1_a390a000:

    # mer "Stop being such a whiny dumbass. You {i}know{/i} what kind of times you get."
    mer "别再像个蠢货一样抱怨个没完了。你{i}知道{/i}自己平常能游出什么样的成绩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2265
translate schinese m13choice4_1_00f3b5de:

    # mer "This race will be a cinch for you."
    mer "这场比赛对你来说简直是小菜一碟。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2268
translate schinese m13choice4_1_90e16873:

    # g "What if I mess up though?"
    g "可万一我搞砸了呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2269
translate schinese m13choice4_1_00163f4d:

    # mer "How?"
    mer "怎么搞砸？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2270
translate schinese m13choice4_1_6799babc:

    # g "Like, what if I swim in the wrong direction or something?"
    g "比如，万一我游错方向之类的呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2271
translate schinese m13choice4_1_9ba8240a:

    # mer "Oh my god. You're actually an idiot."
    mer "天哪。你简直是个笨蛋。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2274
translate schinese m13choice4_1_77aae284:

    # mer "Is she always this stupid?"
    mer "她平时也这么蠢吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2275
translate schinese m13choice4_1_2a36bd0d:

    # MC "No, she quite scholarly on normal days."
    MC "不，她平时挺有书卷气的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2276
translate schinese m13choice4_1_5ee3d844:

    # mer "*sigh*"
    mer "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:2277
translate schinese m13choice4_1_d66659ac:

    # mer "I'm just gonna leave her to it. She can beat herself up all she wants."
    mer "我就随她去吧。她爱怎么自责都行。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2278
translate schinese m13choice4_1_9e9e9aac:

    # mer "She's winning regardless. Maybe once this is over hindsight will also tell her how stupid she's being."
    mer "反正她肯定会赢的。也许等这一切结束，回过头来她就会意识到自己有多蠢了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2282
translate schinese m13choice4_2_917e5685:

    # MC "It's fine, just... Don't overdo it, you know?"
    MC "没关系，只是……别做得太过火了，懂吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2283
translate schinese m13choice4_2_a8680038:

    # g "...Sure..."
    g "……嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2286
translate schinese m13choice4_2_7173f465:

    # MC "Do you always get this worked up about these big events?"
    MC "面对这种大型活动，你总是这么紧张吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2287
translate schinese m13choice4_2_47a95899:

    # g "I don't know. This is my first non-exhibition one."
    g "我不知道。这是我第一次参加非表演性质的比赛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2290
translate schinese m13choice4_2_87185600:

    # mer "Who cares?"
    mer "谁在乎呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2291
translate schinese m13choice4_2_e9add90e:

    # g "Meryl?"
    g "梅瑞尔？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2292
translate schinese m13choice4_2_a390a000:

    # mer "Stop being such a whiny dumbass. You {i}know{/i} what kind of times you get."
    mer "别再像个蠢货一样抱怨个没完了。你{i}知道{/i}自己平常能游出什么样的成绩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2293
translate schinese m13choice4_2_00f3b5de:

    # mer "This race will be a cinch for you."
    mer "这场比赛对你来说简直是小菜一碟。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2296
translate schinese m13choice4_2_90e16873:

    # g "What if I mess up though?"
    g "可万一我搞砸了呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2297
translate schinese m13choice4_2_00163f4d:

    # mer "How?"
    mer "怎么搞砸？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2298
translate schinese m13choice4_2_6799babc:

    # g "Like, what if I swim in the wrong direction or something?"
    g "比如，万一我游错方向之类的呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2299
translate schinese m13choice4_2_9ba8240a:

    # mer "Oh my god. You're actually an idiot."
    mer "天哪。你简直是个笨蛋。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2300
translate schinese m13choice4_2_6cd598ed:

    # mer "Look at you and your stupid over-the-top stretches."
    mer "瞧你做的那些夸张又滑稽的拉伸动作。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2301
translate schinese m13choice4_2_582d6bea:

    # mer "You'll be fine, trust me."
    mer "你会没事的，相信我。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2321
translate schinese m13choice4_2_98cf72a1:

    # mer "Good luck. I'll see you after your race."
    mer "祝你好运。比赛结束后见。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2329
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_93b5e667:

    # g "*sigh* Sorry, [name]. I'm not used to this pressure."
    g "*叹气* 抱歉，[name]。我不太适应这种压力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2330
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_c25a4910:

    # MC "Well, maybe you'll {i}get{/i} used to it."
    MC "嗯，也许你会{i}习惯{/i}的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2331
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_5c65eb0c:

    # g "I need some more time to think. Thanks for checking on me."
    g "我还需要点时间考虑一下。谢谢你的关心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2332
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_b713e04b:

    # MC "Sure thing, Grace. You've got this."
    MC "没问题，格蕾丝。你一定能行的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2333
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_e5832ab5:

    # g "I sure hope so."
    g "真希望如此。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2336
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_b44c36fe:

    # freda "All done?"
    freda "都弄好了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2337
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_8d000ade:

    # MC "All done."
    MC "好了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2338
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_7e486144:

    # v "Shall we continue our adventure, [name]?"
    v "我们要继续我们的冒险吗，[name]？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2339
translate schinese m13afterchoice4_cb08087a:

    # MC "Probably an inappropriately grand description of what we're doing, but yes, let's adventure away."
    MC "把我们正在做的事称为“冒险”或许有点言过其实，不过……好吧，那就去冒险吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2342
translate schinese m13choice3_2_85ae4130:

    # MC "Looks like she's deep in focus. I'll leave her to it."
    MC "看来她正全神贯注。我就不打扰她了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2343
translate schinese m13choice3_2_cc279e27:

    # freda "Sounds like the right choice. She may be bending under the pressure right now, but I know she won't break."
    freda "听起来是个正确的选择。她现在或许正承受着压力，但我知道她不会被压垮的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2346
translate schinese m13choice3_2_7e486144:

    # v "Shall we continue our adventure, [name]?"
    v "我们要继续我们的冒险吗，[name]？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2347
translate schinese m13choice3_2_cb08087a:

    # MC "Probably an inappropriately grand description of what we're doing, but yes, let's adventure away."
    MC "把我们正在做的事称为“冒险”或许有点言过其实，不过……好吧，那就去冒险吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2365
translate schinese m13vineeta_a5755864:

    # v "I believe I've lost sight of the pool."
    v "我想我已经看不见那个水池了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2366
translate schinese m13vineeta_92aad5d9:

    # MC "We have time."
    MC "我们有时间。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2367
translate schinese m13vineeta_fbf0ce29:

    # v "For sitting? You know we gave up our seats for this?"
    v "坐着的时间？你知道我们为了这个可是放弃了座位的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2368
translate schinese m13vineeta_f9ec9983:

    # MC "For talking."
    MC "聊天的时间。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2369
translate schinese m13vineeta_3202d7b3:

    # v "You brought me here to talk?"
    v "你带我来这儿就是为了聊天？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2370
translate schinese m13vineeta_690b7417:

    # MC "Sure."
    MC "当然。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2373
translate schinese m13vineeta_16b43e02:

    # v "Did you have to choose somewhere so romantic?"
    v "非得选个这么浪漫的地方吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2374
translate schinese m13vineeta_f45ae591:

    # MC "Your hopes sure are high, aren't they? Calling {i}this{/i} romantic."
    MC "你的期望值还挺高的嘛，对吧？把{i}这{/i}称为浪漫。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2375
translate schinese m13vineeta_54908123:

    # v "Ah, forgive me, I have such little experience with such matters."
    v "啊，请见谅，我对这类事情实在没什么经验。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2376
translate schinese m13vineeta_f62ad026:

    # v "I'm actually not great at understanding my own feelings."
    v "其实，我不太擅长理解自己的感情。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2379
translate schinese m13vineeta_f06886ac:

    # v "I used to think I had a crush on Chloe, you know."
    v "你知道吗，我以前还以为自己喜欢克洛伊呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2380
translate schinese m13vineeta_b925e4f2:

    # MC "You have a crush on Chloe?!"
    MC "你喜欢克洛伊？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2381
translate schinese m13vineeta_afafbeff:

    # v "I {i}thought{/i} I did."
    v "我{i}以为{/i}是这样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2382
translate schinese m13vineeta_fbfb34cd:

    # v "She's the only friend I've ever had. I couldn't figure out why I liked her so much."
    v "她是我唯一的朋友。我当时搞不懂自己为什么那么喜欢她。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2383
translate schinese m13vineeta_f6cee679:

    # v "In my anti-social naivety I came to the conclusion that..."
    v "出于那种不善社交的懵懂天真，我得出了一个结论……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2386
translate schinese m13vineeta_34f7bbf2:

    # v "\"This must be love.\""
    v "“这肯定就是爱情。”"

# game/script2.rpyc:2387
translate schinese m13vineeta_35231c3d:

    # MC "So you're not in love with her?"
    MC "所以你并不爱她？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2388
translate schinese m13vineeta_f853d4c2:

    # v "I adore her. But no. It isn't romantic."
    v "我很喜欢她。但不是那种爱。那不是浪漫之情。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2389
translate schinese m13vineeta_5e4bda5b:

    # v "We're all walking along this journey called Life."
    v "我们都在走过名为“人生”的旅程。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2390
translate schinese m13vineeta_527232e9:

    # v "My journey of self discovery is more like a mountain."
    v "我的自我探索之旅更像是在攀登一座山。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2391
translate schinese m13vineeta_236afc28:

    # v "So it takes me a little longer than other people to figure these things out."
    v "所以我花在弄明白这些事情上的时间，比别人要长一些。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2394
translate schinese m13vineeta_4479ad9a:

    # MC "You seem sure of yourself to me."
    MC "但在我看来，你对自己很有把握。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2397
translate schinese m13vineeta_187e9f77:

    # v "That's because I speak with such conviction."
    v "那是因为我说话时语气很坚定。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2398
translate schinese m13vineeta_959b0bc4:

    # v "You don't know what you don't know. And you, specifically, don't know which topics I'm avoiding."
    v "有些事你是不知道自己不知道的。尤其是，你不知道我在回避哪些话题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2399
translate schinese m13vineeta_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2406
translate schinese m13choice5_1_781ee7f6:

    # v "Oh, wow! How astute! I didn't expect that from you, at least not so soon."
    v "哇！真敏锐！真没想到你会这么说，至少没想到这么快。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2407
translate schinese m13choice5_1_1ad0735e:

    # MC "So you are?"
    MC "所以你是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2410
translate schinese m13choice5_1_55189738:

    # v "Nope!"
    v "不是！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2411
translate schinese m13choice5_1_89d585f8:

    # v "At least not enough to warrant medical intervention."
    v "至少还没严重到需要医疗干预的程度。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2414
translate schinese m13choice5_1_45be82bd:

    # v "Just like yourself, some teachers and childhood development professionals considered it."
    v "就像你一样，当时也有老师和儿童发展专家考虑过这个问题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2415
translate schinese m13choice5_1_204edba4:

    # v "So my mother took me to get tested."
    v "所以我妈带我去做了检查。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2416
translate schinese m13choice5_1_c2ec6d5e:

    # v "And while I came close, the score was just a little less than what's required to be diagnosed with mild autism."
    v "虽然结果很接近，但得分还是差了一点，没达到轻度自闭症的诊断标准。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2417
translate schinese m13choice5_1_0e559e04:

    # v "I'd have to say that sounds about right, I have an easy time understanding metaphors and idioms."
    v "我觉得这说法挺准的，我理解隐喻和习语都没什么困难。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2418
translate schinese m13choice5_1_6ff1543f:

    # v "I like to think that I understand how others are feeling, and you may be noticing right now..."
    v "我自认为能理解别人的感受，而且你现在可能也注意到了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2419
translate schinese m13choice5_1_3a881c0a:

    # v "Eye contact is no problem."
    v "眼神交流也没问题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2422
translate schinese m13choice5_1_9c8d6bfa:

    # v "Shortcomings include bluntness-"
    v "缺点包括说话太直——"

# game/script2.rpyc:2423
translate schinese m13choice5_1_b621f610:

    # MC "I noticed."
    MC "我注意到了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2426
translate schinese m13choice5_1_be63fe06:

    # v "Even though I try so hard? [name], how cruel!"
    v "明明我这么努力了？[name]，真过分啊！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2427
translate schinese m13choice5_1_32b0f5bb:

    # MC "Sorry."
    MC "抱歉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2429
translate schinese m13choice5_1_d1bedcdb:

    # v "Oh, I jest. I'm aware of how often I skip the steps of social etiquette."
    v "啊，我开玩笑的。我知道自己经常跳过社交礼仪的步骤。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2430
translate schinese m13choice5_1_750e81d7:

    # v "In addition, there's the fact that I have a hard time understanding my own thoughts and emotions that I alluded to earlier."
    v "此外，还有我之前提到的——我很难理解自己的想法和情绪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2431
translate schinese m13choice5_1_c6ac31ac:

    # v "My academic performance might be related, but smart people exist, I could just be one of them."
    v "这或许和我的学业表现有关，但也可能只是因为我很聪明——毕竟聪明人确实存在，我也许就是其中之一。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2432
translate schinese m13choice5_1_b38e1a4b:

    # MC "What about physical contact?"
    MC "那身体接触呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2435
translate schinese m13choice5_1_1a7b8438:

    # v "That's a little..."
    v "那个有点……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2436
translate schinese m13choice5_1_81ef8ef5:

    # v "Yeah, I'm not great with it..."
    v "是啊，我不太擅长那个……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2437
translate schinese m13choice5_1_0b46f95f:

    # MC "Is it hypersensitivity?"
    MC "是因为触觉过敏吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2440
translate schinese m13choice5_1_23721f60:

    # v "Would you like to hold my hand and find out?"
    v "你想牵着我的手试试看吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2443
translate schinese m13choice6_1_89abb102:

    # MC "Sounds like a challenge."
    MC "听起来像是个挑战。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2444
translate schinese m13choice6_1_5406b805:

    # v "I assure you this is more of a challenge for me than it would ever be for you."
    v "我向你保证，这对我的挑战远比对你要大得多。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2447
translate schinese m13choice6_1_7ec6e09f:

    # MC "Then why would you offer?"
    MC "那你为什么要提议呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2448
translate schinese m13choice6_1_f422aea0:

    # v "You can consider this as me being playful. Adventurous, even."
    v "你可以把它看作是我在开玩笑。甚至可以说……有些大胆。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2449
translate schinese m13choice6_1_30793003:

    # MC "So? How does it feel? Overstimulating or something?"
    MC "所以呢？感觉怎么样？是不是刺激过度了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2450
translate schinese m13choice6_1_538fcac1:

    # v "Is that why you took such a delicate touch? You're so considerate."
    v "所以你才动作那么轻柔吗？你真体贴。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2453
translate schinese m13choice6_1_be490b38:

    # v "No. It's not an issue of over-stimulation."
    v "不，并不是刺激过度的问题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2454
translate schinese m13choice6_1_66f65615:

    # v "Brief moments of contact are fine, handshakes, high-fives."
    v "短暂的接触没关系，比如握手、击掌之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2455
translate schinese m13choice6_1_86f4aeb4:

    # v "It's anything that's..."
    v "问题在于那些……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2458
translate schinese m13choice6_1_258312e1:

    # v "That's..."
    v "那是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2459
translate schinese m13choice6_1_909f9102:

    # v "*Nghh* It's anything that's more involved, intense...-"
    v "*唔* 那些更深入、更强烈的接触……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2460
translate schinese m13choice6_1_61870bdd:

    # v "I-... intimate that-"
    v "我……我是说，比那更亲密的——"

# game/script2.rpyc:2463
translate schinese m13choice6_1_761e6d6c:

    # v "Sorry. It seems I've reached my limit."
    v "抱歉。看来我到极限了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2464
translate schinese m13choice6_1_b82eb6b5:

    # MC "That's pretty bad, to crumble after a few seconds of gentle hand-holding."
    MC "真糟糕啊，才被轻轻牵了几秒钟的手就崩溃了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2467
translate schinese m13choice6_1_c7d532ea:

    # v "Indeed."
    v "确实。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2468
translate schinese m13choice6_1_5642c992:

    # v "Thank you for participating in my little experiment."
    v "谢谢你参与我的小实验。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2469
translate schinese m13choice6_1_4c6b60af:

    # v "I thought maybe the conversation could help me maintain composure. But alas..."
    v "我本以为交谈能帮我保持镇定。但唉……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2471
translate schinese m13choice6_2_0faf4dff:

    # MC "No need to sacrifice your comfort for my curiosity... Or entertainment."
    MC "没必要为了满足我的好奇心……或者说娱乐消遣……而牺牲你的舒适感。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2472
translate schinese m13choice6_2_ab9894b7:

    # v "I suppose not."
    v "确实没必要。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2477
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_23c1db6a:

    # MC "Do you prefer being called \"Vineeta\" or \"'Neeta\"?"
    MC "你更喜欢别人叫你“维妮塔”还是“妮塔”？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2478
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_caf3377b:

    # v "I'm indifferent."
    v "我都无所谓。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2479
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_b63fbc24:

    # v "Affectionate little nicknames are nice. They definitely indicate that I'm fitting in to a degree."
    v "亲昵的小名挺好的。这无疑表明我多少融入了这个圈子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2481
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_5502a890:

    # MC "Did those girls come up with it on their own?"
    MC "那是那几个女孩自己想出来的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2482
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_0e3a929a:

    # v "Hm?"
    v "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2483
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_18bcd595:

    # MC "Grace and Freda. They both called you \"'Neeta\"."
    MC "格蕾丝和芙蕾达。她们俩都管你叫“妮塔”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2485
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_550e2306:

    # MC "Did Grace come up with it on her own?"
    MC "那是格蕾丝自己想出来的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2486
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_0e3a929a_1:

    # v "Hm?"
    v "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2487
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_e8faf061:

    # MC "She called you \"'Neeta\"."
    MC "她管你叫“妮塔”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2488
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_b47c4b75:

    # MC "By your assessment, it sounds like you're fitting in."
    MC "照你这么说，看来你已经融入其中了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2489
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_78f7b82a:

    # v "I haven't been rejected. That's for sure."
    v "我没被排挤，这是肯定的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2490
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_a4c5002a:

    # v "But don't overestimate the difficulty of acquiring a nickname from another girl."
    v "不过，别把女生之间起绰号这件事看得太重。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2491
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_64588c1f:

    # MC "Hmm, true. They do throw nicknames around pretty quickly."
    MC "嗯，确实。她们给别人起绰号可是很快的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2494
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_6c29c9cf:

    # v "So there you go, we're friendly with each other, but I wouldn't place that much importance on a nickname from a girl."
    v "所以就是这样，我们关系不错，但我不会太在意女生起的绰号。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2495
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_9c4e10ee:

    # MC "How about from a guy?"
    MC "那如果是男人这么叫呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2496
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_fe239b48:

    # v "A little bit more of a challenge to acquire."
    v "那可就没那么容易接受了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2497
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_4081675a:

    # v "Though some men jump very quickly into using pet-names as a way to initiate courtship."
    v "不过，有些男人确实会急着套近乎，一上来就用这种亲昵的称呼。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2498
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_21ec2c2b:

    # v "Needless to say the thought of that makes my skin crawl."
    v "不用说，光是想到那个，我就浑身起鸡皮疙瘩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2499
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_1056f0ab:

    # MC "Hmm... Then..."
    MC "嗯……那么……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2500
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_22e583eb:

    # MC "'Neeta?"
    MC "妮塔？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2506
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_65cabcbf:

    # v "..."
    v "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2507
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_047666dd:

    # v "No."
    v "不。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2508
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_181e2ff0:

    # v "I didn't like that at all."
    v "我一点也不喜欢那个。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2509
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_9d9ec7af:

    # MC "Ha! Never mind then."
    MC "哈！那就算了吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2510
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_2e4ece4b:

    # MC "Something wrong with how I said it?"
    MC "是我说话的方式有什么问题吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2511
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_4fa4fa0e:

    # v "I dunno."
    v "我不知道。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2514
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_5396e4e9:

    # v "We should be heading back."
    v "我们该回去了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2515
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_81b2b0c5:

    # v "We've wasted enough time here."
    v "我们在这儿浪费的时间够多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2516
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_396003fe:

    # v "Ah, sorry, \"wasted\" was a poor choice of a word."
    v "啊，抱歉，用“浪费”这个词不太恰当。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2517
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_066a60e5:

    # v "I very much enjoy talking to you but I'm sure you understand."
    v "我很享受和你聊天，但我相信你能理解。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2518
translate schinese m13afterchoice5_443aefdf:

    # MC "Grace would kill me, I completely understand."
    MC "格蕾丝会杀了我的，我完全理解。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2531
translate schinese m13bathroom_52141fa3:

    # MC "Hey, I've gotta take a leak."
    MC "嘿，我得去撒个尿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2532
translate schinese m13bathroom_e4135010:

    # v "I'll wait."
    v "我等你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2613
translate schinese m13bathroom_f99ec0c2:

    # MCt "This kid..."
    MCt "这孩子……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2628
translate schinese m13bathroom_7148ff23:

    # v "All done?"
    v "都弄好了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2629
translate schinese m13bathroom_da27f825:

    # MC "Would I be back out here if I wasn't?"
    MC "如果不是的话，我会回到这儿来吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2630
translate schinese m13bathroom_db05f62d:

    # v "I applaud your tremendous dissection of my words."
    v "我对你那番细致入微的字句剖析表示赞赏。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2631
translate schinese m13bathroom_7c2ed98a:

    # v "Where to next, boss?"
    v "接下来去哪儿，老大？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2633
translate schinese m13bathroom_0fb9f8d6:

    # MCt "I should pretend to leave..."
    MCt "我得假装离开……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2638
translate schinese m13bathroom_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2639
translate schinese m13bathroom_992f1048:

    # MC "This has gotta be that fourth kid, right? Mikey?"
    MC "这肯定就是那个第四个孩子吧？迈基？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2643
translate schinese m13bathroom_4ce61a77:

    # mik "..."
    mik "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2650
translate schinese m13bathroom_8f8e4c71:

    # mik "Hey, boss. It's time. You sure you wanna go through with this?"
    mik "嘿，老大。时候到了。你确定要这么做吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2651
translate schinese m13bathroom_4ce61a77_1:

    # mik "..."
    mik "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2652
translate schinese m13bathroom_665f7cbb:

    # mik "Nah, boss. I wasn't questioning you. I need to know if you change your mind at the final moment, y'know?"
    mik "不，老大，我不是在质疑你。我只是想确认一下，万一你在最后一刻改变主意了呢，你懂吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2653
translate schinese m13bathroom_4ce61a77_2:

    # mik "..."
    mik "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2656
translate schinese m13bathroom_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2657
translate schinese m13bathroom_8cedfe83:

    # mik "Listen, I got the powder."
    mik "听着，药粉我已经弄到了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2658
translate schinese m13bathroom_8662a23f:

    # mik "Ey! No shit I measured it right! Which one of us copies the other's homework again?"
    mik "嘿！我当然量得没错！到底是谁抄谁的作业啊？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2691
translate schinese m13choice10_1_150d7348:

    # MC "I burned all of the drugs. Whoever it is. They aren't getting a dose anymore."
    MC "我把所有的药都烧了。不管那人是谁，他都别想再拿到药了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2693
translate schinese m13choice10_1_b6ccba3b:

    # v "Oh, that's excellent! Good work!"
    v "噢，那太棒了！干得好！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2701
translate schinese m13choice10_2_36ce61f8:

    # MC "You're talking awfully loud, little dude."
    MC "嗓门挺大啊，小鬼。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2702
translate schinese m13choice10_2_99febc72:

    # mik "*Tsk*"
    mik "*啧*"

# game/script2.rpyc:2703
translate schinese m13choice10_2_d6e71914:

    # MC "Lost your lunch money?"
    MC "弄丢午饭钱了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2704
translate schinese m13choice10_2_84318b40:

    # MC "Who's the mark?"
    MC "目标是谁？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2705
translate schinese m13choice10_2_6abd7297:

    # mik "I dunno what you're talking 'bout, gramps."
    mik "我不知道你在说什么，老头。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2706
translate schinese m13choice10_2_f1027248:

    # MC "Too late to play dumb, little Timmy."
    MC "现在装傻可来不及了，小蒂米。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2707
translate schinese m13choice10_2_84318b40_1:

    # MC "Who's the mark?"
    MC "目标是谁？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2710
translate schinese m13choice10_2_bf19278a:

    # mik "Listen, pal. I got the boss on speed dial."
    mik "听着，伙计。我可是能直接联系到老板的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2711
translate schinese m13choice10_2_af64fc37:

    # mik "One press of a button, and you've got a crosshair on your back."
    mik "只要按一下按钮，你就会被瞄准锁定了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2712
translate schinese m13choice10_2_f64d8a09:

    # mik "But I'm a nice guy, you see. My boss appreciates numbers."
    mik "不过我这人挺好说话的。我老板看重的是数字。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2713
translate schinese m13choice10_2_3a22163d:

    # mik "You cough up a little compensation and we can call it off."
    mik "你掏点赔偿金，这事儿就算了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2714
translate schinese m13choice10_2_532b20b4:

    # MC "Not so fast, jackass. I don't even know who the drugs are for yet."
    MC "别急啊，混蛋。我甚至还不知道这药是给谁准备的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2715
translate schinese m13choice10_2_4ce61a77:

    # mik "..."
    mik "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2718
translate schinese m13choice10_2_54f2b038:

    # mik "Yeah. Mmhm. Well, it's too late. He knows we're up to something."
    mik "是啊。嗯。不过，已经来不及了。他知道我们在搞什么名堂了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2719
translate schinese m13choice10_2_4ce61a77_1:

    # mik "..."
    mik "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2720
translate schinese m13choice10_2_3f424b48:

    # mik "That's what I told him, yeah."
    mik "我就是这么告诉他的，没错。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2721
translate schinese m13choice10_2_4ce61a77_2:

    # mik "..."
    mik "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2722
translate schinese m13choice10_2_57bbbd0a:

    # mik "Sure thing, boss."
    mik "没问题，老大。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2725
translate schinese m13choice10_2_165b6bfb:

    # mik "The mark's a girl named Freda. We ain't hurtin' her. But she ain't winning her race either."
    mik "目标是个叫芙蕾达的姑娘。我们不会伤害她，但她也别想赢下那场比赛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2726
translate schinese m13choice10_2_98ee8ab2:

    # MC "Get to the point."
    MC "说重点。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2727
translate schinese m13choice10_2_d10c8416:

    # mik "The point is: You've got three options. My boss was generous enough to give you that many."
    mik "重点是：你有三个选择。我老大够大方，给了你这么多选择。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2728
translate schinese m13choice10_2_7b0ed4fe:

    # mik "Option one: You shut up, walk out of here, and we all get on with our days."
    mik "选择一：你闭嘴，走出这儿，然后咱们各过各的日子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2729
translate schinese m13choice10_2_c439902c:

    # mik "Option two: You graciously offer us those winnings, and we'll throw out our plans."
    mik "选择二：你大方地把赢来的钱交给我们，我们就取消原定计划。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2730
translate schinese m13choice10_2_92fa8048:

    # mik "Or option three: You try to stop us by force, and shorten your lifespan by about, I dunno, seventy years or so."
    mik "或者选择三：你试图用武力阻止我们，结果就是你的寿命会缩短……嗯，大概七十年左右吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2731
translate schinese m13choice10_2_e5548bad:

    # MC "Big talk. You've already given me the name so."
    MC "口气倒不小。不过，你既然已经把名字告诉我了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2742
translate schinese m13choice10_2_7e38ed8d:

    # MCt "These kids... They're actually {i}real{/i} gangsters?"
    MCt "这些孩子……他们真的是{i}真{/i}黑帮分子？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2743
translate schinese m13choice10_2_2688d7de:

    # MCt "I should have never spoken up..."
    MCt "我真不该多嘴的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2746
translate schinese m13choice10_2_128a8dd7:

    # mik "So what'll it be? We've got guys outside, just so you know."
    mik "那么，你打算怎么做？顺便告诉你一声，我们在外面可是有人手埋伏的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2748
translate schinese m13choice10_2_98fced16:

    # mik "Oh, and by the way. We've got three-thousand Embers riding on this."
    mik "哦，对了。这件事可是押了三千“余烬”在里面的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2749
translate schinese m13choice10_2_c10b8265:

    # MCt "Shit..."
    MCt "该死……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2750
translate schinese m13choice10_2_ec04e778:

    # MCt "They gave me three options... but we both know there's only two..."
    MCt "他们给了我三个选项……但我们都知道，其实只有两个……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2754
translate schinese m13choice11_1_f294af48:

    # MC "*Tsk* Damn it."
    MC "*啧*，真倒霉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2761
translate schinese m13choice11_1_e4961af5:

    # mik "Yeah... Yeah, he came through, boss."
    mik "对……对，他照办了，老大。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2762
translate schinese m13choice11_1_12a8ef59:

    # mik "So we're calling it off?"
    mik "所以我们要取消行动了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2763
translate schinese m13choice11_1_4842439c:

    # mik "Alright."
    mik "好吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2766
translate schinese m13choice11_1_bed26133:

    # mik "A pleasure."
    mik "幸会。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2767
translate schinese m13choice11_1_89275018:

    # mik "Oh, and you're off the hook, just so you know."
    mik "噢，顺便告诉你一声，我们不会再纠缠你了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2768
translate schinese m13choice11_1_26ca2f31:

    # mik "We may be scum, but that's not how we do things. So we ain't gonna follow you for the rest of your life."
    mik "我们虽然是人渣，但做事有我们的规矩。所以，我们不会纠缠你一辈子的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2769
translate schinese m13choice11_1_4c8c4d8c:

    # mik "That girl's probably winning that race now, just how you wanted. We keep our word."
    mik "那个女孩现在应该正在赢得比赛，正如你所愿。我们说到做到。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2770
translate schinese m13choice11_1_5593740a:

    # mik "You should probably get out of here."
    mik "你最好还是赶紧离开这里吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2771
translate schinese m13choice11_1_1299206a:

    # MC "*Tsk* Agreed..."
    MC "*啧* 同意……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2776
translate schinese m13choice11_2_f0d155d5:

    # MCt "Shit... It's just a race..."
    MCt "该死……不过是一场比赛而已……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2778
translate schinese m13choice11_2_1ba084c5:

    # MC "Fine. Hatch your plan. I don't want any of it."
    MC "行吧。你想怎么策划都随你，我可不想掺和。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2779
translate schinese m13choice11_2_a487f763:

    # mik "I'm glad we could see eye-to-eye."
    mik "很高兴我们能达成共识。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2780
translate schinese m13choice11_2_08de229d:

    # MC "That tends to happen when you tilt you head upwards when speaking to an adult."
    MC "跟长辈说话时仰着头，往往就会出现这种情况。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2781
translate schinese m13choice11_2_75beba6d:

    # mik "Don't push your luck. Get outta here."
    mik "别得寸进尺。滚吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2790
translate schinese m13choice10_3_246647eb:

    # MCt "I feel like I should only use half a dose..."
    MCt "我觉得我应该只用半剂量的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2803
translate schinese m13choice10_4_5ee6f543:

    # MCt "Shit. I got no idea..."
    MCt "该死。我完全没头绪……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2804
translate schinese m13choice10_4_178c2e2e:

    # MCt "Here's hoping the target isn't one of ours..."
    MCt "希望目标不是我们自己人……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2817
translate schinese m13meryl_2f4557d2:

    # v "Meryl!"
    v "梅瑞尔！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2818
translate schinese m13meryl_d709a6d8:

    # MC "Hey, Meryl. How you feeling about the races today?"
    MC "嘿，梅瑞尔。你觉得今天的比赛胜算如何？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2819
translate schinese m13meryl_405618c5:

    # mer "We've got a strong team, and one guaranteed win in the form of Grace."
    mer "我们的队伍实力很强，而且有格蕾丝在，可以说稳赢一场了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2820
translate schinese m13meryl_c04776f3:

    # mer "Honestly, I like our chances. A lot."
    mer "老实说，我很看好我们的胜算。非常有信心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2821
translate schinese m13meryl_2a99bfc6:

    # mer "Not saying it's a surefire victory, but y'know..."
    mer "虽说不敢保证百分之百获胜，但你也知道……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2822
translate schinese m13meryl_a0336818:

    # MC "What about you?"
    MC "你呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2823
translate schinese m13meryl_28070d1e:

    # mer "What do you mean?"
    mer "你是什么意思？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2824
translate schinese m13meryl_f71d453d:

    # MC "You spoke about your team, but not yourself."
    MC "你谈到了你的团队，却没提你自己。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2827
translate schinese m13meryl_7bf7f207:

    # mer "Ehh... I'll be fine. We don't {i}all{/i} need to win."
    mer "呃……我会没事的。我们并不需要{i}人人{/i}都赢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2828
translate schinese m13meryl_8bc2803a:

    # v "Where's your confidence, dear?"
    v "亲爱的，你的自信去哪儿了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2829
translate schinese m13meryl_31a0f925:

    # v "And why are you sitting like a cat grooming itself."
    v "还有，你坐的姿势怎么像只正在梳理毛发的猫一样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2830
translate schinese m13meryl_24bf3bdd:

    # v "I hope you're not intending to lick yourself down there out in the open."
    v "我希望你没打算就这样在大庭广众之下舔自己的私处。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2833
translate schinese m13meryl_3e0868e4:

    # mer "H-hey! I can't even do that! It hurts my back too-"
    mer "嘿！我根本做不到那种事好吗！那样会伤到我的背——"

# game/script2.rpyc:2834
translate schinese m13meryl_ab37addc:

    # mer "!!"
    mer "！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2835
translate schinese m13meryl_6b0f1502:

    # v "Haha! Don't be so ashamed, I was only jesting."
    v "哈哈！别害羞嘛，我只是开个玩笑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2836
translate schinese m13meryl_13136517:

    # v "Besides, we've all given it a go before."
    v "再说，我们以前也都试过。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2837
translate schinese m13meryl_18616725:

    # mer "..."
    mer "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2840
translate schinese m13meryl_9828ce34:

    # mer "I'm stretching out my legs. Want to keep them limber."
    mer "我是在拉伸腿部。想保持腿脚灵活。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2841
translate schinese m13meryl_12a20071:

    # MC "What about your other leg?"
    MC "那另一条腿呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2842
translate schinese m13meryl_7be90dcb:

    # mer "What?"
    mer "什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2843
translate schinese m13meryl_a5879f5e:

    # MC "You're putting a lot of focus on that one leg. Shouldn't you balance them out?"
    MC "你太专注于那条腿了。是不是该平衡一下？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2844
translate schinese m13meryl_6bd82d58:

    # v "Indeed, what about your arms and your torso? Favoring that one leg won't get you very far."
    v "确实，还有你的手臂和躯干呢？光顾着那条腿可走不远。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2845
translate schinese m13meryl_991234d0:

    # mer "Uhh... Yeah! Good point! I'll switch now!"
    mer "呃……对哦！说得有道理！我马上换一边！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2854
translate schinese m13meryl_c2c06629:

    # mer "Ack!!" with vpunch
    mer "啊！！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:2855
translate schinese m13meryl_c97e68f7:

    # MC "I knew it."
    MC "我就知道会这样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2856
translate schinese m13meryl_362624ab:

    # v "Meryl..."
    v "梅瑞尔……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2859
translate schinese m13meryl_e86ff361:

    # mer "I... Pulled my hamstring... it was a stupid mistake... I'm sorry..."
    mer "我……拉伤了大腿后侧肌肉……真是个愚蠢的失误……对不起……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2860
translate schinese m13meryl_af9b8b30:

    # mer "I don't even know if I..."
    mer "我甚至不知道自己……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2861
translate schinese m13meryl_3abf8dc5:

    # mer "I'm coming in last place for sure..."
    mer "我肯定会垫底了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2862
translate schinese m13meryl_3a2782d2:

    # v "Let us take a look."
    v "让我们看看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2865
translate schinese m13meryl_ba0de434:

    # v "Hmm... It does feel tight. We don't have many options in terms of short-term relief."
    v "嗯……确实感觉很紧。对于短期缓解症状，我们没多少选择。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2866
translate schinese m13meryl_1100a94f:

    # MC "How about a massage?"
    MC "按摩怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2867
translate schinese m13meryl_cec9f223:

    # v "Probably the best solution we have right now."
    v "这恐怕是我们目前最好的办法了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2868
translate schinese m13meryl_a568bb78:

    # v "It's not perfect. Not at all."
    v "这并不完美。一点也不。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2869
translate schinese m13meryl_dbc8f305:

    # mer "*Nghh* Sorry for making you do this, 'Neeta. But it's worth a try..."
    mer "*唔* 抱歉要麻烦你了，妮塔。但值得一试……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2870
translate schinese m13meryl_4f78165d:

    # v "Not me."
    v "不是我来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2871
translate schinese m13meryl_b7063897:

    # v "[name] has to do it. He's much stronger than I am."
    v "得由[name]来做。他比我力气大得多。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2874
translate schinese m13meryl_18616725_1:

    # mer "..."
    mer "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2875
translate schinese m13meryl_4a480a9e:

    # mer "Fine..."
    mer "好吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2876
translate schinese m13meryl_b0898eb7:

    # MC "The thought's nice but I have no idea how to give a meaningful massage."
    MC "想法是不错，但我根本不知道怎么做有效的按摩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2877
translate schinese m13meryl_8b0726b7:

    # v "Neither do I, so we're still at the same impasse as before."
    v "我也不知道，所以我们还是回到了原来的僵局。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2878
translate schinese m13meryl_ff0f903b:

    # mer "I can... guide you. I have physio-therapy training."
    mer "我可以……指导你。我受过物理治疗方面的训练。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2879
translate schinese m13meryl_5de4ab60:

    # MCt "What should I do? Even with her guidance there's no way I'm bringing her back to full health."
    MCt "我该怎么做？即便有她的指导，我也绝无可能让她完全康复。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2880
translate schinese m13meryl_7a7ecdd0:

    # MCt "There could be a better way to do this. I could go look for a better solution. If I can't find one I can always come back and deliver the massage."
    MCt "也许有更好的办法。我可以去找找看有没有更理想的方案。如果找不到，到时候再回来给她按摩也不迟。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2881
translate schinese m13meryl_816d19fb:

    # MCt "The only thing I do know is that giving her a massage is {b}{u}better than nothing{/u}{/b}."
    MCt "我唯一确定的是，给她按摩{b}{u}总比什么都不做要强{/u}{/b}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2883
translate schinese m13meryl_163e91fa:

    # MCt "Wait a second! Don't I have that oil from Lexi? What was it? Muscle repairing?"
    MCt "等等！我不是有莱克西给的那种油吗？叫什么来着？肌肉修复油？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2884
translate schinese m13meryl_1afdd89c:

    # MCt "Isn't that exactly what I need?"
    MCt "那不正是我现在需要的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2897
translate schinese m13choice9_1_75fdacae:

    # v "Are you comfortable, my dear."
    v "你感觉舒服吗，亲爱的？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2898
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ea60bbb8:

    # mer "As comfortable as I'm ever going to be with a pulled hamstring and a recent acquaintance between my legs."
    mer "腿筋拉伤，而且双腿之间还有个刚认识不久的人……在这种情况下，这已经是我能感觉到的最舒服的状态了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2899
translate schinese m13choice9_1_b4b81957:

    # MC "Sorry. I'm not going to try anything funny."
    MC "抱歉。我不会乱来的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2900
translate schinese m13choice9_1_b865b77a:

    # mer "I know... It's just embarrassing is all..."
    mer "我知道……只是觉得有点尴尬罢了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2903
translate schinese m13choice9_1_af27be69:

    # MC "Your leg is warm. That would be the inflammation, I guess."
    MC "你的腿发热。我想那是炎症引起的吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2907
translate schinese m13choice9_1_d09bb59a:

    # MCt "I've been staring at young women in tight swimsuits all afternoon."
    MCt "我整个下午都在盯着那些穿紧身泳衣的年轻姑娘看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2908
translate schinese m13choice9_1_58991907:

    # MCt "I think I'm starting to develop something. Who wouldn't? This whole team is full of knockouts."
    MCt "我觉得我有点动心了。谁能不动心呢？整个团队里全是绝色美女。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2909
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ea1718db:

    # MCt "And now I've got this one right in front of me with her legs open."
    MCt "而现在，眼前这位正敞开双腿……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2910
translate schinese m13choice9_1_c3467ebd:

    # MCt "Her skin is so soft..."
    MCt "她的皮肤好柔软……"

# game/script2.rpyc:2911
translate schinese m13choice9_1_260ea6e0:

    # MCt "They're not that defined but... I can feel some real muscle here. She's got some strong legs."
    MCt "虽然线条没那么明显，但……我能感觉到这里确实有结实的肌肉。她的腿很有力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2912
translate schinese m13choice9_1_465ac86f:

    # MC "How's this?"
    MC "这样怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2913
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ed300317:

    # mer "You can press a little harder."
    mer "你可以再用力一点。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2914
translate schinese m13choice9_1_da320624:

    # MC "Sure thing."
    MC "没问题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2915
translate schinese m13choice9_1_170aca1e:

    # mer "Try to think of it like you're squeezing something out of a pouch."
    mer "试着想象一下，就像从袋子里挤出东西那样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2916
translate schinese m13choice9_1_5679bcc4:

    # mer "Press your thumbs in."
    mer "用大拇指按进去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2921
translate schinese m13choice9_1_386504d9:

    # mer "Ahh... That's right."
    mer "啊……对，就是这样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2922
translate schinese m13choice9_1_057ff63f:

    # v "Wow! Such a fast learner, [name]."
    v "哇！学得真快啊，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2923
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ec2769d5:

    # v "You master this, and I'd happily line up to be your next client."
    v "等你学会了这个，我很乐意排队做你的下一位顾客。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2925
translate schinese m13choice9_1_d2a3fab9:

    # MC "Hmm. Too bad I know you're only teasing me."
    MC "嗯。真可惜，我知道你只是在逗我。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2926
translate schinese m13choice9_1_51780aa5:

    # v "Not at all, your determined grip is inspiring me."
    v "哪有，你那坚定的手劲反而给了我不少启发。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2927
translate schinese m13choice9_1_c0409857:

    # MC "Have you forgotten our little conversation earlier."
    MC "你忘了我们刚才那番对话了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2928
translate schinese m13choice9_1_90b7e745:

    # MC "There's a lot of physical contact occurring during a massage."
    MC "按摩过程中难免会有很多肢体接触。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2929
translate schinese m13choice9_1_cc25f055:

    # v "Ah! You've caught me! Well done."
    v "啊！被你识破了！干得漂亮。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2930
translate schinese m13choice9_1_e51b84cb:

    # MC "Well, even without that contradiction, I'm ninety-nine-percent sure everything you say is simply to get a reaction out of me."
    MC "其实，就算没有那处矛盾，我也敢有九成九的把握断定，你说的那些话纯粹就是为了看我的反应。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2931
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ee2df719:

    # v "Awww... you think so little of me. It's almost painful."
    v "哎呀……你竟然这么看我，真让人伤心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2933
translate schinese m13choice9_1_c304843c:

    # MC "I'll charge you."
    MC "我会收费的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2934
translate schinese m13choice9_1_f9b50c55:

    # v "But why? Displaying such injustice as the free massage you're giving right now."
    v "可是为什么呢？明明你现在正在做免费按摩，这太不公平了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2935
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ef5800f4:

    # MC "She's injured. Exceptional circumstances."
    MC "她受伤了，这是特殊情况。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2936
translate schinese m13choice9_1_785626c3:

    # MC "You want a freebie, go get injured."
    MC "想享受免费服务？那你也去受个伤吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2937
translate schinese m13choice9_1_784371e8:

    # v "Oh, how cruel. Your cold words have already torn my delicate heart in two. How many more injuries must I sustain?!"
    v "噢，太残忍了。你冷酷的话语已经将我脆弱的心撕成了两半。我到底还要受多少伤才行啊？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2938
translate schinese m13choice9_1_f7421520:

    # mer "*Nghh* How did you two become so close?"
    mer "*唔* 你们俩是怎么变得这么亲密的？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2939
translate schinese m13choice9_1_df24b6be:

    # MC "Close?"
    MC "亲密？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2940
translate schinese m13choice9_1_e37fb42f:

    # v "I've been openly courting [name] for close to eight years now."
    v "我公开追求[name]已经快八年了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2941
translate schinese m13choice9_1_77f21e31:

    # v "He'll turn his gaze to me one day."
    v "总有一天，他的目光会转向我的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2942
translate schinese m13choice9_1_4e7cd4c8:

    # mer "Wow. You're not even embarrassed of that in the slightest?"
    mer "哇哦。你对此难道一点也不觉得难为情吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2943
translate schinese m13choice9_1_5c57f3f0:

    # MC "Vineeta, one more time with zero lies, please."
    MC "维妮塔，请再说一次，这次不许撒谎。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2944
translate schinese m13choice9_1_3cbf07c4:

    # v "Let me have my fun."
    v "让我乐呵乐呵嘛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2945
translate schinese m13choice9_1_dfc89d53:

    # MC "Vineeta and I barely know each other. We're acquainted through someone else. I didn't even know she'd be here today."
    MC "我和维妮塔其实不太熟，只是通过别人认识的。我甚至都不知道她今天会来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2946
translate schinese m13choice9_1_962c3ca3:

    # mer "You two have such amazing chemistry I'd think you were best friends."
    mer "你们俩的化学反应太棒了，我还以为你们是最好的朋友呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2947
translate schinese m13choice9_1_257f1303:

    # v "You hear that, [name]? Amazing chemistry!"
    v "听到了吗，[name]？化学反应太棒了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2948
translate schinese m13choice9_1_73f451dd:

    # MC "Yeah, like magnesium and water."
    MC "是啊，就像镁和水那样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2953
translate schinese m13choice9_1_20d75d68:

    # v "You okay there, Meryl? Your face is flushed."
    v "你还好吗，梅瑞尔？你的脸都红了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2954
translate schinese m13choice9_1_5d6728f5:

    # mer "It's... It's just the pain!"
    mer "这……这只是因为疼！"

# game/script2.rpyc:2955
translate schinese m13choice9_1_590a546d:

    # v "Oh dear. You hear that, [name]. She's still in pain. You should push harder."
    v "哎呀。听到了吗，[name]？她还在喊疼呢。你应该再用力一点。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2956
translate schinese m13choice9_1_69179602:

    # mer "Please don't!" with vpunch
    mer "别这样！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:2957
translate schinese m13choice9_1_f29b2cea:

    # mer "You're... doing great."
    mer "你做得……很棒。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2958
translate schinese m13choice9_1_ac7edf7c:

    # MC "Glad to hear it. I have no idea what I'm doing."
    MC "听到这话真高兴。其实我根本不知道自己在做什么。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2959
translate schinese m13choice9_1_1e1d5042:

    # v "How is the leg feeling?"
    v "腿感觉怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2960
translate schinese m13choice9_1_6889261d:

    # mer "*Nghh* It's good. I can feel it stretching out... I think I can compete like this."
    mer "*唔* 感觉不错。能感觉到它在舒展……我想这样应该能参赛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2961
translate schinese m13choice9_1_a4957bcf:

    # MC "Happy to be of service."
    MC "很高兴能帮上忙。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2963
translate schinese m13choice9_1_21322a45:

    # mer "Something feels a little... tingly?"
    mer "感觉有点……麻麻的？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2964
translate schinese m13choice9_1_a57c35ac:

    # v "Ah, Are you using that oil?"
    v "啊，你用了那种精油吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2965
translate schinese m13choice9_1_7811cc46:

    # MC "Bingo."
    MC "答对了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2966
translate schinese m13choice9_1_cd0f42f7:

    # mer "Oil?"
    mer "精油？"

# game/script2.rpyc:2967
translate schinese m13choice9_1_54dd9c45:

    # MC "We got our hands on this massage oil. Supposed to relax your muscles and encourage healing using transitive magic."
    MC "我们弄到了这种按摩精油。据说能利用传导魔法放松肌肉并促进愈合。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2968
translate schinese m13choice9_1_70af6cfc:

    # mer "Hmm... sounds kinda bullshit. There are no healing spells."
    mer "嗯……听起来有点扯淡。根本就没有什么治愈魔法。"

# game/script2.rpyc:2969
translate schinese m13choice9_1_8bd9c699:

    # v "I assume it isn't a healing spell. It's medicine that's been enhanced."
