    # v "She has a stress-free approach to swimming. It does wonders for her ability to focus."
    v "她游泳时心态很放松，这对提升她的专注力大有裨益。"

# game/script2.rpyc:4114
translate schinese m13afterfreda_6596a7c7:

    # v "Plus her Elven body is limber and hard to place strain on."
    v "况且，她那精灵般的身体既柔韧又不易受伤。"

# game/script2.rpyc:4116
translate schinese m13afterfreda_740f0d32:

    # v "Ah, but you know her body much better than I do, don't you?"
    v "啊，不过你比我更了解她的身体，不是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:4118
translate schinese m13afterfreda_1dda13bc:

    # MC "Shh! What if Grace hears?"
    MC "嘘！要是被格蕾丝听到了怎么办？"

# game/script2.rpyc:4119
translate schinese m13afterfreda_4b466788:

    # v "I don't think there's a single meaningful thought running through that head of hers right now."
    v "我觉得她现在的脑子里根本没在想什么正经事。"

