    # v "If Freda wins, that'll put us at three victories."
    v "如果芙蕾达获胜，我们就拿到了三场胜利。"

# game/script2.rpyc:4133
translate schinese m13afterfreda_d25264ae:

    # v "Which is a guaranteed overall win for us."
    v "这意味着我们肯定能赢得最终胜利。"

# game/script2.rpyc:4135
translate schinese m13afterfreda_5c63273d:

    # v "Even if she doesn't, two wins and a high overall average puts us in a nice place."
    v "即使她没赢，两场胜利加上较高的总平均分，我们的处境也相当有利。"

# game/script2.rpyc:4136
