translate schinese m14choice2_1_93f7d83d:

    # g "Damn, my guy. I don't think you're gonna find laser tiddies anywhere. I think you should just give up and stick with me."
    g "天哪，老兄。我觉得你上哪儿也找不到长着激光奶头的家伙。我看你还是死心吧，凑合跟我在一起得了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5003
translate schinese m14choice2_1_d9ebec3f:

