translate schinese m14choice2_2_f481ee34:

    # g "Noelle's weak as hell! She could probably be toppled by a mouse."
    g "诺艾尔弱爆了好吗！估计连只老鼠都能把她撞倒。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5015
translate schinese m14choice2_2_4ceb588f:

