translate schinese m14afterchoice6_cd7ff102:

    # m "I knew you had it in you. You worked so hard."
    m "我就知道你行。你真的付出了很多努力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5425
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_bff1f9a6:

    # m "You even won your own race."
    m "你甚至赢了属于你自己的那场比赛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5426
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_e21ccb17:

    # g "Thanks, mom."
    g "谢谢，妈妈。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5427
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_5a17c17a:

    # m "God, it's been years since I've hugged you. Look how big you've gotten."
    m "天哪，我都好多年没抱过你了。看你长得这么大了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5428
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_44393ea1:

    # g "Geez, mom. You sound like a grandma whenever their grandkids visit once a year."
    g "哎呀，妈。你听起来就像那种一年才见一次孙辈的老奶奶一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5429
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_16c00c18:

    # g "I'm always here, you know."
    g "你知道的，我一直都在这儿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5430
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_0615a028:

    # m "Haha, I know, I know. It's only just hit me right now."
    m "哈哈，我知道，我知道。我这会儿才反应过来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5431
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_aedaf59b:

    # m "You're squatting just so I can hug you."
    m "你蹲下来，就是为了让我能抱到你啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5432
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_47a06e47:

    # g "Somehow, this is starting to get super embarrassing."
    g "不知怎么的，这感觉越来越让人难为情了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5435
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_cf89f273:

    # m "*Giggles* Sorry! Sorry! You're all grown up now."
    m "*咯咯笑* 抱歉！抱歉！你现在可是个大姑娘了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5436
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_145a0c46:

    # m "Are we gonna spend the whole night out here or should we forward an invite to Chloe for her round of hugs?"
    m "咱们是要在这儿待上一整晚呢，还是该叫克洛伊过来，也让她享受一下拥抱的待遇？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5437
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_a9b7afd7:

    # g "Sun's not gone yet. I don't want to risk turning her into a pile of ash."
    g "太阳还没落山呢。我可不想冒着让她化为一堆灰烬的风险。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5438
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_0bc33b38:

    # m "And after the pain of losing my precious daughter, I'll have to further my turmoil by waging war against Helios himself."
    m "而且，在痛失我宝贝女儿之后，我还得为了向赫利俄斯（Helios）本人宣战而让自己陷入更深的煎熬。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5439
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_99cc872e:

    # MC "I think you stand a chance in that war, to be honest. You're pretty scary, and you know how to aim for the balls."
    MC "老实说，我觉得你在那场战争中胜算不小。你挺吓人的，而且还知道怎么专踢男人的命根子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5440
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_1324a880:

    # m "The sun may be the biggest ball I'm prepared to kick."
    m "太阳可能就是我准备去踢的那个最大的“蛋”了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5441
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_c82ac709:

    # MC "Let's hope you never have to, or at least have to under better circumstances than Chloe being obliterated by a barrage of vitamin D."
    MC "希望你永远不必这么做，或者至少别在那种糟糕的情况下——比如克洛伊被一通猛烈的维生素D轰炸给彻底消灭了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5442
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_68328f39:

    # g "I'm going inside."
    g "我要进去了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5443
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_91633942:

    # m "Wow, way to change the subject."
    m "哇，话题转得真快。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5444
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_44239498:

    # g "I know how this goes. If nothing forces us inside we're gonna be waffling for hours."
    g "我太了解这套路了。要是没人催着进去，咱们肯定会磨蹭好几个小时。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5445
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_66c1e458:

    # m "Indeed."
    m "确实。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5446
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_1de397de:

    # MC "Yeah, you've got us there."
    MC "是啊，你说得对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5452
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_3b72dca0:

    # g "Ahhhhh. Sweet, cushioned surfaces! Oh, how I've missed you!"
    g "啊——！柔软舒适的表面！噢，我可想死你们了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:5455
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_5a215441:

    # MC "What's in the bag?"
    MC "袋子里装的什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5458
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_f9ea5412:

    # m "Stuff I'm running low on. Salt's one of those things that you can just never comprehend running out of."
    m "一些快用完的东西。盐这种东西，你根本想象不到它会有用光的一天。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5459
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_a8dc41a0:

    # m "Well guess what? Somehow I managed to make my way to the bottom."
    m "结果你猜怎么着？我还真就把它用到见底了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5460
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_f8f062a2:

    # m "Other than that I just grabbed some stuff I felt like grabbing."
    m "除此之外，我还顺手拿了些自己想买的东西。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5461
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_3fcef087:

    # m "Fruit, new earrings, some sweet snacks."
    m "水果、新耳环，还有些甜食。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5462
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_dccd31bb:

    # MC "Earrings?"
    MC "耳环？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5463
translate schinese m14afterchoice6_7050dd44:

    # m "Not what I set out for, but I couldn't resist."
    m "本来没打算买的，但实在忍不住。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5466
translate schinese m14choice7_1_35a53825:

    # MC "Put them on."
    MC "戴上看看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5469
translate schinese m14choice7_1_07e9db1d:

    # m "Ehh... they're nothing special."
    m "呃……也没什么特别的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5470
translate schinese m14choice7_1_f281b228:

    # MC "Then that means putting them on and showing them off isn't a big deal."
    MC "既然这样，那戴上展示一下也没什么大不了的吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5471
translate schinese m14choice7_1_3ff93cc8:

    # m "I guess..."
    m "也是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5474
translate schinese m14choice7_1_ad2aa831:

    # m "See. Nothing much."
    m "你看，很普通吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5475
translate schinese m14choice7_1_67ad6ef2:

    # MC "What are you on about? These look good. I mean, yeah, they're not extravagant or anything but..."
    MC "你在说什么呢？这很好看啊。我是说，虽然算不上什么奢华的款式，但是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5476
translate schinese m14choice7_1_e1a510c8:

    # MC "Weren't you a model?"
    MC "你以前不是当过模特吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5477
translate schinese m14choice7_1_8cb62253:

    # m "Yes."
    m "对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5478
translate schinese m14choice7_1_7ef40d64:

    # MC "Where's all of the pride in your looks gone?"
    MC "你对自己外表的自信都去哪儿了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5479
translate schinese m14choice7_1_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5480
translate schinese m14choice7_1_08ff2919:

    # MC "Come to think of it. You're only wearing earrings half the time I see you. What gives?"
    MC "仔细想想，我见你的时候，你只有一半时间戴着耳环。这是为什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5481
translate schinese m14choice7_1_5282bf1f:

    # m "There's nothing to it really. I genuinely just don't feel like wearing them half of the time."
    m "其实也没什么特别的原因。其实很多时候，我真的不太想戴它们。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5482
translate schinese m14choice7_1_ac94de8d:

    # MC "I see."
    MC "我明白了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5488
translate schinese m14choice7_1_2f3fbba9:

    # m "But thank you."
    m "不过还是谢谢你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5489
translate schinese m14choice7_1_53ed94e2:

    # m "My first modeling gig was actually an earring job."
    m "我接的第一份模特工作，其实是拍耳环广告。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5490
translate schinese m14choice7_1_32deda04:

    # m "Being scouted for having \"photogenic ears\" was definitely not something I expected at seventeen."
    m "十七岁那年，因为“耳朵上镜”而被发掘，这绝对是我没想到的事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5491
translate schinese m14choice7_1_d89b1780:

    # MC "Seventeen? That's young."
    MC "十七岁？那可真年轻。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5492
translate schinese m14choice7_1_406512a9:

    # m "Young people are the most beautiful, [name]."
    m "年轻人最美了，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5497
translate schinese m14choice8_1_05ca4588:

    # MC "I suppose that makes sense."
    MC "这倒也是。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5515
translate schinese m14choice8_2_89ecc952:

    # m "Anyway! Changing the subject back to modeling!"
    m "总之！话题还是转回模特工作吧！"

# game/script2.rpyc:5519
translate schinese m14choice9_1_9700f997:

    # MC "Why are you changing the subject?"
    MC "为什么要转移话题？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5522
translate schinese m14choice9_1_88f1687d:

    # MC "You keep implying dumb shit like being past your prime."
    MC "你老是暗示一些蠢话，比如说什么自己风华已逝。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5523
translate schinese m14choice9_1_4d50b514:

    # MC "You haven't been the same since you had Noelle."
    MC "自从生了诺艾尔，你就变了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5524
translate schinese m14choice9_1_9049023b:

    # MC "You look old."
    MC "你看起来显老。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5525
translate schinese m14choice9_1_83e33cec:

    # MC "When the reality is."
    MC "但事实却是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5531
translate schinese m14choice9_1_ae27093d:

    # MC "You're conventionally attractive."
    MC "你有着公认的迷人外表。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5537
translate schinese m14choice9_1_94252a7c:

    # MC "You're aging like a fine wine."
    MC "你就像陈年佳酿，越老越有韵味。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5543
translate schinese m14choice9_1_892d7f11:

    # MC "You look about half your age."
    MC "你看上去只有实际年龄的一半大。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5549
translate schinese m14choice9_1_2956514c:

    # MC "You've got a great body despite the pregnancies."
    MC "尽管生过孩子，你的身材依然保持得很好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5550
translate schinese m14choice9_1_cd819402:

    # m "But- but- butbutbutbutbutbutbutbut-"
    m "可是——可是——可是可是可是可是可是可是可是——"

# game/script2.rpyc:5555
translate schinese m14choice9_1_d2d3064b:

    # m "*Exhale*"
    m "*呼气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5557
translate schinese m14choice9_1_434bb754:

    # m "*Inhale*"
    m "*吸气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5558
translate schinese m14choice9_1_d2d3064b_1:

    # m "*Exhale*"
    m "*呼气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5559
translate schinese m14choice9_1_434bb754_1:

    # m "*Inhale*"
    m "*吸气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5560
translate schinese m14choice9_1_d2d3064b_2:

    # m "*Exhale*"
    m "*呼气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5561
translate schinese m14choice9_1_434bb754_2:

    # m "*Inhale*"
    m "*吸气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5562
translate schinese m14choice9_1_89fbef9c:

    # m "*Clears throat*"
    m "*清嗓子*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5565
translate schinese m14choice9_1_c960afd9:

    # m "Sorry. I haven't heard words like that in a {i}long{/i} time."
    m "抱歉。我已经{i}很久{/i}没听到那样的话了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5566
translate schinese m14choice9_1_eb2c7154:

    # m "It was a little bit of a shock to my system."
    m "这让我有点受宠若惊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5567
translate schinese m14choice9_1_984d3ea8:

    # m "I'd forgotten how it feels."
    m "我都忘了那是什么感觉了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5568
translate schinese m14choice9_1_f5aacde0:

    # MC "Aww. I made you happy?"
    MC "哎呀，我让你开心了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5576
translate schinese m14choice9_1_ede51ac5:

    # m "*Wheeze*"
    m "*喘息*"

# game/script2.rpyc:5581
translate schinese m14choice9_1_a556315e:

    # m "As I was saying;"
    m "就像我刚才说的；"

# game/script2.rpyc:5585
translate schinese m14choice9_2_23816d4e:

    # MC "You good?"
    MC "你还好吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5586
translate schinese m14choice9_2_3610d62b:

    # m "I'm fine!"
    m "我没事！"

# game/script2.rpyc:5587
translate schinese m14choice9_2_a556315e:

    # m "As I was saying;"
    m "就像我刚才说的；"

# game/script2.rpyc:5592
translate schinese m14afterchoice8_d8381d9c:

    # m "Yeesh, that brings back memories."
    m "哎呀，这勾起了不少回忆。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5593
translate schinese m14afterchoice8_f7d7a773:

    # m "I had long hair back then, so I remember we had to be careful to keep it out of the way."
    m "那时候我留着长发，所以我记得我们得小心别让头发碍事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5594
translate schinese m14afterchoice8_eeedad9b:

    # m "My first real job. My first real paycheck."
    m "我第一份真正的工作。我拿到的第一份像样的薪水。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5595
translate schinese m14afterchoice8_a34a8353:

    # m "Gave that money to my uncle so he could buy me booze."
    m "我把钱给了我叔叔，让他帮我买酒。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5596
translate schinese m14afterchoice8_cedab684:

    # m "My first time being drunk, my first boyfriend."
    m "我第一次喝醉，还有我的第一个男朋友。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5597
translate schinese m14afterchoice8_600fded7:

    # m "Seems like that shoot really kick-started my life."
    m "看来那次拍摄真的开启了我的人生。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5603
translate schinese m14choice10_1_79a937f2:

    # m "No. I really shouldn't."
    m "不，我真的不该这么做。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5604
translate schinese m14choice10_1_aa84e1cd:

    # m "It was fun while it lasted, but I didn't leave that industry on good terms. Or even decent terms for that matter."
    m "那段日子确实很有趣，但我离开那个行业时闹得很不愉快。甚至可以说，结局相当糟稽。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5605
translate schinese m14choice10_1_c0e6e2f9:

    # MC "You sure? Was it that bad?"
    MC "你确定吗？情况真有那么糟？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5608
translate schinese m14choice10_1_deedc380:

    # m "Sorry. The entire experience has been soured for me. Even how I look back on it is kinda warped now."
    m "抱歉。整段经历给我的感觉都变味了。现在回想起来，心态都有点扭曲了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5609
translate schinese m14choice10_1_ce7be4d0:

    # MC "You never look back on your old photos to reminisce?"
    MC "你从来不翻看旧照片来怀念过去吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5610
translate schinese m14choice10_1_c738478d:

    # m "I try not to. Done a good job so far."
    m "我尽量不去翻。目前为止做得还不错。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5611
translate schinese m14choice10_1_2f2db045:

    # MC "Hmm... Seems kinda sad. Maybe you'll change your mind if you have a look."
    MC "嗯……听起来有点令人感伤。也许你看过之后会改变主意。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5615
translate schinese m14choice10_1_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5616
translate schinese m14choice10_1_ac9714b8:

    # m "My mind's made up."
    m "我已经决定了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5617
translate schinese m14choice10_1_bd7e8362:

    # MC "Sure. I don't know anything about it anyway."
    MC "好吧。反正我对那事儿也不了解。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5618
translate schinese m14choice10_1_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5622
translate schinese m14choice10_2_95a6147d:

    # m "It's not all the glamor it presents itself as."
    m "它并不像表面看起来那么光鲜亮丽。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5623
translate schinese m14choice10_2_61f2fabf:

    # m "I'm also coloring it with all the positive circumstances I faced at the time."
    m "而且，我也给那段回忆加上了当时所经历的那些美好际遇的滤镜。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5624
translate schinese m14choice10_2_aa84e1cd:

    # m "It was fun while it lasted, but I didn't leave that industry on good terms. Or even decent terms for that matter."
    m "那段日子确实很有趣，但我离开那个行业时闹得很不愉快。甚至可以说，结局相当糟稽。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5625
translate schinese m14choice10_2_e198747d:

    # m "So it doesn't really bother me that things have changed."
    m "所以，情况变了对我来说也没什么大不了的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5626
translate schinese m14choice10_2_ab2b40c6:

    # MCt "Huh, I really don't know shit about Miya, huh?"
    MCt "哈，看来我对米娅的事真是一无所知啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5630
translate schinese m14choice7_2_759ef24d:

    # MC "\"Couldn't resist\" as if that matters at all."
    MC "“忍不住要说”——虽然这根本无关紧要。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5633
translate schinese m14choice7_2_7d909fef:

    # MC "Enjoy your earrings, Miya."
    MC "好好享受你的耳环吧，米娅。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5634
translate schinese m14choice7_2_2583c7d4:

    # m "Heh. True."
    m "呵。确实。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5635
translate schinese m14choice7_2_a9742a0d:

    # m "Now I just need to find an excuse to wear them."
    m "现在我只需要找个借口戴上它们。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5639
translate schinese m14choice7_3_a1fb29b7:

    # MC "Cool."
    MC "好啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5640
translate schinese m14choice7_3_8a37f01b:

    # m "For sure."
    m "确实。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5644
translate schinese m14afterchoice7_fd63d939:

    # MC "You said you got sweet snacks in here?"
    MC "你说过这里有甜点心？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5645
translate schinese m14afterchoice7_1ddf8bb4:

    # m "Planning to pinch one out from right under my nose?"
    m "打算趁我不注意偷拿一个？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5646
translate schinese m14afterchoice7_b5902332:

    # MC "Depends on what we've got in here. Fill me in."
    MC "那得看里面有什么了。跟我说说看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5647
translate schinese m14afterchoice7_1767dc44:

    # m "Well, since last time I just couldn't resist. I went and grabbed a set of magically enhanced cakes."
    m "嗯，上次之后我实在忍不住了，就去弄了一套魔法加持过的蛋糕。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5650
translate schinese m14afterchoice7_464edd91:

    # MC "Uuuuuuhhhhhhhhh......"
    MC "呃……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5651
translate schinese m14afterchoice7_d0f72012:

    # MC "I don't think it's the wisest idea to just throw yourself at these magic cakes..."
    MC "我觉得直接去吃这些魔法蛋糕可不是什么明智之举……"

