    nt "虽然有点粗鲁，但至少没吵架……"

# game/script2.rpyc:5995
translate schinese m14choice14_2_5da27afc:

    # MCt "Come on, [name]."
    MCt "来吧，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:5996
translate schinese m14choice14_2_5059dfe1:

    # MCt "I'm a natural-born problem solver. How do I solve problems?"
    MCt "我可是天生的“问题终结者”。我是怎么解决问题的呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:5997
translate schinese m14choice14_2_08273374:

    # MCt "Magic! That's it!"
    MCt "魔法！就是魔法！"

# game/script2.rpyc:5998
translate schinese m14choice14_2_6d881d3b:

    # MCt "I've made myself temporarily infertile. Surely I can make myself impotent too."
    MCt "既然我能让自己暂时失去生育能力，那肯定也能让自己阳痿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6002
translate schinese m14choice14_2_544da4fd:

    # n "...What are you doing?"
    n "……你在干什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6003
translate schinese m14choice14_2_2eabed7f:

    # n "Are you cursing the bath?"
    n "你在给浴缸施咒吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6006
translate schinese m14choice14_2_a49e1b8a:

    # MC "Just regulating the water temperature."
    MC "只是在调节水温。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6007
translate schinese m14choice14_2_b230af32:

    # MC "I've been in here a little while so it might've cooled down a bit."
    MC "我泡了一会儿，水可能有点凉了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6008
translate schinese m14choice14_2_8cff68bb:

    # MC "So just hang on out there for a little, would you? I'll get this all warmed up for you."
    MC "所以，你能不能在外面稍微等一下？我来帮你把这个热一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6012
translate schinese m14choice14_2_acb69348:

    # MC "GO DOWN, DAMN YOU!" with vpunch
    MC "下去啊，该死的！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:6015
translate schinese m14choice14_2_c269da61:

    # n "*Gasp*"
    n "*倒吸一口气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:6016
translate schinese m14choice14_2_f3c0557b:

    # n "Oh, you're just my favorite!"
    n "噢，你真是我的最爱！"

# game/script2.rpyc:6019
translate schinese m14choice14_2_1420e257:

    # n "What would we do without you?"
    n "没有你我们该怎么办呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6020
translate schinese m14choice14_2_6ff779ae:

    # n "I swear, you're the only thing holding us together at this point, haha."
    n "我发誓，眼下全靠你把大家维系在一起了，哈哈。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6021
translate schinese m14choice14_2_90025cf1:

    # n "A true gentleman and the man of the house indeed."
    n "真是一位真正的绅士，也是这个家的顶梁柱。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6022
translate schinese m14choice14_2_5927f18e:

    # n "Hmm, let me think..." (multiple=2)
    n "嗯，让我想想……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:6023
translate schinese m14choice14_2_042d0fd7:

    # MCt "Come on!" (multiple=2)
    MCt "快来！" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:6031
translate schinese m14choice14_2_450ee144:

    # n "Oh, god. There's so many to list off the top of my head."
    n "天哪，一下子能列举出来的太多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6032
translate schinese m14choice14_2_e18fd82d:

    # n "You almost always offer to take heavy stuff off of people's hands... well, everyone but Grace's."
    n "你总是主动帮大家分担重物……嗯，除了格蕾丝的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6033
translate schinese m14choice14_2_6bc096cd:

    # n "But speaking of Grace-"
    n "不过说到格蕾丝——"

# game/script2.rpyc:6040
translate schinese m14choice14_2_372337f0:

    # MC "AAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!"
    MC "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！！！！！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:6041
translate schinese m14choice14_2_c11efe40:

    # n "The one time you got suspended from school because you joined Grace in a fight."
    n "还记得那次你因为帮格蕾丝打架而被学校停课吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6042
translate schinese m14choice14_2_e52dcfa8:

    # n "Grace got grounded."
    n "格蕾丝被禁足了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6043
translate schinese m14choice14_2_02706831:

    # n "Your Mom let you off easy because you were adamant that you were defending her."
    n "你妈对你网开一面，因为你坚持说自己是在保护格蕾丝。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6044
translate schinese m14choice14_2_0a94bc40:

    # n "And now speaking of grounding:"
    n "说到禁足："

# game/script2.rpyc:6045
translate schinese m14choice14_2_3921378d:

    # n "Whenever {i}I{/i} was grounded, you'd always sneak snacks into my room, like we had a little deal going on."
    n "每当我被禁足的时候，你总会偷偷往我房间里塞零食，就像我们之间有什么秘密约定一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6046
translate schinese m14choice14_2_52703138:

    # n "*Sigh* Sometimes I miss those days. But {i}you've{/i} never changed."
    n "*叹气* 有时候真怀念那些日子。不过，{i}你{/i}一点也没变。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6056
translate schinese m14choice14_2_ff616819:

    # n "And now..."
    n "而现在……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6057
translate schinese m14choice14_2_69810b39:

    # n "There's this whole Cadence situation. You're seriously putting your neck out for the sake of someone else."
    n "又出了凯登丝这档子事。你竟然为了别人不惜以身犯险。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6058
translate schinese m14choice14_2_20407eee:

    # n "Because you're pumped full of empathy."
    n "因为你心里充满了同情心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6061
translate schinese m14choice14_2_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6062
translate schinese m14choice14_2_77ad61ae:

    # MCt "So it's come to this?"
    MCt "事情竟然到了这一步吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6083
translate schinese m14choice14_2_8ebf57ad:

    # n "I worry about that sometimes... well... all the time, it's in the back of my head..."
    n "我有时会担心……不……其实我一直都在担心，这念头总是在我脑海深处挥之不去……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6084
translate schinese m14choice14_2_91258afe:

    # n "But there's nothing to gain out of my crying about it is there?"
    n "但光是为此哭泣也没什么用，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6085
translate schinese m14choice14_2_21d8faff:

    # n "Plus I've got the ever-reliable [name] to keep me safe."
    n "况且，还有值得信赖的[name]保护我的安全。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6096
translate schinese m14choice14_2_96109420:

    # n "Hmm... am I talking you up too much?"
    n "嗯……我是不是把你夸得太过了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6099
translate schinese m14choice14_2_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6104
translate schinese m14choice14_2_cff191b5:

    # MC "All done, Noelle. It's nice and cozy in here..."
    MC "好了，诺艾尔。这里面既舒适又温暖……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6106
translate schinese m14choice14_2_5553abd6:

    # MC "Hop in."
    MC "进来吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6107
translate schinese m14choice14_2_299586b5:

    # MC "...Please..."
    MC "……拜托了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6108
translate schinese m14choice14_2_fa846b68:

    # MC "Don't let my sacrifice be in vain..."
    MC "别让我的牺牲白费……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6109
translate schinese m14choice14_2_fc888cd2:

    # n "Uh..."
    n "呃……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6110
translate schinese m14choice14_2_126669b5:

    # n "What happened to you?"
    n "你到底怎么了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6111
translate schinese m14choice14_2_b710cb21:

    # MC "Oh, this? Looks like I used up a little too much energy reheating the bath..."
    MC "噢，这个啊？看来我刚才为了把洗澡水重新加热，稍微耗费了太多精力……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6112
translate schinese m14choice14_2_1a47bdc4:

    # n "Oh, wow! You really {i}will{/i} sacrifice anything for little ol' me!"
    n "哇！为了我这种小人物，你还真是{i}什么都{/i}愿意付出呢！"

# game/script2.rpyc:6113
translate schinese m14choice14_2_7ef5985a:

    # MC "Haha... you know it..."
    MC "哈哈……那是当然……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6119
translate schinese m14choice14_2_0ff279a6:

    # n "Make way! Noelle coming through."
    n "让一让！诺艾尔来啦。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6123
translate schinese m14choice14_2_1a81e142:

    # n "Ahhh...."
    n "啊……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6124
translate schinese m14choice14_2_5417b39f:

    # n "And just like that... I'm in heaven..."
    n "就这样……感觉像是在天堂一样……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6125
translate schinese m14choice14_2_d6cdd4de:

    # MCt "Ugh. Pressing herself into me so brazenly..."
    MCt "唔。她竟然这么大胆地紧贴着我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6126
translate schinese m14choice14_2_59f3f3f4:

    # MCt "It's... pretty nice..."
    MCt "感觉……还挺不错的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6142
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_be5eecd3:

    # n "Have we ever cuddled like this before? I don't think we have."
    n "我们以前像这样依偎在一起过吗？好像没有吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6143
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_5a467fe9:

    # MC "This is the first time in {i}my{/i} recollection."
    MC "按{i}我{/i}的记忆，这还是第一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6144
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_d0ff8c56:

    # n "Unbelievable it's taken us this long. I {u}love{/u} cuddling."
    n "真没想到竟然过了这么久才走到这一步。我{u}超喜欢{/u}依偎在一起。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6145
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_c8cf388c:

    # n "Never cuddled in a bath before. But being sandwiched between the warm water and the warm [name]..."
    n "以前从没在浴缸里这样相拥过。不过夹在温水和温暖的[name]之间……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6146
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_45860f14:

    # n "Holy shit! I think I could live like this."
    n "天哪！我觉得我能一直这样过下去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6150
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_b18e55c1:

    # n "You can put your arm around me if you want."
    n "如果你愿意，可以把手搭在我身上。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6151
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_237350de:

    # n "I feel like it'll be more cozy that way."
    n "我觉得那样会更舒服、更温馨。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6154
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_c969c00e:

    # MC "Enjoying yourself down there?"
    MC "在那儿感觉舒服吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6155
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_865d3648:

    # n "*Yawn*"
    n "*哈欠*"

# game/script2.rpyc:6156
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_2cd9ede3:

    # n "I'd say six- no- seven out of ten times, I prefer being the cuddl{i}er{/i} instead of the cuddl{i}ee{/i}."
    n "怎么说呢，十次里有六七次，我更喜欢{i}主动抱别人{/i}，而不是{i}被别人抱着{/i}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6157
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_eba1ac0f:

    # n "This is it. I've found the ultimate cuddler."
    n "就是这样。我找到了最棒的拥抱搭档。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6158
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_8d3d7325:

    # MC "Really? Me?"
    MC "真的吗？是我？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6159
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_fce1204f:

    # n "It's the big manly arms, [name]."
    n "全靠这双充满男子气概的强壮手臂，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6160
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_d03107a4:

    # n "No girl and her little noodle arms could do this."
    n "换作是个女孩子，凭那细胳膊细腿的可做不到。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6161
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_aad44ac2:

    # n "Well, maybe Grace, but she's still on my to-cuddle list."
    n "嗯……也许格蕾丝能行，不过她可是我列入“想拥抱名单”的人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6164
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_5f856367:

    # MC "Say... Noelle..."
    MC "那个……诺艾尔……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6165
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_73da4c8e:

    # n "Hmm?"
    n "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6166
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_b63439db:

    # MC "You really feel completely safe around me?"
    MC "跟我在一起，你真的觉得完全安全吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6167
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_60417464:

    # n "???"
    n "？？？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6168
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_8c996801:

    # n "Is this about my job?"
    n "是因为我的工作吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6169
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_2a087878:

    # MC "Well... what you told me about it..."
    MC "嗯……关于那份工作，你告诉我的那些事……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6170
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_7484af43:

    # MC "I thought maybe... you were a little scared of men or something..."
    MC "我在想，也许……你是不是有点怕男人之类的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6171
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6174
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_4991bda7:

    # n "*Sigh*"
    n "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:6175
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_8406caaa:

    # n "I guess we should talk about it."
    n "我想我们应该谈谈这个。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6176
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_c41098b4:

    # MC "We don't have to."
    MC "没必要谈。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6177
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_68108613:

    # n "No... I... I think it's important you understand."
    n "不……我……我觉得让你明白这一点很重要。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6178
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_e0ec4e39:

    # n "You're... right."
    n "你说得……对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6179
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_127c9a17:

    # n "I'm... intimidated by them..."
    n "我……对他们感到畏惧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6180
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_b4ff9139:

    # n "It's not always. Like, it's not that I can't bear to look at them, or that I'll hide away from a male cashier or something."
    n "也不是一直都这样。怎么说呢，并不是说我连看都不敢看他们，或者会因为收银员是男性就躲起来之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6181
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_a2546aee:

    # MC "Why are you looking so ashamed?"
    MC "你为什么看起来这么难为情？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6184
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_77aa0b87:

    # n "W-well..."
    n "这……那个……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6185
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_3b56ee3b:

    # n "It's not fair, is it?"
    n "这不太公平，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6186
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_1c53e0f5:

    # n "I'm professing my aversion to men... to a man I care so much about."
    n "我竟然在向一个我如此在乎的男性……倾诉我对男性的排斥感……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6187
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_94b5ae3f:

    # n "I'm sorry... I didn't mean to insult you like this..."
    n "对不起……我并不是有意要这样冒犯你……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6188
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_cdac9ff5:

    # MC "I'm not insulted."
    MC "我没有觉得被冒犯。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6191
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_bb2cf764_1:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6198
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_3d69fb43:

    # MC "Any idea what makes me different?"
    MC "知道是什么让我与众不同吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6199
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_bb2cf764_2:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6202
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_487eed9f:

    # n "Nope. No ideas at all."
    n "不知道。完全没头绪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6203
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_722987da:

    # n "Maybe it's simply because you've been with me forever."
    n "也许仅仅是因为你一直陪在我身边。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6204
translate schinese m14afterchoice15_a1a2d980:

    # n "Maybe you give off some stupid chemical that makes you different."
    n "也许是你散发出了某种蠢兮兮的化学物质，才让你变得与众不同。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6205
