# game/script2.rpyc:6477
translate schinese m14afterchoice17_2bf4b695:

    # MCt "Oh, well... I know the perfect way to take care of you."
    MCt "噢，好吧……我知道怎么好好“伺候”你了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6498
translate schinese main15_cc995d3e:

    # MCt "Looks like Stella's gotten real comfortable with texting me. Or texting in general, I guess."
    MCt "看来斯特拉已经习惯给我发短信了。或者说，她习惯发短信了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6499
translate schinese main15_3e4f1f68:

    # MCt "I'm guessing they did it the old school way, designating a time in person and both showing up."
    MCt "我猜他们是用老派的方式约好的：当面定好时间，然后两人如约到场。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6515
translate schinese m15afterchoice1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6516
translate schinese m15afterchoice1_e527904c:

    # MC "... ..."
    MC "…… ……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6517
translate schinese m15afterchoice1_a0451ff8:

    # MC "... ... ..."
    MC "…… …… ……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6545
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_90412b5f:

    # MCt "Huh."
    MCt "嗯。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6546
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_6b95c81c:

    # MCt "She texts kind of like a girlfriend more than a friend. Maybe she's talking to me as if I were a girl friend of hers like Cadence."
    MCt "她发短信的语气，与其说是普通朋友，倒更像是那种闺蜜。也许她是把我当成了像凯登丝那样的女性朋友在聊天吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6549
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_c404cda0:

    # MCt "Speaking of whom..."
    MCt "说到她……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6558
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_ff1cf182:

    # C "You can't sneak up on me. I can hear your footsteps, smell you, and saw some subtle movement in the reflection of the window."
    C "你可别想悄悄靠近我。我能听到你的脚步声，闻到你的气味，而且刚才还在窗户的倒影里看到了细微的动作。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6559
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_ed613eef:

    # MC "Yeesh, how ominous. A simple \"Good evening\" would have sufficed."
    MC "哎呀，真吓人。其实只要说声“晚上好”就够了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6560
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_03f00f78:

    # C "Good evening, master."
    C "晚上好，主人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6561
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_ff3c82d0:

    # MC "That's more like it. It feels less like I wandered into your trap this way."
    MC "这就对了。这样感觉就不像是我误入了你的陷阱。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6562
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_cf717ed4:

    # MC "What are you doing in here? It's all dark and quiet."
    MC "你在这儿做什么？这里又黑又静的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6565
translate schinese m15afterchoice3_9ff67381:

    # C "What does it look like I'm doing?"
    C "你看我像是在做什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6568
translate schinese m15choice4_1_9a604118:

    # C "I'm not thinking very hard at all right now."
    C "我现在可没怎么动脑子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6569
translate schinese m15choice4_1_7e17197b:

    # C "In fact, I'm doing to opposite. Not a thought in the world as I stare at the moon."
    C "事实上，我做的恰恰相反。凝视着月亮，脑海里空无一物。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6570
translate schinese m15choice4_1_7e31ca51:

    # MC "The moon?"
    MC "月亮？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6573
translate schinese m15choice4_2_9bd1c6c1:

    # C "I'm not quite that tired yet."
    C "我还没那么困呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6574
translate schinese m15choice4_2_4927c460:

    # C "Though I appreciate you entering my room so delicately in any case."
    C "不过，还是很感谢你这么小心翼翼地走进我的房间。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6575
translate schinese m15choice4_2_efc79b6b:

    # C "No, I'm not trying to sleep. I'm just sitting here, watching the moon."
    C "不，我不是想睡觉。我只是坐在这里赏月。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6576
translate schinese m15choice4_2_7e31ca51:

    # MC "The moon?"
    MC "月亮？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6579
translate schinese m15choice4_3_1df5cf11:

    # C "{i}That's{/i} what this looks like to you?"
    C "{i}在你看来{/i}是那样吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6580
translate schinese m15choice4_3_edf691cd:

    # C "No, I'm not rubbing one out. I'm just sitting here, watching the moon."
    C "不，我没在自慰。我只是坐在这里赏月。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6581
translate schinese m15choice4_3_7e31ca51:

    # MC "The moon?"
    MC "月亮？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6584
translate schinese m15choice4_4_1b2f1c35:

    # C "Correct."
    C "没错。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6585
translate schinese m15choice4_4_69a7253b:

    # MC "Sounds... boring..."
    MC "听起来……挺无聊的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6586
translate schinese m15choice4_4_a26191a2:

    # C "It does, doesn't it?"
    C "确实是这样，不是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6587
translate schinese m15choice4_4_5604ebca:

    # C "Have you tried?"
    C "你试过吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6588
translate schinese m15choice4_4_7a8bbb82:

    # MC "Falling into a stupor as I stare at the moon? No."
    MC "盯着月亮发呆？没有。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6590
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_06472acf:

    # C "Come here, give it a go."
    C "过来，试试看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6594
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_a6529a33:

    # MC "Oh, this is gonna be good."
    MC "噢，这肯定很有趣。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6595
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_da05cdf0:

    # MC "I can't wait to stare at all of that moon."
    MC "我迫不及待想好好欣赏那轮明月了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6596
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_ae437684:

    # MC "First, I'm gonna look towards the south pole, then eagerly drift my eyes towards the Tycho crater."
    MC "首先，我会望向南极，然后满怀期待地将目光移向第谷环形山。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6597
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_70ebd388:

    # MC "Tentatively tracing the ray system northwest to the Sea of Clouds, or Mare Nubium if you're feeling dramatic."
    MC "试探性地沿着辐射纹向西北追踪，直到“云海”——或者如果你想显得更有格调，也可以叫它“酒海”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6600
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_3ac22a1b:

    # C "Oh my god, you're such a fucking nerd, master."
    C "天哪，你真是个彻头彻尾的书呆子，主人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6601
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_cbd8ff55:

    # C "Why are you complaining? You know way more about the moon than {i}I{/i} do."
    C "抱怨什么呢？你对月亮的了解可比{i}我{/i}多多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6602
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_88f67461:

    # MC "Ah, but one mystery of the moon eludes me."
    MC "啊，不过月亮有一个谜团我至今未能解开。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6603
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_799f9ede:

    # MC "The mystery of what could possibly be so entertaining about staring at it."
    MC "盯着它看究竟有什么好玩的，这真是一个谜。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6606
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_712108de:

    # C "Look."
    C "看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6607
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_3c7e3614:

    # C "You know how it's pretty well agreed upon that there's something magical about the sun?"
    C "大家都公认太阳有着某种神奇的力量，你知道这一点吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6610
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_9ba682c6:

    # MC "Uh... so I've read."
    MC "呃……我确实读到过这种说法。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6611
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_8cd0421e:

    # MC "People mostly came to the conclusion after studying the effects that sunlight had on Quarteth skin."
    MC "人们得出这个结论，主要是因为研究了阳光对四重奏族皮肤的影响。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6612
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_7a28aba8:

    # C "You feel it, right? Magic from the sun?"
    C "你能感觉到吧？来自太阳的魔力？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6613
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_6e888267:

    # MC "I feel magic all around, yes."
    MC "我确实能感觉到周围充满了魔力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6614
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_2252b610:

    # C "And in the sunlight?"
    C "那阳光里的呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6615
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_2cd3e027:

    # MC "Mmhm. It feels like more sunlight, as if I can feel the heat rays from the sun and the magic rays from the sun separately."
    MC "嗯。感觉就像是更多的阳光一样，仿佛我能分别感觉到太阳的热射线和魔力射线。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6616
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_82751b36:

    # C "Right, so... The moon. Look at it. Do you feel anything?"
    C "没错，那么……月亮。看着它。你有什么感觉吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6646
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_1de050e9:

    # MC "Is that...?"
    MC "那是……？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6647
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_7482657f:

    # C "Do you feel it?"
    C "你感觉到了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6648
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_ec0acf7e:

    # MC "Uh... nothing extraordinary... but it kinda..."
    MC "呃……没什么特别的……不过感觉有点……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6649
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_d9a3c084:

    # MC "Kinda feels like someone's watching me..."
    MC "感觉好像有人在盯着我看……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6652
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_0d36b562:

    # MC "..." (multiple=2)
    MC "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:6653
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_e26c69ed:

    # C "..." (multiple=2)
    C "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:6657
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_ad9ab92e:

    # C "That's not what {i}I{/i} feel."
    C "那可{i}不{/i}是我的感觉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6658
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_604f4464:

    # MC "Strange. Maybe I'm imagining things."
    MC "奇怪。也许是我多心了吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6681
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_dca89c87:

    # C "You really get nothing out of it?"
    C "你真的什么都没感觉到吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6682
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_8664f8b8:

    # MC "Yeah, I meant what I said. Nothing. It's just a moon."
    MC "是啊，我是认真的。什么都没有。那只是一颗月亮而已。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6683
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_683fc644:

    # C "Hmm. I thought for sure you would see something because of how magically attuned you are."
    C "嗯。我还以为你肯定能看出点什么呢，毕竟你对魔法那么敏锐。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6684
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_bdb35c88:

    # MC "Magic?"
    MC "魔法？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6685
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_315b1546:

    # C "Yeah, so..."
    C "对啊，所以……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6688
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_207a850b:

    # C "When I look up at the moon. There's more magic there. Like from the Sun."
    C "每当我抬头望向月亮，总能感觉到那里蕴含着更浓郁的魔法。就像来自太阳那样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6689
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6690
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_54c6f09b:

    # MC "Are you sure that's not just from the reflected sunlight?"
    MC "你确定那不是反射的阳光吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6691
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_ea3b2909:

    # C "Almost certain. I can still feel it the same regardless of the moon's phase."
    C "几乎可以肯定。无论月相如何，那种感觉都一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6692
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_4d8c8357:

    # C "I can even feel it if I look in the direction of a New Moon."
    C "哪怕看向新月的方向，我也能感觉到。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6693
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_41d969c6:

    # C "But you're right. If {i}you{/i} can't see it, I could be imagining things. Or maybe it's a physiological difference between us. Something mundane between races, sexes, genes."
    C "不过你说得对。要是{i}你{/i}看不见，那可能只是我的错觉。又或者，这是我们生理上的差异——种族、性别或基因层面的寻常区别。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6696
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_514410a4:

    # MC "Okay, well. What's with staring at it? Are you a moth?"
    MC "好吧。那你盯着它看是为什么？你是飞蛾吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6697
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_d3f8c4e3:

    # C "Ahaha. A very appropriate metaphor."
    C "哈哈，这个比喻很贴切。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6698
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_f90ea78a:

    # C "We don't know exactly what the deal is with moths and lights, but they probably use the moon and stars to orient themselves."
    C "虽然我们不完全清楚飞蛾与光的关系，但它们大概是利用月亮和星星来辨别方向的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6699
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_a63bfdc0:

    # C "Moon gazing has become an almost-nightly routine for me. You could call it calibration if you will."
    C "赏月成了我几乎每晚的例行公事。你要是愿意，也可以称之为“校准”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6700
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_21e4876a:

    # C "With a lot on my mind and so little to do, turning off my brain and basking in the light of the moon was comforting."
    C "心事重重却又无所事事时，放空大脑、沐浴在月光下，能给我带来一种慰藉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6701
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_f637808c:

    # MC "Heh, kinda like a save point."
    MC "嘿，就像存档点一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6702
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_997f0cde:

    # C "A save point?"
    C "存档点？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6703
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_8f114358:

    # MC "Like in a video game."
    MC "就像电子游戏里的那种。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6706
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_9f914b15:

    # C "Ah, forgive me. I've never played one before."
    C "啊，抱歉。我以前从未玩过那种东西。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6707
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_c511bd22:

    # C "Such things were way over budget for me and my family."
    C "对我和我的家人来说，那些东西太昂贵了，超出了我们的预算。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6708
translate schinese m15afterchoice4_778544bc:

    # C "I had to take pleasure in the... cheaper things in life."
    C "我只能从生活中……那些廉价的事物中寻找乐趣。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6714
translate schinese m15choice5_1_51beb07a:

    # MC "Well, for now. You can put those struggles behind you."
    MC "不过，从现在起，你可以把那些苦日子抛在脑后了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6715
translate schinese m15choice5_1_3f585fda:

    # MC "I've got money, ergo, you've got money."
    MC "我有钱，也就是说，你也有钱了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6716
translate schinese m15choice5_1_0474fca2:

    # MC "Hell, you're my responsibility, so I don't mind spoiling you once in a while."
    MC "毕竟你归我负责，偶尔宠宠你也无妨。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6717
translate schinese m15choice5_1_efa42804:

    # C "*Sigh* I feel plenty spoiled already, master."
    C "*叹气* 我觉得我已经备受宠爱了，主人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6718
translate schinese m15choice5_1_bc421dac:

    # C "But I understand your message loud and clear. Thank you."
    C "但我完全明白您的心意。谢谢您。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6719
translate schinese m15choice5_1_634b6b51:

    # C "With that said, please don't worry about me so much. You don't need to sacrifice anything else for me as long as you're here."
    C "话虽如此，也请您别太为我操心了。只要你留在这里，就不需要再为我牺牲任何东西了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6720
translate schinese m15choice5_1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6726
translate schinese m15choice5_2_489bb5a7:

    # C "Ha... haha... *Sigh*"
    C "哈……哈哈…… *叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:6728
translate schinese m15choice5_2_58be14e4:

    # C "Did Stella leak the details of our little secret meeting?"
    C "是我们那次秘密会面的细节被斯特拉泄露了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6729
translate schinese m15choice5_2_7d04e3f3:

    # MC "Looks like you have ties with a whistleblower."
    MC "看来你和那个“告密者”关系匪浅啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6732
translate schinese m15choice5_2_735ceefb:

    # C "Seems like her integrity is far too fragile. How to discipline her, I wonder..."
    C "她的立场似乎太不坚定了。真让人想知道该怎么管教她才好……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6735
translate schinese m15choice5_2_2824ecb4:

    # C "Oh, it's impossible. She's just too sweet. I'll let her off the hook."
    C "噢，那是不可能的。她实在太讨人喜欢了，我还是放她一马吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6736
translate schinese m15choice5_2_aa86b79c:

    # C "Yes, I admit it! Stella and I have been running away while you aren't looking."
    C "没错，我承认！趁你没注意的时候，我和斯特拉确实偷偷溜出去玩了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6737
translate schinese m15choice5_2_c9d14ee5:

    # C "Don't ground me, master! I yearn for more frosted delights!"
    C "别禁我的足啊，主人！我还渴望着更多美味的糖霜甜点呢！"

# game/script2.rpyc:6738
translate schinese m15choice5_2_e31d0d30:

    # "*Both chuckling*"
    "*两人轻笑*"

# game/script2.rpyc:6741
translate schinese m15choice5_2_b7778895:

    # MC "She sent a picture she took."
    MC "她发来了一张她拍的照片。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6742
translate schinese m15choice5_2_1af8b659:

    # MC "You both looked so happy and... normal. It warmed my heart to be honest... haha..."
    MC "你们俩看起来都很开心，而且……很“正常”。老实说，这让我心里暖暖的……哈哈……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6743
translate schinese m15choice5_2_5207890b:

    # C "I am happy. Deliriously so."
    C "我确实很开心。开心得简直要飘起来了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6744
translate schinese m15choice5_2_3e4c97d9:

    # MC "Deliriously? What did they lace that ice cream with?"
    MC "飘起来了？那冰淇淋里到底加了什么料？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6745
translate schinese m15choice5_2_7accf1f1:

    # C "Vanilla extract, mostly."
    C "主要是香草精。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6746
translate schinese m15choice5_2_ca3a760a:

    # C "So to answer your question, no. Not really. Ice cream was another luxury, though one affordable enough for me to have on occasion."
    C "至于回答你的问题嘛——没有，其实算不上。冰淇淋属于一种奢侈品，不过价格倒也还在我偶尔能负担得起的范围内。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6750
translate schinese m15choice5_3_e7460837:

    # MC "Well. While not ideal, it's one way to build character."
    MC "好吧。虽然算不上理想，但这确实是磨练心性的一种方式。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6751
translate schinese m15choice5_3_67b7f461:

    # MC "It's humbling, teaches you gratefulness, patience."
    MC "这让人学会谦逊，也教会了人感恩与耐心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6754
translate schinese m15choice5_3_2f6d7298:

    # MC "I'm not saying I was \"poor\" back then..."
    MC "我并不是说我当时很“穷”……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6755
translate schinese m15choice5_3_339986c6:

    # MC "But my parents weren't exactly as high up the ladder as they are now."
    MC "但那时我父母的社会地位还没像现在这么高。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6756
translate schinese m15choice5_3_ab3f22a2:

    # MC "So I know how it feels to just... not have things, you know?"
    MC "所以我明白那种……什么都没有的滋味，你懂吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6757
translate schinese m15choice5_3_89d73995:

    # MC "It's one way to grow as a person so... clouds and silver linings or whatever."
    MC "这也是个人成长的一种途径嘛……就像乌云背后总有阳光之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6758
translate schinese m15choice5_3_e4ccb4e4:

    # MC "Plus it shows. You're one of the most humble and thankful people I've met."
    MC "而且这在你身上体现得很明显。你是我见过的最谦逊、最懂得感恩的人之一。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6760
translate schinese m15choice5_3_9d947b09:

    # C "That's a very mature way to look at it, master. And..."
    C "这种看待问题的方式真的很成熟，主人。还有……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6761
translate schinese m15choice5_3_057d8ec0:

    # C "Thank you..."
    C "谢谢你……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6765
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_0e6a69d1:

    # MC "So what other kind of \"Cheaper things in life\" did you enjoy?"
    MC "那你还喜欢生活中哪些“低成本的乐趣”呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6766
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_3a82c421:

    # C "Hmm..."
    C "嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6767
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_20f767bc:

    # C "I adored the beach."
    C "我特别喜欢去海边。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6770
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_1f92c0f9:

    # C "Close enough to walk. Only requiring an investment into sunblock once every blue moon when the bottle runs dry."
    C "离得近，走路就能到。只需在防晒霜用完时——那可是很久才会有一次的事——买上一瓶就行了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6771
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_2aad6d33:

    # C "Towels can be washed and re-used, there were public showers that provided their own soap."
    C "毛巾可以清洗并重复使用，而且那里的公共淋浴间还提供肥皂。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6772
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_5f623986:

    # C "I spent hours bathing in the sun, breathing in the air. Us cats have a more acute sense of smell than you humans do. So locations with such intense odors or fragrances are far more stimulating."
    C "我花了好几个小时沐浴在阳光下，呼吸着空气。我们猫的嗅觉比你们人类灵敏得多，所以这种气味浓烈或芬芳四溢的地方，给我们的感官刺激也强烈得多。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6773
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_530fd6df:

    # MC "You like to lie around and smell things for hours? I'm not quite sure I understand."
    MC "你喜欢躺在那儿闻来闻去，一闻就是好几个小时？我不太明白这是怎么回事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6774
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_95066aae:

    # C "I don't think you will. It's most likely not a subjective thing. I'm guessing it's linked to our cat instincts."
    C "我想你很难理解。这恐怕不是什么主观喜好的问题，我猜这跟我们的猫科本能有关。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6775
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_bc506ce3:

    # C "Besides, {i}hours{/i} is a slight exaggeration. I still enjoy the pleasures of the sea, the cool water, the beauty."
    C "再说，{i}好几个小时{/i}也有点夸张了。我也很享受大海带来的乐趣——清凉的海水，还有那美丽的景色。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6776
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_bf158b04:

    # C "I was overjoyed when I got my first pair of goggles."
    C "我第一次戴上护目镜时，别提有多高兴了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6777
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_351272e0:

    # C "To be able to immerse myself in the water, with all of the surrounding life."
    C "能让自己沉浸在水中，与周围的各种生命融为一体。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6781
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_2c3d2343:

    # C "When I was a kitten I used to dream big like any other little girl, being famous or a princess or something."
    C "还是小猫的时候，我也像其他小女孩一样，做过各种宏大的梦——比如成名啊，当公主之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6782
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_88ba6bba:

    # C "Once you get older and the cynicism kicks in, your goals become much more reasonable."
    C "等年纪大了，看透了世事，目标也就变得务实多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6783
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_915c04f8:

    # C "I wanted to be a marine biologist. There was a reef not too far out from the beach we used, it had a vibrant biome of animals, small fish, big fish, crustaceans, anemones..."
    C "我当时想成为一名海洋生物学家。离我们去的那片海滩不远处有一处礁石，那里有着生机勃勃的生物群落，包括各种鱼类（大鱼小鱼）、甲壳类动物、海葵……"

# game/script2.rpyc:6784
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_a025c7ef:

    # MC "Aren't anemones plants?"
    MC "海葵难道不是植物吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:6785
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_388a21df:

    # C "I think you have sea anemones mixed up with the terrestrial anemones."
    C "我想你是把海葵和陆生银莲花（anemone）搞混了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6786
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_da643bce:

    # MC "But sea anemones look like mutated mushrooms."
    MC "可是海葵看起来就像变异的蘑菇。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6787
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_815871a0:

    # C "They're animals. In fact, they're predators, even."
    C "它们是动物。事实上，它们甚至是捕食者。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6788
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_2ac3f6f9:

    # MC "Hard to imagine being successfully hunted by a sea anemone."
    MC "很难想象自己会被海葵成功捕食。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6789
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_59818dd7:

    # C "They grab things that swim into them, or crawl in the case of crabs... I wish I could be fed by others' ignorance."
    C "它们会抓住游到身边的猎物，或者像螃蟹那样爬过来的家伙……真希望我也能靠别人的无知来填饱肚子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:6790
translate schinese m15afterchoice5_246f1e0b:

    # MC "So they just wait for things to come close enough then they just ensnare them?"
    MC "所以它们就是等着猎物靠近，然后将其捕获？"

