translate schinese m16afterchoice5_94d4e8d7:

    # st "...I don't get it..."
    st "……我不明白……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8508
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e26b6e46:

    # st "Mmmmm... I didn't want to walk anywhere today..."
    st "唔……我今天本来不想到处走动的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8509
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_15144941:

    # st "Hmm... I guess it won't be so bad. [name] can be fun to talk to and stuff..."
    st "嗯……我想应该也没那么糟吧。和[name]聊天什么的，其实挺有意思的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8510
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_a855acea:

    # st "*Sigh* It looks like I don't have a choice. I think Ronald's planning something I'm too dense to understand..."
    st "*叹气* 看来我没得选了。我觉得罗纳德肯定在策划什么，只是我太迟钝，没能领会他的意图……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8513
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e7c0e051:

    # s "Excuse me... I think..."
    s "那个……我觉得……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8520
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_77d5fccf:

    # ron "Heh!"
    ron "呵！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8527
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_61072d82:

    # MC "So what's the plan? The short notice sucked enough as it is, so I'd like to know at least a little bit of what I'm getting into today."
    MC "那计划是什么？这么仓促的通知本来就够让人不爽的了，所以我至少想知道今天到底要面对什么。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8528
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_41e67335:

    # MC "You said I had a lecture in the afternoon... come to think of it, am I going to have lecture with you?"
    MC "你说过我下午有课……这么一想，难道我是要上你的课吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8529
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_6e02809d:

    # MC "I'm not really sure which answer I'd prefer. The familiarity might make it easier, but there's a little thing called Stockholm Syndrome that may describe the underlying nature."
    MC "我还真不确定自己更希望是哪种情况。熟人授课或许会轻松些，但“斯德哥尔摩综合征”这个词，或许能道出其中的微妙本质。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8535
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c8f9bc12:

    # ron "*Sigh*"
    ron "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:8536
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_dc63f12c:

    # ron "Don't get your hopes up... or down either. I need you to sign a few things in my office, so we're heading there immediately."
    ron "别抱太大期望……也别太悲观。我需要你在我办公室签几份文件，所以我们现在就过去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8537
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c7a1cab2:

    # ron "Remember that I'm actually working there so that's going to mark the beginning of my shift. Hence why Stella is hosting the tour."
    ron "别忘了我其实是在这儿工作的，所以这会儿正好是我当班的开始。这就是为什么由斯特拉来带你参观。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8538
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_d2f00816:

    # ron "One lecture on magical theory in the afternoon, and you're good to go."
    ron "下午听一堂关于魔法理论的课，你就准备就绪了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8539
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_ffed7e50:

    # ron "The lecture may be slightly confusing and above your level for now, but we'll catch up sooner than later."
    ron "这堂课的内容可能有点让人摸不着头脑，而且对目前的你来说难度偏高，但我们很快就能跟上进度的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8540
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_96a51d27:

    # ron "All sounds good?"
    ron "听起来没问题吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8541
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_da320624:

    # MC "Sure thing."
    MC "没问题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8542
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_482dda95:

    # ron "Glad to hear it."
    ron "那就好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8552
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_ce961ca1:

    # MC "This place reeks of floor cleaner."
    MC "这地方一股地板清洁剂的味道。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8553
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_ffe03cf3:

    # s "You get used to it, at least it reminds you that it {i}is{/i} clean."
    s "习惯就好了，至少这味道提醒你这里确实很干净。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8554
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e197e9e3:

    # MC "Why are you so familiar with this place anyway? Considering you've been elected to give me the tour and all."
    MC "话说回来，你为什么对这儿这么熟？毕竟是你被选中带我参观的嘛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8555
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_496c4739:

    # s "Oh, I come here all the time. It's about two more weekly visits away from becoming my second home."
    s "哦，我经常来这儿。再来个几次，这儿简直都要成我的第二个家了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8556
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_9b690716:

    # s "When I was little; this was my daycare."
    s "我小时候，这里就是我的日托班。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8559
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_65e43d37:

    # s "I'd always annoy the educators and students, asking them to show and teach me magic tricks."
    s "我总是缠着老师和学员，让他们给我表演魔术，教我怎么变。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8560
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_8184c8c7:

    # s "I don't really know if my love of magic was nurtured here, but I love this place. Seeing people every day who are just as interested in magic as I am."
    s "我也不确定自己对魔术的热爱是不是在这里萌芽的，但我真的很喜欢这个地方。每天都能见到那些和我一样对魔术感兴趣的人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8561
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_b0fabf42:

    # s "More interested, in most cases."
    s "而且大多数时候，他们的兴趣比我还浓。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8562
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_1227510b:

    # MC "You like magicians?"
    MC "你喜欢魔术师吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8563
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_5259b347:

    # s "I love them! Magic has gotta be one of the coolest things around!"
    s "我超爱！魔术绝对是世界上最酷的事情之一！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8569
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_8b33fb2e:

    # MC "You know, I'm a little bit of a magician myself."
    MC "你知道吗，其实我自己也算是个魔术师。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8570
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_41d3a48f:

    # s "I am aware, I taught you most of what you know."
    s "我知道啊，你那一身本事大半都是我教的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8576
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8579
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_5c5b3c36:

    # MC "At the risk of giving your ego gigantism; You're my favorite magic teacher."
    MC "虽然这么说可能会让你更加自负，但你确实是我最喜欢的魔术老师。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8582
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_7247c811:

    # s "We'll see how long that opinion sticks. For all I know you could've made that choice at the flip of a coin."
    s "那就走着瞧，看你这个想法能保持多久。依我看，你当初做那个决定时，说不定就是抛硬币决定的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8583
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_1c590a9a:

    # MC "The most biased coin you could possibly find, yes."
    MC "没错，而且还是你能找到的最不公平的那种硬币。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8584
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_98ec20a0:

    # MC "It looks a little something like a Möbius strip."
    MC "它看起来有点像莫比乌斯环。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8585
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_b7537dd8:

    # s "I've met the lecturers here, many of them are {i}very{/i} likeable. You're in safe hands."
    s "我见过这里的讲师，他们很多人都{i}非常{/i}讨人喜欢。跟着他们很靠谱。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8588
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c1029eef:

    # ron "Here. Everything's photocopied."
    ron "给，所有资料都复印好了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8589
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2b093945:

    # MC "You don't have a photocopying spell?"
    MC "你难道没有复印用的魔法吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8590
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_b6a4a47d:

    # ron "Are you going to tell us that you've been capable of {i}that{/i} all along as well?"
    ron "你该不会又要说，其实你一直以来也都会{i}那一招{/i}吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8591
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_34b7cca7:

    # MC "Haven't tried it."
    MC "没试过。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8592
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c3a7222d:

    # MC "But if you want to fan-girl over me, I can give it a go."
    MC "不过，如果你想以此为契机崇拜我一下，我倒是不介意试试看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8593
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e7e9160a:

    # ron "Sorry but I think the novelty of your miracles is wearing off."
    ron "抱歉，但我感觉你那些奇迹带来的新鲜感已经消退了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8594
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_0172f188:

    # ron "Either that or I've grown comfortably numb to them."
    ron "要么就是我已经习以为常，甚至对此感到麻木了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8595
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e945a804:

    # ron "The rest of the faculty will love you."
    ron "其他教职员工肯定会喜欢你的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8598
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_ae09bea0:

    # ron "This seems like a rather appropriate time for me to head to my lecture."
    ron "现在看来，我该去上课了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8599
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c0f626a7:

    # ron "About two more minutes and I'd have to run, thus destroying what remains of my hips."
    ron "再过两分钟我就得跑着去了，那样我这把老骨头——尤其是髋部——可就彻底废了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8600
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e6e7880c:

    # MC "You have hip issues?"
    MC "你的髋部有问题？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8601
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_7e00e5c3:

    # ron "It's called age. Affects a hundred percent of us."
    ron "这就是所谓的“上了年纪”。我们每个人都逃不过。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8604
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_8eb812c3:

    # ron "Don't forget the time of your lecture. Three P.M."
    ron "别忘了上课时间。下午三点。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8605
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_63eef1eb:

    # MC "Hall twenty-five-B."
    MC "25-B教室。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8606
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_943d431d:

    # MC "Way ahead of you."
    MC "我早就记下了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8607
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_f1629357:

    # ron "Just checking that your impeccable memory isn't limited to magical concepts."
    ron "只是想确认一下，你那过目不忘的本事不仅仅局限于魔法概念。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8608
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_88a269e8:

    # MC "I forget names of movie characters all the time."
    MC "我经常记不住电影角色的名字。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8609
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_6e13a2f7:

    # ron "Hmm."
    ron "嗯。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8610
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_70c32109:

    # ron "Are you fond of movies, son."
    ron "孩子，你喜欢看电影吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8611
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_4d08e742:

    # MC "As long as they justify their length. These two-and-a-half-hour movies are killing me."
    MC "只要时长物有所值就行。那些两个半小时长的电影简直要了我的命。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8612
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_8b855395:

    # ron "There's a movie theater on campus. Maybe you can go see a movie if you get the tour done fast enough."
    ron "校园里有家电影院。如果你参观行程结束得够快，也许可以去看场电影。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8615
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_0d36b562:

    # MC "..." (multiple=2)
    MC "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:8616
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_19bb86e0:

    # s "..." (multiple=2)
    s "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:8617
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2a3fe1db:

    # MC "Perhaps. I'll think about it."
    MC "也许吧。我会考虑一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8618
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_31e59ad0:

    # s "I haven't been to a movie theater in ages..."
    s "我都好久没去过电影院了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8621
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_73d2670c:

    # ron "I don't plan on sticking around all day so go straight home when you're done."
    ron "我不打算在这儿待上一整天，所以你结束后直接回家。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8622
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_1cb5cc6a:

    # s "Will do, Ronald. Have fun."
    s "好的，罗纳德。祝你玩得开心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8623
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_5a7dcbde:

    # ron "Hmm, yes, the scraps of it I can accumulate while expounding Magical Synapse Deflection theory to a gaggle of disinterested twenty-year-olds."
    ron "嗯，是啊，也就是在向一群毫无兴趣的二十岁年轻人讲解“魔法突触偏转理论”时，能顺带捞到那么一点点乐趣罢了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8624
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_91f737aa:

    # MC "Sounds kind of cool, to be honest."
    MC "老实说，听起来还挺酷的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8625
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_92993672:

    # ron "In my fifteen-plus years of lecturing here I have never seen a student happy to learn about it. You'll find out next year."
    ron "在这儿教书十五年多，我从没见过有学生乐意学这个。明年你就知道了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8626
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_76ea2cdf:

    # ron "And yes. I have as little fun teaching it as they do learning about it."
    ron "没错。我教这门课时感到的无趣，跟他们学这门课时是一样的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8627
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_a2f209d1:

    # ron "Now, I've seriously got to be on my way."
    ron "好了，我真的得走了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8645
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_75532abc:

    # MC "So where to, boss?"
    MC "那去哪儿呢，老板？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8646
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_61025dcb:

    # s "Wanna go home?"
    s "想回家吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8647
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_07266d13:

    # MC "Yes."
    MC "对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8648
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c2c08587:

    # s "Unfortunately for you that was a joke."
    s "真不凑巧，那只是个玩笑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8649
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_00c74cab:

    # s "But the lack of hesitation was amusing. *giggles*"
    s "不过，你那毫不犹豫的反应倒是挺逗的。 *咯咯笑*"

# game/script2.rpyc:8650
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_81522830:

    # s "I suppose it would be best to start with the lecture halls so you know where you're going."
    s "我想最好还是先去看看阶梯教室，这样你就知道该往哪儿走了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8651
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_91daf19a:

    # s "After that, we can improvise."
    s "之后的事，我们可以随机应变。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8652
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_599bac96:

    # MC "Sounds like a plan... or quite the opposite, I guess."
    MC "听起来像个计划……或者说，恰恰相反，我想。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8653
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_41dca733:

    # MC "But let's go."
    MC "不过，我们走吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8660
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_d4b9b0a1:

    # s "So, on a scale from one to ten, how well do you think you know your way around?"
    s "那么，如果满分是十分，你觉得你对这里的地形有多熟悉？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8661
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_cbff0910:

    # MC "Could you really differentiate between an eight and a nine? And is this also one of those inflated scores where seven is average because five feels too harsh?"
    MC "你真能分清八分和九分的区别吗？这会不会又是那种虚高的评分——明明五分太苛刻，所以把七分当成平均分？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8662
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_991e4c44:

    # s "Hmm... I suppose you've got me there, smartypants, qualifying yourself for higher education in a matter of weeks and spreading your pedantry while you do it."
    s "嗯……看来你把我问住了，小机灵鬼。没花几周就拿到了高等教育的资格，顺便还卖弄了一番学问。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8663
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2cbbec41:

    # MC "It's a ten, by the way. This place's layout is as intuitive as it gets. And the signposting is as clear as day."
    MC "顺便说一句，我给十分。这里的布局极其直观，指示牌也一目了然。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8664
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_155c8779:

    # s "Good. If you got lost I'd tell Ronald he needs to hold your hand while he guides you to your lectures."
    s "很好。如果你迷路了，我会告诉罗纳德，让他牵着你的手带你去上课。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8667
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_25b0736d:

    # MC "I gotta say, this has gotta be one of the loudest libraries I've ever been in. Where are the cutting glares and shushing?"
    MC "说真的，这绝对是我去过的最吵的图书馆之一。那些严厉的瞪视和“嘘”声都去哪儿了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8668
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_ae3e17f5:

    # s "This is a tiered library, it gets quieter the more stairs you climb. The idea is that you can have group study sessions down here with all of those friends you're bound to make."
    s "这是一座分层式图书馆，楼层越高就越安静。这样设计是为了让你可以在楼下和朋友们一起学习——毕竟你肯定会交到很多朋友的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8669
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_dbdfa20a:

    # MC "You have a lot of faith in me."
    MC "你对我很有信心啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8670
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_81dd42a8:

    # s "You don't think you can make friends?"
    s "难道你觉得自己交不到朋友吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8671
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_62de95b2:

    # MC "Nah, you have a lot of faith that I'm going to study at all."
    MC "哈，你还真信我会去学习啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8672
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_73f5b6f4:

    # s "Ahaha... I think {i}someone{/i} will let you know if you're falling too far behind."
    s "哈哈……我想，要是你落后太多的话，{i}某人{/i}会提醒你的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8673
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_3bbc4dca:

    # MC "I might find myself in here between lectures. Maybe reading, probably doing nothing."
    MC "课间空档我可能会来这儿待会儿。也许会看点书，或者纯粹发发呆。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8674
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_33ef8c4c:

    # s "It's a good place to take a break, I come here sometimes when I'm stuck on campus for whatever reason."
    s "这儿是个休息的好地方，有时候因为各种原因被困在校园里时，我也会来这儿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8677
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_cf909fd4:

    # s "You don't have to study. There are tons of cool books here to read about pretty much any topic. Remember this {i}isn't{/i} a magic university, there are all kinds of things to read about."
    s "你不一定非得学习。这儿有很多很棒的书，涵盖了各种各样的题材。记住，这里{i}不是{/i}什么魔法大学，什么东西都有得读。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8678
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_a19f6069:

    # s "I've read dozens of them while I've stayed here."
    s "我待在这里的这段时间，已经读了好几十本了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8679
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_963f2315:

    # s "I've read stuff on..."
    s "我读过关于……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8682
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8683
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_6f4e99ff:

    # s "Magic..."
    s "魔法的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8684
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2a3b37c2:

    # s "And..."
    s "还有……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8685
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e7ffe2c3:

    # s "More magic..."
    s "更多关于魔法的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8688
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_9c91b138:

    # s "Well- I'm more into magic history than magic itself, so it's a little different."
    s "嗯——比起魔法本身，我更感兴趣的是魔法史，所以情况有点不一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8691
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2407c54f:

    # MC "Magic history, huh? Could you tell me where it all started?"
    MC "魔法史啊？你能告诉我这一切是怎么开始的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8694
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_91d38a8d:

    # s "You don't know that?!"
    s "你不知道这个？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8695
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_0a73a294:

    # MC "Yes, yes, the rock I slept under was lavish and a true testament to humanity's complacency."
    MC "是啊是啊，我以前睡觉的那块石头可豪华了，简直是人类安于现状的绝佳写照。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8696
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_c5aa3f78:

    # s "Oh, sorry, I didn't mean to react like that."
    s "噢，抱歉，我刚才的反应有点过激了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8697
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_4f4c9394:

    # MC "Don't worry, I'm joking. I understand that I'm abnormal in this regard."
    MC "别担心，我是在开玩笑呢。我明白自己在这一点上有些异于常人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8700
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_458ae43b:

    # s "Hmm... I guess I can teach you a {i}little{/i} bit about Riser Khissi in the meantime."
    s "嗯……趁现在，我倒是可以给你讲讲{i}一点{/i}关于莱泽·基西（Riser Khissi）的事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8701
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_6b3893e9:

    # MC "Who?!"
    MC "谁？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8704
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_bd5b9333:

    # s "Riser Khissi."
    s "莱泽·基西。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8705
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_7b60fd23:

    # MC "Woah, what kind of name is that? It's like a movie name or something."
    MC "哇，这是什么名字啊？听起来像电影片名似的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8706
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_f4c59340:

    # s "His life is even more fascinating than his name."
    s "他的人生经历比他的名字还要精彩。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8707
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_a6e017ee:

    # MC "One more time again; what was it?"
    MC "再说一遍，那到底是什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8708
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_bd5b9333_1:

    # s "Riser Khissi."
    s "莱泽·基西。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8709
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_d246e8d0:

    # MC "Okay, Stella, you have my attention, so who is this Riser Khissi?"
    MC "好吧，斯特拉，你成功引起了我的注意，那么这个莱泽·基西究竟是谁？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8710
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_a492c21a:

    # s "Well, we don't have the time for me to go over everything, but he's an ancient human believed to be {b}the progenitor of magic and creator of Golems{/b}."
    s "嗯，没时间把所有细节都讲一遍了，但他是一位古老的人类，被认为是{b}魔法的始祖和魔像的创造者{/b}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8713
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_06adcf17:

    # MC "Wait, wait, wait-"
    MC "等等，等等，等等——"

# game/script2.rpyc:8714
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_55bd99ff:

    # MC "Magic was made by a dude? It's not just a thing that happens like photosynthesis?"
    MC "魔法是某个家伙创造出来的？它不是像光合作用那样自然发生的现象吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8717
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_6cd075b8:

    # s "Umm... I mean... {i}kinda{/i}?"
    s "嗯……我是说……{i}算是{/i}吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8718
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_b014adff:

    # s "Either he created it or he was the one to discover it. He's definitely the first person to be recorded as a magician."
    s "要么是他创造了它，要么是他发现了它。他绝对是有记载以来的第一位魔法师。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8719
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_34ac3b52:

    # s "People learned about magic and its uses from him, or... well... they copied him from observation."
    s "人们从他那里了解到了魔法及其用途，或者说……嗯……是通过观察来效仿他的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8720
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_5462f79b:

    # s "Regardless, there's no magic in society, or perhaps even the world, then this man shows up with inexplicable abilities and changes life as they knew it."
    s "本来，这个社会——甚至整个世界——都不存在什么魔法，直到这个拥有不可思议能力的男人出现，彻底改变了人们原本熟知的生活。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8723
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2d204a49_2:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8724
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_3f389e34:

    # MC "Doesn't that sound..."
    MC "这听起来……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8725
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_01ccbbfa:

    # MC "Doesn't that sound just like me?"
    MC "这听起来不就像我一样吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8726
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_7f6f1307:

    # s "Umm..."
    s "呃……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8728
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_a420cc13:

    # s "I suppose I see a parallel there but... what are you implying?"
    s "我明白你的意思，确实有相似之处……但你这话是什么意思？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8730
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_7f208eaa:

    # MC "Hmm?"
    MC "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8731
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2cc5a8a0:

    # MC "Oh, sorry. I was just thinking out loud. I can't really think of any meaning behind it."
    MC "噢，抱歉。我只是随口一说，其实也没什么特别的含义。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8732
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2323d255:

    # MC "Anyway, this Riser guy seems like a cool dude, bringing magic into the world."
    MC "话说回来，这个叫莱泽（Riser）的家伙听起来挺酷的，竟然把魔法带到了这个世界上。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8735
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_0b99adac:

    # s "Oh, good heavens, no!"
    s "噢，天哪，才不是呢！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8736
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_98d6ff28:

    # s "He and his band were a ruthless group of nomadic terrorists. I think it might have been a cult or something."
    s "他和他的团伙是一群冷酷无情的流浪恐怖分子。我觉得那可能是一个邪教组织之类的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8737
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_f5c89681:

    # MC "Hmm... what kind of stuff did they get up to?"
    MC "嗯……他们都干了些什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8738
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_89a5c581:

    # s "A lot of ransacking, by the sounds of it. Villages would be torn apart and flipped upside down every few days."
    s "听起来像是到处洗劫。每隔几天，村庄就会被他们搅得天翻地覆。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8739
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_1af56408:

    # s "The only things stolen were supplies for their journey to the next target."
    s "他们只抢走前往下一个目标所需的物资。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8740
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_fbb51758:

    # s "It all sounds indiscriminate, as if they had a goal larger than terrorizing."
    s "这一切听起来似乎不分目标、毫无章法，仿佛他们有着比单纯制造恐慌更宏大的企图。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8741
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_fc46f1c4:

    # MC "Yeah, almost like they were searching for something."
    MC "没错，感觉就像是在搜寻什么东西一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8742
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_755dbd82:

    # s "Perhaps. A motive was never established, and unless you have the biggest surprise of all time under your magical sleeve, we can't exactly go back and find out. Though that sounds like a risky venture."
    s "也许吧。动机始终未明，而且除非你那神奇的袖子里藏着什么惊天大招，否则我们也没法回头去查个究竟了。不过，那听起来可是一场冒险之举。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8745
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_7cf466d9:

    # MC "Was it a popular cult?"
    MC "那是个规模很大的邪教组织吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8746
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_754f247d:

    # s "Definitely on the small side. Seven members including Riser himself."
    s "绝对算不上大。包括莱泽本人在内，总共只有七名成员。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8747
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_1ddd7422:

    # s "A diverse cast too. A human, a Common Elf, a Dark Elf, a High Elf, a Doomchild, and a Quarteth..."
    s "成员构成也很多样化。有人类、普通精灵、暗夜精灵、高等精灵、末日之子，还有四重奏族……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8748
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_38b2e78d:

    # MC "Gotta catch 'em all."
    MC "得把他们全都集齐才行。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8749
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_d733e649:

    # s "That's the gist of it. I'm sure you could find a book here... Or use the internet, I guess. I get the vibe that that's what you'd prefer."
    s "大致就是这么回事。我相信你可以在这儿找到相关的书……或者上网查查也行。我感觉你更倾向于后者。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8750
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_cbdb3e71:

    # MC "And you'd be entirely correct."
    MC "你说得完全没错。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8751
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_fcaeaf9a:

    # s "Ahaha. I guess we're getting used to each other."
    s "哈哈。看来我们已经习惯彼此了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8755
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_4ffc2d63:

    # s "Come on, let's head to the cafeteria."
    s "来吧，我们去食堂看看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8756
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_5a444206:

    # MC "You're hungry?"
    MC "你饿了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8757
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2b618463:

    # s "No, but it's part of the tour, and there's someone I want to introduce to you."
    s "不是，但这属于参观行程的一部分，而且有个人我想介绍给你认识。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8758
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_50713286:

    # MC "Color me intrigued. You're hiding a friend from me?"
    MC "这倒让我挺好奇的。你藏了个朋友没告诉我？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8759
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_e9c62d94:

    # s "Something like that."
    s "算是吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8762
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_6e21ab6d:

    # s "C'mon, let's go. It's this way."
    s "来吧，我们走。往这边。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8766
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_34e2f236:

    # MC "It's dead silent over here. Is this the haunted section of the campus?"
    MC "这儿静得可怕。难道这是校园里的闹鬼区域？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8767
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_0262ad87:

    # s "I believe most students are in lectures right now, [name]."
    s "我想大部分学生现在都在上课，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8768
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_fcf1b2bd:

    # MC "Stella."
    MC "斯特拉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8771
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_4fa43456:

    # MC "You've stopped calling me \"Master [name]\". What gives?"
    MC "你已经不再叫我“主人[name]”了。怎么回事？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8774
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_97421d5d:

    # s "Eh? Have I? I haven't really noticed..."
    s "诶？是吗？我倒是没怎么注意到……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8775
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_dd0a2553:

    # MC "I thought this was all part of the maid thing you had going on. What's the deal with that anyway?"
    MC "我还以为那全是你那“女仆”设定的一部分呢。话说回来，那到底是怎么回事啊？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8778
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_960f56dd:

    # s "Maids are the shining beacons of diligent assistance and care."
    s "女仆是勤勉协助与关怀他人的光辉典范。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8779
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_07fee09a:

    # s "They represent everything I strive to be as a person. Dedicated, selfless, determined."
    s "她们体现了我所追求的理想人格——尽职尽责、无私奉献、意志坚定。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8780
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_39403b54:

    # s "Maids are my heroes."
    s "女仆就是我的英雄。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8783
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_2d204a49_3:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8784
translate schinese m16afterchoice5_ebbc34d8:

    # MCt "Is she serious?"
    MCt "她是认真的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8790
translate schinese m16choice7_1_316f26b0:

    # s "Hey!!"
    s "喂！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8795
translate schinese m16choice7_2_570e85bc:

    # s "C-cute..."
    s "好……好可爱……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8799
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_8fd2757d:

    # s "I'm serious!"
    s "我是认真的！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8811
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_9cbf98a9:

    # nobody "Ahh, sorry, sorry! I just couldn't let that shot slip out of my grasp."
    nobody "啊，抱歉抱歉！我实在不想错过那个拍摄机会。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8812
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_fb6bf075:

    # MC "Who are you, and will I receive royalties for that photograph?"
    MC "你是谁？那张照片我会拿到版税吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8813
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_c238cc8f:

    # nobody "I'll be sure to forward you a hundred percent of the zero profit I'll make."
    nobody "我会把那“零利润”的百分之百都转给你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8816
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_11e3b0f9:

    # ph "Name's Philly. Err... compulsive photographer."
    ph "我叫菲利。呃……是个摄影狂。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8817
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_2ccf5b23:

    # MC "I can see that. I don't think it'd hurt to get into the habit of asking."
    MC "看得出来。不过，养成先征求同意的习惯也没什么坏处吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8818
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_66482b08:

    # ph "I know, I know. It's my worst habit."
    ph "我知道，我知道。这是我最糟糕的毛病。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8819
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_b325f9cb:

    # ph "I'm trying to capture as many moments as possible for my assignment."
    ph "为了我的拍摄任务，我正努力捕捉尽可能多的瞬间。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8822
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_9ce16ef1:

    # s "Oh, wow! It's not just a hobby?"
    s "哇！这不仅仅是爱好吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8823
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_8d87e1f7:

    # ph "It's taking over my life more like..."
    ph "倒不如说，它快要占据我的整个生活了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8825
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_a1e5519b:

    # ph "Thanks for the shot. I can keep it right? No-one else is going to see it outside of the academia."
    ph "谢谢你让我拍这张照片。我可以留着它吧？除了学术圈的人，不会有别人看到的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8826
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_47fdcc39:

    # ph "It's not... quite what I wanted, but it's a great shot nonetheless."
    ph "虽然……不太完全符合我的预期，但这依然是一张很棒的照片。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8829
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_c08304fc:

    # MC "Well, what {i}is{/i} it that you wanted? Neither of us are photographers, but we might be able to help you out or throw some ideas your way."
    MC "那么，你想要什么呢？我们俩虽然都不是摄影师，但或许能帮上忙，或者给你提供一些点子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8830
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_f8a625e8:

    # s "Ahaha! Can I model for you?! I've never modeled before!"
    s "啊哈哈！我可以给你当模特吗？！我以前从来没当过模特呢！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8832
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_7f3c7199:

    # ph "Err... if you could {i}both{/i} model for me, that would be great."
    ph "呃……如果你们{i}俩{/i}能一起给我当模特，那就太好了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8833
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_615d78fb:

    # MC "What's the subject?"
    MC "主题是什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8834
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_fe5148fc:

    # ph "{b}Romance{/b}."
    ph "{b}浪漫风格{/b}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8841
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_ee4cd3ed:

    # MC "...Romance?"
    MC "……浪漫风格？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8842
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_a0d839fa:

    # ph "Yes. Romance."
    ph "对，浪漫风格。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8843
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_82f0a174:

    # ph "If I could take you two to the studio to take some couples' photos together that would help me a bunch!"
    ph "如果能带你们俩去摄影棚拍些情侣照，那可真是帮了大忙了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8851
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_291fc267:

    # s "W-w-w-w-w-what do we do?!! He thinks we're a c-c-c-c-"
    s "这、这、这、这、这该怎么办？！他以为我们是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8852
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_3893df89:

    # MC "A couple?"
    MC "情侣？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8853
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_23a848fe:

    # s "Yes!!!" with vpunch
    s "太好了！！！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:8854
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_92f14705:

    # MC "It's just posing, he doesn't need {i}real{/i} lovebirds."
    MC "只是摆个姿势而已，他不需要{i}真正{/i}的情侣。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8855
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_85a842a3:

    # s "But it's like, super embarrassing! I'm not an actress! I don't think I can do this!"
    s "可是……这也太尴尬了吧！我又不是演员！我觉得我做不来！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8856
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_65b60e17:

    # MC "Calm down. We don't have to do it at all. It'll be nice to help the guy, but it doesn't really concern us."
    MC "冷静点。我们完全没必要非得这么做。虽然能帮到他也不错，但这事儿跟我们其实没多大关系。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8857
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_8c0c0d93:

    # s "P-please. I don't know... I don't think I feel comfortable doing this..."
    s "拜、拜托……我不知道……我觉得做这种事让我很不自在……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8858
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_e4520e4d:

    # MC "We don't have to go along with anything. We're not signing a contract. You tell me you're uncomfortable, and we're walking out."
    MC "我们没必要非得照办。又不是签什么合同。只要你说你不舒服，我们就直接走人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8865
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_715ba1f0:

    # s "P-please! Just make your mind up!!"
    s "求、求你了！快拿个主意吧！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8866
translate schinese m16afterchoice7_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:8874
translate schinese m16choice8_1_e02cf24b:

    # MC "Sorry, man. We're busy. Good luck with your assignment."
    MC "抱歉啊，伙计。我们很忙。祝你的任务顺利。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8875
translate schinese m16choice8_1_7428e756:

    # ph "Aww, man... that sucks... you two look so great. Well, don't let me keep you. There's plenty of people here for me to find."
    ph "哎呀……真遗憾……你们俩看起来真般配。那我就不打扰你们了，这里还有很多人我可以去找。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8878
translate schinese m16choice8_1_e4c6d16c:

