    MCt "看来这对她来说有点勉强。老实说，这个要求连我也觉得有点意外。我本来以为顶多就是牵牵手而已。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8925
translate schinese m16choice8_2_0c3365d1:

    # MCt "It's a shame, but it looks like I'll need to put a stop to this."
    MCt "真遗憾，但看来我得叫停了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8931
translate schinese m16choice8_2_b7bd1b26:

    # MC "Stella?"
    MC "斯特拉？"

# game/script2.rpyc:8932
translate schinese m16choice8_2_1929d27c:

    # s "I'M READY!"
    s "我准备好了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8933
translate schinese m16choice8_2_3df8fa29:

    # s "TAKE THE PHOTO!"
    s "快拍照吧！"

