    # ph "Relax and enjoy his warmth, Stella. I'll be taking multiple shots."
    ph "放松点，感受他的体温吧，斯特拉。我会连拍几张的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:8935
translate schinese m16choice8_2_7a26049f:

    # "You can feel Stella's heart forcefully pounding into yours as it palpitates wildly."
    "你能感觉到斯特拉的心在剧烈跳动，那强有力的心跳仿佛撞击着你的胸膛。"

