translate schinese m16choice9_1_6b71d773:

    # s "I can't help it! I've never c-clung onto anyone like this before!"
    s "我控制不住嘛！我以前从来没像这样紧紧抱着别人过！"

# game/script2.rpyc:8945
translate schinese m16choice9_1_6f2dc935:

    # MC "Well, uh... it's kinda nice, isn't it?"
    MC "嗯……这种感觉其实挺好的，不是吗？"

