translate schinese m16afterchoice9_9c4cf1ce:

    # ph "Level shots are fine and serve a purpose, but I hone in on those things like a drug-sniffing dog."
    ph "水平拍摄也没问题，也有它的用处，但我对这种倾斜角度特别敏感，就像缉毒犬闻毒品一样。"

