translate schinese m16afterchoice8_dc3d6a30:

    # s "That's right, Kelly. Little Stella is all grown up now."
    s "没错，凯莉。小斯特拉现在长成大姑娘了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9056
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_0b2ec629:

    # kel "Oh, no, I'm gonna start sobbing like a proud mother... I've known you since you were making eye contact with my knees."
    kel "噢，天哪，我都要像个骄傲的母亲一样热泪盈眶了……我认识你的时候，你个头才刚到我膝盖那么高。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9057
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_1f8b93c4:

    # kel "And now you're an adult."
    kel "而现在你已经是个成年人了。"

