    # kel "Ahaha. I wonder who rubbed off on whom after all these years of knowing each other."
    kel "哈哈。真好奇认识这么多年，到底是谁影响了谁。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9114
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_9fdf927c:

    # s "Why are the annoying traits the ones that get transferred?"
    s "为什么偏偏是那些讨厌的毛病会传染呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9117
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_526deb8a:

    # MC "You two look close."
    MC "你们俩看起来关系很亲密。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9118
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_f364bcac:

    # s "Remember when I said this was my daycare?"
    s "还记得我说过这里是我的“托儿所”吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9119
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_f49c589c:

    # s "It's safe to say that Kelly was my guardian."
    s "可以说，凯莉就是我的监护人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9120
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_6aebeba0:

    # kel "Stella knew me when my hair was beaming with color, she was almost as adorable back then as she is now."
    kel "我头发颜色还很鲜艳的时候，斯特拉就认识我了；那时候的她，可爱程度可不输现在。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9121
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_e24a643a:

    # s "Oh, stop it!"
    s "噢，别这么说！"

# game/script2.rpyc:9122
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_cc923bdb:

    # kel "I don't recognize you, and I remember almost every face that crosses my path here. Are you a student?"
    kel "我不认识你，而我对在这里见过的每一张面孔几乎都有印象。你是学生吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9123
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_fc5695cc:

    # MC "Uh... kinda. I enrolled today. Or at least I think I have. Ron was in charge of all of that stuff."
    MC "呃……算是吧。我今天办了入学手续。或者说，我想我办好了吧。那些事儿都是罗纳德在负责。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9126
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_e80afb49:

    # kel "Wait. Are you that unbelievably scary magic prodigy he keeps talking about?"
    kel "等等。你就是那个他老挂在嘴边的、可怕得惊人的魔法天才吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9127
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_59a16354:

    # MC "Um. No. I believe you mean devilishly handsome and endlessly reliable magical terminator."
    MC "呃，不。我想你指的是那个帅得惊天动地、又极其可靠的魔法终结者。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9128
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_f93bb70d:

    # kel "Hmm... his tone definitely started leaning in that direction whenever he spoke about you and..."
    kel "嗯……每当他谈起你的时候，语气确实开始往那个方向发展了，而且……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9132
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_8021dfbb:

    # s "EVERYONE CALLS HER \"BIG KELLY\"! H-HOW COOL IS THAT?! I DON'T KNOW HOW IT CAME ABOUT BUT IT STUCK FOR YEARS!" with vpunch
    s "大家都叫她“大凯莉”！这——这多酷啊？！我不知道这外号是怎么来的，但这么多年来一直没变过！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:9133
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_e98e02bf_1:

    # kel "..."
    kel "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9136
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_a28b492e:

    # kel "I'm sorry, what was your name again?"
    kel "抱歉，请问你叫什么名字来着？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9137
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5668a760:

    # MC "[name]."
    MC "[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9138
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_0fd8c331:

    # kel "[name]. It was nice meeting you but... can I have a private little chat with our purple-headed cutie over here for a moment?"
    kel "[name]。很高兴见到你，不过……我能和这位紫头发的可爱姑娘单独聊几句吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9139
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_d23ebe93:

    # MC "Uh... sure thing... go nuts."
    MC "呃……当然可以……请便。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9140
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_02fc07f7:

    # kel "We won't be too long, go wait outside the kitchen for a moment, please."
    kel "我们不会花太长时间的，请你去厨房外面等一会儿好吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9165
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5bb2940e:

    # s "Wow! Amazing!"
    s "哇！太厉害了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:9168
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5e6615b1:

    # s "How did you make it jump like that?!"
    s "你是怎么让它那样跳起来的？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:9169
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_88e13d3f:

    # nobody "Uhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh.................."
    nobody "呃——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——嗯——"

# game/script2.rpyc:9170
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_298f94d5:

    # nobody "Newton's... third? Law?"
    nobody "牛顿……第三？定律？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9171
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_e58dd005:

    # nobody "I'm not gonna lie, I have no idea what I'm doing. I come here whenever I'm between lectures and my bros are busy. Just been kinda... winging it ever since I started."
    nobody "老实说，我根本不知道自己在做什么。每当课间休息，或者哥们儿们都在忙的时候，我就会来这儿。从一开始到现在，我基本上都是……见机行事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9172
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_80a6a156:

    # s "Lectures..."
    s "上课……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9175
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_1bf07ac4:

    # s "Where's [name]?!"
    s "[name]去哪儿了？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:9187
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5d085a70:

    # MC "What's brackin?"
    MC "最近怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9201
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_04e25964:

    # s "I'm so sorry about that, it wasn't too long, was it? Kelly and I have so much to catch up on. We're not even finished to be completely truthful."
    s "真抱歉，没让你等太久吧？我和凯莉有太多话要聊了。说实话，我们还没聊完呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9202
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_9e51b8ce:

    # MC "Not at all. Is there a cat that runs around campus? Is that normal?"
    MC "没那回事。校园里有只到处乱跑的猫吗？这正常吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9203
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_8dda0495:

    # s "A cat? Umm... You get them on campus sometimes, but there's not like... a regular one. At least not as far as I know."
    s "猫？嗯……校园里偶尔是会有猫出没，但并没有那种……“常驻”的猫。至少我没听说过。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9204
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_7403146a:

    # MC "Hmm... well I met one. Felt like we were hitting it off too. No idea where he ran off to."
    MC "唔……但我确实遇到过一只。感觉我们还挺投缘的。不过不知道它跑哪儿去了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9205
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_598c6713:

    # MC "How was your little private discourse with Big Kelly?"
    MC "你和“大凯莉”的那场私下谈话怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9208
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_d5a1b117:

    # s "I swear that woman must've conducted high-level government interrogations."
    s "我敢发誓，那个女人肯定搞过政府级别的高强度审讯。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9209
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_827b3499:

    # s "She can get anything out of you..."
    s "她能从你嘴里套出任何话来……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9210
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_b1cefa35:

    # s "Don't let her ask you questions you don't want to answer..."
    s "别让她问那些你不想回答的问题……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9213
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_c2b310dc:

    # s "Anyway- now that's out of the way we can keep moving."
    s "总之——既然这事儿处理完了，我们可以继续了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9214
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_72bdc013:

    # s "Sorry again for making you wait out here."
    s "再次抱歉让你在这儿久等了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9217
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2ed141aa:

    # MC "No biggie. I was enjoying the local entertainment in the form of solo pool."
    MC "没关系。我刚才玩了会儿单人台球，权当是本地的消遣了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9220
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_05e3052a:

    # nobody "Heh. You could've joined in if it interested you so much."
    nobody "呵。既然你这么感兴趣，本来也可以加入的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9222
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2a4ff52d:

    # MC "I assure you that would've been a mistake."
    MC "我敢保证，那绝对是个错误。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9223
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5384c801:

    # nobody "Hell of a cocky streak you've got in you."
    nobody "你这人骨子里还真够狂的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9224
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_8ea73e74:

    # MC "You misunderstand. When it comes to pool..."
    MC "你误会了。说到打台球……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9225
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2c4b7035:

    # MC "I am {u}peepee-poopoo bad{/u}."
    MC "我简直是{u}烂得一塌糊涂{/u}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9227
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_f6e0d4e3:

    # nobody "Don't even think you could tackle this?"
    nobody "别以为你能搞定这个？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9231
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_9c7997ec:

    # MC "\"Tackle\"? Please. I can fuck this up in a {i}myriad{/i} of different ways."
    MC "“搞定”？得了吧。我能有{i}无数{/i}种方式把这事儿搞砸。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9233
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_9414bbfc:

    # MC "Let's see if I've improved by staying away for a few years shall we?"
    MC "离开这几年，看看我有没有长进吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9238
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_16b6499e:

    # MC "Prepare to see someone miss a shot in a way you would've never predicted."
    MC "准备好见识一下什么叫“完全意想不到的失误”吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9241
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_fbabedd4:

    # MCt "*Sigh*"
    MCt "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:9242
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2b8b0646:

    # MCt "I guess just like always, impromptu magic is gonna be my salvation here."
    MCt "看来还是老样子，临场发挥的魔法将是我的救星。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9243
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_431da3e2:

    # MCt "Not that I have a fucking clue how it's gonna help."
    MCt "虽然我根本不知道这到底能怎么帮上忙。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9244
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_b5eb8c65:

    # MCt "I wasn't even lying. Pool is one of the few things I genuinely suck at..."
    MCt "我可没撒谎。台球确实是我极少数真正不擅长的事情之一……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9245
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_0ececd55:

    # MCt "I always miss with the cue so..."
    MCt "我用球杆击球时总是会打偏，所以……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9251
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_d0303acf:

    # MCt "If I make it output a force ejection on the end there... the need for precision goes out the window."
    MCt "如果我能让它在末端产生一股强制推力……那就不需要什么精准度了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9252
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_7e0e3960:

    # MCt "I'll just kind of shove it in the right direction."
    MCt "我只要把它往正确的方向推一把就行。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9253
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_686bd28a:

    # MCt "..."
    MCt "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9254
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_31c298d6:

    # MCt "No clue how much force I need, but if it goes the right way I'll consider that a minor victory..."
    MCt "不知道该用多大力气，但要是能成，就算小赢了一把吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9255
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_18741748:

    # MCt "Here goes..."
    MCt "开始了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9298
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_3200da87:

    # nobody "..."
    nobody "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9301
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_3f665163:

    # nobody "Ayo, Big Kel! That's my bad!"
    nobody "嘿，大凯莉！抱歉啊，是我的错！"

# game/script2.rpyc:9319
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_d5d76214:

    # nobody "If all else fails... You can always try using your eyes... or your lungs... or both..."
    nobody "要是别的招都不管用……你总可以试试用眼睛……或者肺……或者两者并用……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9355
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_6d07802f:

    # nobody "Takes a little while to get used to. Not like I'm saying it's easy or anything."
    nobody "这需要点时间来适应。我可没说这事儿很简单。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9356
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_17f689b8:

    # nobody "But it's just a little trick I've figured out, y'know. Looked like you need it."
    nobody "不过这是我自己琢磨出的小窍门，懂吧？看你好像正需要这个。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9357
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_c7292618:

    # nobody "Anyway, I've got the worst habit of using the bathroom before every lecture, so I gotta slide my ass over there now or I'll be late."
    nobody "总之，我有种坏习惯，就是每节课前都要上趟厕所，所以我得赶紧过去了，不然要迟到。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9358
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_4386a64b:

    # nobody "Yelled at by teachers too many times would be my bet."
    nobody "我猜是因为被老师骂太多次了吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9359
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_77abd51c:

    # nobody "Catch you later, man."
    nobody "回头见，伙计。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9365
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_676ae2c7:

    # s "Did you feel that?! He let out so much magical power it felt like I was going to be crushed where I stood!"
    s "你感觉到了吗？！他释放出的魔力太强了，感觉我整个人都要被压扁在原地了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:9366
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_0a632385:

    # MC "Yeah, no kidding... I could barely move..."
    MC "是啊，真不是开玩笑的……我当时简直动弹不得……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9367
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_9ec90bc6:

    # s "Even you? That's scary..."
    s "连你都这样？那可真够吓人的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9368
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_7539ea65:

    # MC "Did you see what he did, though? He did exactly what {i}I{/i} was trying to do... but like nothing..."
    MC "不过你看到他刚才的动作了吗？他做的正是{i}我{/i}想做的事……但他做起来却显得毫不费力……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9369
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_7f2aaeda:

    # MC "I was trying to hold back as much as I could and I still blasted that thing off at cosmic speeds..."
    MC "我当时可是拼命克制着力道，结果那球还是像宇宙级速度一样飞了出去……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9372
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2eed539c:

    # MC "But that guy... He held nothing back and pocketed that ball like it was normal. Like nailing a putt with a full swing... or a rocket launcher..."
    MC "可那家伙……他完全没留力，却轻描淡写地把球打进了洞。就像是用全力挥杆的动作去推一个短距离推杆……或者说是用火箭筒去打高尔夫球一样……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9373
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_99769ca3:

    # s "I was genuinely starting to think that he was going to explode and vaporize everything in sight."
    s "我当时真以为他会爆炸，把周围的一切都瞬间蒸发掉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9374
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9375
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_16a8a40b:

    # MC "So was I..."
    MC "我也是这么想的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9380
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_72a6ad60:

    # MC "You know. It didn't really click for me that this campus is more like a small town until I saw the movie theater with my very eyes..."
    MC "你知道吗？直到我亲眼看到那家电影院，才真正意识到这个校园简直就像个小镇……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9381
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_000e530f:

    # s "I'm surprised that you've never set foot here before. It's like a whole district of the city."
    s "真没想到你以前从来没来过这里。这地方简直就像城里的一个独立街区。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9382
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_e4c8f161:

    # MC "Do you ever use this theater?"
    MC "你会来这家电影院看电影吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9383
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_7676ac34:

    # s "Never, I don't think I've seen a movie anywhere outside of my home before."
    s "从来不去，我想我以前除了在家里，就没在别的地方看过电影。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9384
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_22454bbd:

    # MC "For real? It's like a whole different experience. My attention span has been shredded by the internet but movie theaters are great."
    MC "真的吗？那可是完全不同的体验。虽然互联网把我的注意力搞得支离破碎，但电影院真的很棒。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9385
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5a64c31e:

    # MC "It's like you're trapped with the movie."
    MC "感觉就像被困在电影里一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9386
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_4284092e:

    # s "Isn't that kind of scary?"
    s "那不是很可怕吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9387
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_b54eba71:

    # MC "Are you scared of the dark and loud noises?"
    MC "你怕黑或者怕巨大的声响吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9388
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_1c3982d8:

    # s "Loud noises if they're unexpected. The dark; not at all."
    s "如果是突如其来的巨响我会怕。至于黑暗嘛……完全不怕。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9389
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_94bd6b29:

    # MC "Then you'll be fine if it isn't a horror movie."
    MC "那只要不看恐怖片，你应该就没问题。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9392
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_64e2a1e1:

    # s "Ugh... horror movies... I don't understand why anyone would watch one of those..."
    s "呃……恐怖片……我真搞不懂为什么有人会去看那种东西……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9393
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_501613bb:

    # MC "The same reason people go on rollercoasters or listen to sad songs, I guess..."
    MC "大概和人们坐过山车或者听悲伤歌曲的理由一样吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9394
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_5fbb03dc:

    # s "Well... I don't do either of those... Maybe I'll just never understand."
    s "嗯……这两样我都不做……也许我永远都无法理解吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9395
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_989f1570:

    # MC "It's definitely an acquired taste."
    MC "这绝对是种需要慢慢适应的口味。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9398
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_fdaafb91:

    # MCt "Hmm... what Ron said..."
    MCt "嗯……就像罗纳德说的那样……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9399
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_73d74674:

    # MCt "We actually {i}do{/i} have time to see a movie if it's short enough and on at the right time..."
    MCt "其实我们确实有时间去看场电影，只要片长够短，而且放映时间也合适的话……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9400
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_e0443be8:

    # MCt "Let's face facts, though... it'll definitely count as a date..."
    MCt "不过，面对现实吧……这绝对会被算作是一次约会……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9401
translate schinese m16afterchoice8_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9406
translate schinese m16choice10_1_29961051:

    # MC "So uh... Wanna try it?"
    MC "所以……呃……要试试看吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:9407
translate schinese m16choice10_1_2ed1dda4:

    # MC "Watching a movie, I mean..."
    MC "我是说，去看电影……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9408
translate schinese m16choice10_1_32d1f8e6:

    # MC "We've got time and Ron brought it up earlier."
    MC "我们有时间，而且罗纳德之前也提过这事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9409
translate schinese m16choice10_1_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

