translate schinese m16afterchoice10_7a0eb719:

    # MCt "*Sigh* I was never a good student. I always coasted by on well... talent, I guess. I can't imagine that higher education is going to be gentle to me."
    MCt "*叹气* 我从来都不是个好学生。以前我总是靠着……嗯……大概是天赋吧，一路混过来的。真不敢想象高等教育会对我有何“优待”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9549
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_080fe3ef:

    # MCt "And I thought I was done with studying, listening to teachers ramble."
    MCt "我还以为自己终于摆脱了学习和听老师喋喋不休的日子呢。"

