    # MCt "But still... learning, or better yet, unlocking the secrets of magic needs to be my top priority for the time being..."
    MCt "不过话说回来……学习——或者更进一步说，解开魔法的奥秘——眼下确实是我的当务之急……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9551
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_40ab32db:

    # MCt "Ron's got a lot of faith in me, but I dunno... I think he overestimates how studious I can be. Information retention and fast learning can only go so far."
    MCt "罗纳德对我很有信心，但我不知道……我觉得他高估了我能有多用功。光靠过目不忘和学得快，终究是有极限的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9552
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_383c7589:

    # MCt "Especially when it comes to the things you {i}can't{/i} be taught. Deduction, reasoning, potentially years of your life just to figure some shit out..."
    MCt "尤其是那些你{i}学不来{/i}的东西。推论、逻辑思考，甚至可能要花上好几年时间才能弄明白某些破事儿……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9555
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_31f60c10:

    # MCt "I should probably silence this thing. I don't want to embarrass myself on my first day..."
    MCt "我大概应该把这玩意儿静音。我可不想在第一天就出洋相……"

# game/script2.rpyc:9556
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_e548469e:

