translate schinese m16afterchoice10_3a18a8cd:

    # MCt "But damn, this place is starting to fill up. I'm guessing competition is fierce."
    MCt "不过话说回来，这里人越来越多了。看来竞争会很激烈啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9559
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_94771a5f:

    # MCt "I can feel little pockets of magic throughout the crowd as well. I guess I shouldn't expect any less from a top-twenty magical institute."
    MCt "我也能感觉到人群中散发出的点点魔力波动。毕竟是排名前二十的魔法学院，这也在情理之中吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:9560
translate schinese m16afterchoice10_32b8a275:

