    MC "呃……行啊，为什么不呢？反正我觉得刚才的对话还没聊完。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10125
translate schinese m16afterchoice16_7e977194:

    # ma "That's the spirit!"
    ma "这就对了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10126
translate schinese m16afterchoice16_520180b4:

    # ma "Do they lock these rooms?"
    ma "这些房间会锁门吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10127
translate schinese m16afterchoice16_2a150828:

    # a "How about we {i}don't{/i} wait and see?"
    a "我们{i}干脆{/i}不等了，怎么样？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10137
translate schinese main17_d829fc9f:

    # MC "We don't {i}have{/i} to go if you're so scared."
    MC "你要是这么害怕，我们{i}其实{/i}不必去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10138
translate schinese main17_9640b940:

    # s "W-who's scared?"
    s "谁、谁怕了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10139
translate schinese main17_2ecf6311:

    # s "I'm n-not scared of anything... ever! Not clowns! Not heights! Not small spaces! Not the Rock's acting!"
    s "我才不、不怕任何东西……从来都不怕！不怕小丑！不怕高！不怕幽闭空间！也不怕“巨石”强森的演技！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10140
translate schinese main17_b618e789:

    # s "S-sure I may be shaking a little but that's just the body's natural response to the unknown."
    s "我、我确实可能在发抖，但这只是身体面对未知时的自然反应。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10141
translate schinese main17_3c0538a7:

    # s "Y-you'll see. Once we're in there I'll be as cool as ice!"
    s "你、你会看到的。一旦进去了，我会冷静得像冰块一样！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10142
translate schinese main17_0690b0b0:

    # MC "You know it's okay to be scared."
    MC "其实害怕也没什么大不了的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10146
translate schinese main17_3b10745a:

    # s "I'm so scared; I think I'm gonna die!" with vpunch
    s "我好害怕；我觉得我要死了！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:10147
translate schinese main17_1aa11334:

    # s "I've never seen anything scary before! Even the poster gives me chills!"
    s "我从来没见过这么吓人的东西！光是看海报就让我背脊发凉！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10148
translate schinese main17_38dbac75:

    # s "Why would anyone want to watch something so scary?! Are you all insane?! Masochists?!"
    s "怎么会有人想看这么吓人的东西？！你们都疯了吗？！受虐狂吗？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10149
translate schinese main17_01f6746e:

    # s "Are you all too happy with your lives that you crave stress and terror?! Do you realize how totally unhinged that sounds?!"
    s "你们的生活是有多安逸，才会渴望压力和恐惧啊？！你们知不知道这听起来有多疯狂？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10150
translate schinese main17_ee655a23:

    # s "And who even has the imagination to make these things? Psychopaths! They should be jailed!"
    s "到底是谁能想出这种东西？简直是变态！这种人就该被关起来！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10151
translate schinese main17_70c44e44:

    # s "I can't believe I'm talking myself into this just so I can-"
    s "真不敢相信我竟然在说服自己去干这种事，就为了——"

# game/script2.rpyc:10157
translate schinese main17_224ab59e:

    # s "*Sigh*"
    s "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:10158
translate schinese main17_59166051:

    # s "It's fine. I can do it. As long as we agree that I'll never do it again if it's as horrible as it sounds."
    s "没关系。我能行。只要我们说好，如果体验真像听起来那么可怕，我就再也不干这种事了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10159
translate schinese main17_a09e7dea:

    # MC "Or we could just {i}not{/i} go at all if you find it so tough. Why are you putting up a front anyway?"
    MC "或者，如果你觉得太勉强，我们干脆{i}不去{/i}了。你到底为什么要硬撑呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10160
translate schinese main17_af87d015:

    # s "I'll go."
    s "我会去的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10161
translate schinese main17_c8c59a6f:

    # MC "Why, though? It doesn't sound to me like there's even a payoff for you. Seeing a movie with you seems like a fun idea but I'm starting to get the impression that this is pretty one-sided."
    MC "可为什么呢？在我看来，这对你根本没什么好处啊。和你一起看电影听起来很有趣，但我开始觉得这好像只是我的一厢情愿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10162
translate schinese main17_b917c65f:

    # s "It's not... [size15small]entirely one-sided..."
    s "也不是……[size15small]完全是我的一厢情愿……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10163
translate schinese main17_100c1bcb:

    # MC "What was that?"
    MC "你说什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10166
translate schinese main17_3147b081:

    # s "I'll be fine, [name]. How much longer until the movie starts anyway?"
    s "我没事的，[name]。话说回来，电影还要多久才开始？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10167
translate schinese main17_d2e1d618:

    # MC "About seventy minutes."
    MC "大概七十分钟。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10168
translate schinese main17_e7c1c4c4:

    # s "Yeesh, such an awkward time. Though I'm sure the wait won't be too bad, time tends to fly when I'm talking with you."
    s "哎呀，这时间还真有点尴尬。不过我相信等待应该不会太难熬，毕竟和你聊天时时间总是过得很快。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10171
translate schinese main17_76608af0:

    # s "What are you looking at?"
    s "你在看什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10174
translate schinese main17_b53b6262:

    # MC "Gimme a second."
    MC "等我一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10175
translate schinese main17_09611dd1:

    # s "Is it an emergency?"
    s "是有什么急事吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10176
translate schinese main17_727593ca:

    # MC "Nah, it's nothing like that. Just looking something up."
    MC "不，没什么急事。只是查点东西。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10177
translate schinese main17_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10178
translate schinese main17_178cd4ad:

    # MC "That'll do."
    MC "好了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10182
translate schinese main17_3cfd48bb:

    # MC "Let's go."
    MC "走吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10183
translate schinese main17_55f38fa5:

    # s "Go? Where are we going?"
    s "走？我们要去哪儿？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10184
translate schinese main17_329a98f8:

    # MC "Somewhere to help pass the time."
    MC "去个能打发时间的地方。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10187
translate schinese main17_faa5203a:

    # s "Hmm??"
    s "嗯？？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10191
translate schinese main17_8a38f536:

    # s "*Gasp*"
    s "*倒吸一口气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:10204
translate schinese main17_64a90f81:

    # s "ICE CREAM!"
    s "冰淇淋！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10205
translate schinese main17_e46359ad:

    # s "So many colors! So many flavors! What do I do?! What do I do?!"
    s "好多颜色！好多口味！我该怎么办？！我该怎么办？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10206
translate schinese main17_a8cefa3f:

    # s "How does a place so magical exist?!!"
    s "怎么会有这么神奇的地方啊？！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10207
translate schinese main17_a9eaff71:

    # s "I need... I need to think about this for a moment!"
    s "我需要……我得好好想一想！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10210
translate schinese main17_8fc26a5e:

    # MCt "I wish everyone was this easy to please."
    MCt "要是每个人都这么容易满足就好了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10211
translate schinese main17_c0e95bbe:

    # MCt "That enthusiasm is endearing as hell. Is this what Ron meant by \"behaving like a child\"?"
    MCt "这份热情真是可爱极了。这就是罗纳德说的“像个孩子一样”吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10212
translate schinese main17_3b1552e5:

    # MCt "She might just be a lunatic in the presence of ice-cream, though."
    MCt "不过，也许她只是在面对冰淇淋时才会变得像个疯子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10213
translate schinese main17_f812fd46:

    # MCt "Nice plan, [name]. This should calm her nerves and give her a nice memory with me. If the movie is a disaster, this moment will make up for it."
    MCt "好主意，[name]。这既能让她放松下来，又能给她留下美好的回忆。万一电影搞砸了，这一刻也能弥补回来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10214
translate schinese main17_07164387:

    # MCt "Not a bad way to handle a spontaneous first date. I've even impressed myself."
    MCt "应对这种临时起意的第一次约会，这招还真不错。连我自己都要佩服自己了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10215
translate schinese main17_d6ebc8a8:

    # MCt "What's my goal here anyway? Holding hands? I feel like that might be a little bit too much pressure for someone as meek as her."
    MCt "话说回来，我的目标到底是什么？牵手吗？感觉对像她那么内向的人来说，这可能压力有点太大了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10216
translate schinese main17_88fb3330:

    # MCt "We'll see how far I can take this."
    MCt "到时候再看能进展到哪一步吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10217
translate schinese main17_9f7264f1:

    # cash "Hey, do I know you?"
    cash "嘿，我认识你吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10220
translate schinese main17_e79ed82a:

    # MC "Huh?"
    MC "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10223
translate schinese main17_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10224
translate schinese main17_2bcf7e2a:

    # MC "Hm..."
    MC "嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10225
translate schinese main17_02d9b030:

    # MC "Nah, don't think so, buddy. You don't have any distinctive features that I could recognize."
    MC "不，应该不认识吧，老兄。你身上没什么让我能认出来的特征。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10228
translate schinese main17_096f2fc7:

    # s "That shade of green! So beautiful and vibrant! I think it's love at first sight!"
    s "那种绿色！既美丽又充满活力！我想这就是一见钟情吧！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10235
translate schinese main17_cdd7e668:

    # s "Mint chocolate chip is stealing my heart!"
    s "薄荷巧克力脆片口味简直让我心动不已！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10268
translate schinese main17_245d85d9:

    # MC "How's it going over here? You look like you're about to burst with giddiness."
    MC "这边怎么样了？看你那样子，简直兴奋得快要溢出来了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10269
translate schinese main17_2ba36c9e:

    # s "Help me, [name]! There's so much! I think I want one of everything!"
    s "帮帮我，[name]！种类太多了！我觉得我每种都想来一份！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10270
translate schinese main17_848b23e3:

    # MC "Can you even handle that?"
    MC "你吃得下那么多吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10271
translate schinese main17_d9305fff:

    # s "I'd have two of everything if I had the time and budget!"
    s "要是有时间和预算，我真想每样都买两份！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10272
translate schinese main17_965d17a2:

    # MC "Make a sacrifice and choose something. We're on the clock."
    MC "做个取舍，选一样吧。时间紧迫啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10278
translate schinese main17_619b5b0b:

    # MC "Hey, I don't know if I've said this yet. And sorry for being so serious all of a sudden..."
    MC "嘿，不知道我有没有说过……抱歉突然变得这么正经……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10279
translate schinese main17_27953d52:

    # MC "Seriously, thank you for being there for Cadence. She's been smiling way more than someone who's had her life should."
    MC "说真的，谢谢你一直陪在凯登丝身边。以她经历过的那一切，本不该笑得这么多。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10283
translate schinese main17_e1554201_1:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10290
translate schinese main17_9d489b3e:

    # s "Of course! Why would you word it like I'm undertaking some kind of task? She's uh... all things considered, my second friend. It's genuine."
    s "那是当然的！干嘛说得像我在执行什么任务似的？她可是……怎么说呢，算是我第二个朋友。我是真心的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10291
translate schinese main17_b100be71:

    # MC "You know what I mean. I'm just thanking you for existing I guess."
    MC "你懂我的意思吧。我大概只是想感谢你的存在。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10292
translate schinese main17_91c09327:

    # MC "I've come to care about Cadence a lot in a short amount of time thanks to the circumstances."
    MC "因为种种机缘巧合，我在很短的时间内就对凯登丝产生了深厚的感情。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10293
translate schinese main17_74d906a4:

    # MCt "Uh, oh... talking about another girl like this on a date is kinda..."
    MCt "呃……在约会时这样谈论另一个女孩，感觉有点……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10294
translate schinese main17_00946569:

    # MC "You said \"second\" friend? Mind telling me about the first? I imagine they're important to you."
    MC "你刚才说是“第二位”朋友？能跟我说说第一位吗？我想那个人对你一定很重要。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10300
translate schinese main17_f779c7c6:

    # s "P-perhaps..."
    s "也、也许吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10301
translate schinese main17_734fd003:

    # MC "Are you still friends with them?"
    MC "你和他们还是朋友吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10302
translate schinese main17_6e97d530:

    # s "...Yes..."
    s "……知道……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10303
translate schinese main17_0368e7d8:

    # MC "That must be a special kind of bond. I don't speak to my first friend at all anymore. Uh, well, unless you count Grace, but it took a while for me to consider that a friendship."
    MC "那肯定是一种很特别的羁绊。我跟我第一个朋友现在完全不联系了。呃，当然，如果算上格蕾丝的话另当别论——不过我也花了好一阵子才把那段关系定义为友谊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10304
translate schinese main17_b6821512:

    # s "M-maybe..."
    s "也、也许吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10305
translate schinese main17_b31384ec:

    # MC "So what kind of person are they?"
    MC "那他们是个什么样的人呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10306
translate schinese main17_a31e4683:

    # s "It's you..."
    s "就是你啊……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10309
translate schinese main17_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10312
translate schinese main17_30034a6e:

    # MC "Oh..."
    MC "哦……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10313
translate schinese main17_fb77ffc7:

    # MC "Right. I hadn't considered that... I guess you were homeschooled, weren't you?"
    MC "对哦。我没考虑到这一点……看来你是接受的家庭教育，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10314
translate schinese main17_b42ece9b:

    # MC "How long have we known each other? Two weeks? And to think I'm losing to Cadence already."
    MC "我们认识多久了？两周？没想到我这么快就输给凯登丝了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10317
translate schinese main17_5078afe2:

    # s "Ehehe, it's not a competition, [name]."
    s "嘿嘿，这又不是比赛，[name]。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10318
translate schinese main17_3781bc3d:

    # s "You can be my best boy friend!"
    s "你可以做我最好的男性朋友！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10324
translate schinese main17_8f028372:

    # s "Boy-friend." with vpunch
    s "男朋友。" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:10330
translate schinese main17_5b86c84b:

    # s "Boy... {b}friend{/b}..." with vpunch
    s "男……{b}朋友{/b}……" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:10336
translate schinese main17_0efe9ac0:

    # s "Friend who is a boy." with vpunch
    s "是男性的朋友。" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:10342
translate schinese main17_cd1df5a2:

    # s "Did I get any ice-cream in my hair?!"
    s "我的头发上沾到冰淇淋了吗？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10343
translate schinese main17_44eeaffc:

    # MC "No. You didn't."
    MC "没有。没沾到。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10344
translate schinese main17_c6817786:

    # s "Ahaha, that's great! I'd hate to ruin my hair!"
    s "哈哈，那太好了！我可不想把头发弄坏！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10348
translate schinese main17_cb047502:

    # MCt "Come to think of it..."
    MCt "现在想想……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10349
translate schinese main17_5a89c70d:

    # MC "Is your hair naturally that color?"
    MC "你的头发天生就是那个颜色吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10352
translate schinese main17_2533571f:

    # s "It's a branding... yes. It took me a surprisingly long time realize as well haha. I think I was a teenager by the time I noticed that no-one else seems to have purple hair."
    s "这确实是一种……品牌标识。说来好笑，我自己也是过了好久才意识到这一点。我记得直到十几岁时，我才发现原来似乎没别人留着紫色的头发。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10353
translate schinese main17_816b873c:

    # s "I'm quite fond of the color myself. If I may say so; I think the shade is rich and very pretty."
    s "我自己其实挺喜欢这个颜色的。恕我直言，我觉得这种紫色既浓郁又漂亮。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10354
translate schinese main17_581f0dbc:

    # s "Sorry, I know that sounds a little narcissistic, but it's one of my few prides."
    s "抱歉，我知道这听起来有点自恋，但这算是我为数不多的引以为豪之处了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10355
translate schinese main17_fe47f7c3:

    # s "I just hope it doesn't make me stand out too much, I much prefer blending into the crowd, haha..."
    s "我只希望这不会让我显得太突兀，我更喜欢混在人群中，哈哈……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10358
translate schinese main17_0c8160c0:

    # s "You..."
    s "你……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10359
translate schinese main17_f49dbc4b:

    # s "Don't think it's strange... do you?"
    s "不会觉得这很奇怪吧……？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10369
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_cc3db8cd:

    # s "Ehehe..."
    s "嘿嘿……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10374
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_860af2e5:

    # MC "You've got like five scoops of those things. I don't mind coming back here, haha. You didn't have to try every flavor at once."
    MC "你可是要了足足五球呢。其实我们可以以后再来啊，哈哈，没必要一次性把所有口味都尝遍。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10375
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_1651a5f0:

    # s "Mmmm... even so... There's just so many... the choice paralysis was getting to me..."
    s "唔……话虽如此……但种类实在太多了……那种选择困难症真的让人很纠结……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10376
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_abcebd93:

    # MC "Sounds like I found a good spot, huh? What do you think? Am I impressing you?"
    MC "看来我找了个好地方，对吧？你觉得呢？我有让你刮目相看吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10379
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_bfd95648:

    # s "Oh, no. I come here all the time. I think I've eaten every flavor here six times over."
    s "噢，不。我经常来这里。我觉得这里的每种口味我都吃过不下六遍了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10383
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10384
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_c27538b8:

    # MC "So what was with that reaction earlier?"
    MC "那你刚才那种反应是怎么回事？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10386
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_3d7eaea4:

    # s "Ice cream impresses me every time I see it."
    s "每次看到冰淇淋，我都会觉得很惊艳。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10387
translate schinese m17afterchoice1_ebddec89:

    # MC "Uh-huh..."
