    s "我不在乎。我们还有正事要忙。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10652
translate schinese m17cow_3887e2c9:

    # MC "Huh, I had no idea you'd be so eager to go watch a horror movie."
    MC "呵，真没想到你这么急着去看恐怖片啊。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10655
translate schinese m17cow_902b5882:

    # s "Ah-"
    s "啊——"

# game/script2.rpyc:10666
translate schinese m17cow_62b50c17:

    # s "Kick his butt as hard as you can!"
    s "狠狠地踢他的屁股！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10668
translate schinese m17cow_c62d62b7:

    # s "You're supposed to be walking me home here."
    s "你本来应该送我回家的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10669
translate schinese m17cow_63594bf7:

    # s "I want to go. Now."
    s "我想走。现在就走。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10673
translate schinese m17cow_2b050c1f:

    # MC "Oh, hell yeah!"
    MC "噢，太棒了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10675
translate schinese m17cow_c01ba9f6:

    # MC "Congratulations. You're off the hook."
    MC "恭喜。你不用负责了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10683
translate schinese m17cow_d8437665:

    # MC "He's really not doing his country any favors, is he?"
    MC "他这可真是在给自己的国家抹黑，不是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10684
translate schinese m17cow_d74e9896:

    # s "Did you know that Denmark surrendered in six hours? No-one seems to joke about that."
    s "你知道丹麦只撑了六个小时就投降了吗？好像没人拿这事开玩笑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10691
translate schinese m17cow_3742c3bc:

    # sta "Just the two of you?"
    sta "就你们俩？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10692
translate schinese m17cow_48af5e39:

    # MC "Just the two of us indeed. Here are our tickets."
    MC "确实就我们俩。这是我们的票。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10695
translate schinese m17cow_a60ef841:

    # sta "Is..."
    sta "那个……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10696
translate schinese m17cow_72ec01c1:

    # sta "Is your friend okay?"
    sta "你朋友没事吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10705
translate schinese m17cow_3c43911a:

    # MC "Oh, that? That just happens when she has a lot of sugar."
    MC "噢，那个啊？她一吃多了糖就会这样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10706
translate schinese m17cow_b2e9054f:

    # MC "We had some ice cream before coming here so she's got pure, unfiltered energy blitzing through her veins."
    MC "来这儿之前我们吃了点冰淇淋，所以她现在浑身充满了那种纯粹、毫无保留的亢奋劲儿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10707
translate schinese m17cow_71ae3203:

    # sta "Ahaha, my little brother is just like that! She looks so excited to see the movie."
    sta "哈哈，我弟弟也是这样！看她那样子，对这部电影期待极了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10708
translate schinese m17cow_e45baa55:

    # MC "Sure is, her blood pressure shoots through roof every time the subject is brought up."
    MC "确实，每次一提到这事儿，她就兴奋得血压飙升。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10709
translate schinese m17cow_3ee31a1c:

    # sta "Oh, wow! You two are so brave! I could never watch a movie like this, I'm too much of a sissy haha..."
    sta "哇！你们俩真勇敢！我可不敢看这种电影，我胆子太小了，哈哈……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10710
translate schinese m17cow_dcdd92a3:

    # MC "Don't worry about it, not everyone can be as hardened as us."
    MC "别在意，不是每个人都能像我们这么“身经百战”的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10714
translate schinese m17cow_2d2a7af9:

    # MC "Come on, Stella. Let's head in. You don't want to miss anything, do you?"
    MC "走吧，斯特拉。我们进去吧。你肯定不想错过任何精彩片段，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10715
translate schinese m17cow_a1186ae2:

    # s "Y-yes... [name]... on my w-way..."
    s "好……好的……[name]……我……这就来……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10716
translate schinese m17cow_501bb857:

    # s "Just give me a... moment to stop quaking w-with excitement..."
    s "让我……稍微平复一下这因兴奋而颤抖的身体……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10717
translate schinese m17cow_afc90559:

    # s "I've b-been waiting for this all d-day you see... n-now the time has come it's... quite overwhelming t-to s-say the least..."
    s "我……我可是盼了这一整天啊……如今时刻终于到了，那种感觉……怎么说呢，简直让人有些难以承受……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10718
translate schinese m17cow_e7627f03:

    # sta "I'm envious of your enthusiasm! I don't think I've been that excited for anything in my life before."
    sta "真羡慕你的那股热情！我这辈子恐怕都没对什么事这么兴奋过。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10719
translate schinese m17cow_516aff07:

    # s "Oh, please don't envy this. The side effects are absolutely not worth the trouble..."
    s "噢，千万别羡慕这个。随之而来的副作用简直让人受罪……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10720
translate schinese m17cow_05750f1f:

    # s "Sweating, nausea, difficulty w-walking, an inescapable s-sense of d-dread... It's r-rather difficult to cope when you're as excited as I am..."
    s "出汗、恶心、走路困难，还有那种挥之不去的恐惧感……像我这么兴奋的时候，真的很难应付这些状况……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10721
translate schinese m17cow_ae2e0220:

    # sta "Oho, I could only dream of being so passionate. Enjoy your night, you two."
    sta "噢嚯，我做梦都想拥有这份激情呢。祝你们二位今晚玩得开心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10722
translate schinese m17cow_14a0d4b4:

    # MC "Of course. Thank you very much."
    MC "好的，非常感谢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10725
translate schinese m17cow_6db5b632:

    # MCt "I don't get it... she could've just said \"no\"."
    MCt "真搞不懂……她明明可以直接说“不”的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10726
translate schinese m17cow_41511a64:

    # MCt "I wonder if she's trying to act cool or something. Too embarrassed to admit how scared she is, even though she's god awful at hiding it..."
    MCt "难道她是想装酷？明明怕得要死却不好意思承认，尽管她根本藏不住那份恐惧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10727
translate schinese m17cow_6bde2485:

    # MCt "I suppose this is a fantastic opportunity to play the role of brave beacon of reassurance."
    MCt "这倒是个绝佳机会，可以扮演那个能给人带来安全感的勇敢守护者。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10728
translate schinese m17cow_7df2551a:

    # MCt "It's only a movie but the \"you're safe with me\" act could pull some weight."
    MCt "虽然这只是演戏，但那句“有我在，你很安全”的台词，或许真能起到些安抚作用。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10731
translate schinese m17cow_663e1922:

    # st "Okay, Stella! Go over the plan!"
    st "好了，斯特拉！把计划过一遍！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10732
translate schinese m17cow_8dfb9203:

    # st "Be brave! Whenever something scary happens, look to [name]! Cling onto him, hold his hand!"
    st "勇敢点！遇到可怕的事情时，就看向[name]！紧紧抓住他，牵着他的手！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10733
translate schinese m17cow_a59c86b1:

    # st "Then we go home together and k-kiss and do n-..."
    st "然后我们一起回家，亲亲，做些……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10734
translate schinese m17cow_ec02919d:

    # st "Naughty things..."
    st "一些坏事……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10740
translate schinese m17cow_858d2be1:

    # s "Hiiii!!!"
    s "嗨——！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10741
translate schinese m17cow_f0513c8d:

    # st "Oh no! It's happening!"
    st "哦不！它真的发生了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10774
translate schinese m17cow_0d36b562_2:

    # MC "..." (multiple=2)
    MC "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:10775
translate schinese m17cow_19bb86e0_1:

    # s "..." (multiple=2)
    s "……" (multiple=2)

# game/script2.rpyc:10778
translate schinese m17cow_c0c156e9:

    # s "Umm... Is this supposed to be scary?"
    s "嗯……这应该很吓人吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10779
translate schinese m17cow_6b907e33:

    # MC "Uhh... maybe? It's got all the tropes but... none of this is getting to me..."
    MC "呃……也许吧？它包含了所有恐怖片的套路，但是……这些都没吓到我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10780
translate schinese m17cow_fdb03f69:

    # s "I know. You haven't even flinched for the whole movie."
    s "我知道。整部电影你连眼皮都没眨一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10795
translate schinese m17cow_26920cd5:

    # MC "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHHH\nHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!{w=2.0}{nw}" with vpunch
    MC "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊\nHHHHHHHHHHHH！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！{w=2.0}{nw}" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:10802
translate schinese m17cow_480e2482:

    # MC "Ahaha! What a waste of time! You just wasted a lifetime's worth of adrenaline for nothing."
    MC "哈哈！真是浪费时间！你白白耗费了一辈子份量的肾上腺素。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10803
translate schinese m17cow_8c1f3e50:

    # s "I don't get it... this walk home is already scarier than that so-called {i}horror{/i} movie."
    s "真搞不懂……回家的这段路，竟然比那部所谓的{i}恐怖{/i}片还要吓人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10804
translate schinese m17cow_d869177e:

    # s "Are they all like that?"
    s "它们都是那个样子的吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10805
translate schinese m17cow_c520f64c:

    # MC "Seemed like a standard one to me, all the tropes, the bad writing, tired-out scares."
    MC "我觉得那部挺典型的，老套路、烂剧本，还有那些陈词滥调的惊吓桥段。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10808
translate schinese m17cow_e46040ed:

    # MC "Hey, do you mind if we speed this up? It's getting cold, right? I'm not imagining that am I?"
    MC "嘿，我们能不能走快点？天好像变冷了，对吧？应该不是我的错觉吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10809
translate schinese m17cow_67999941:

    # s "Umm... no I can feel it, it's a little chilly..."
    s "嗯……没错，我也感觉到了，确实有点凉……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10810
translate schinese m17cow_842ba9f9:

    # MC "Do you think it's indicating the end of Summer?"
    MC "你觉得这是夏天要结束的征兆吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10811
translate schinese m17cow_27b09c15:

    # s "Maybe, there's only a week left. Not that the weather ever changes."
    s "也许吧，毕竟只剩下一周了。反正天气也从来不变。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10812
translate schinese m17cow_d06bb228:

    # MC "Well, that's what we get for living in the sunniest city in the country."
    MC "毕竟我们住在全国阳光最充足的城市嘛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10813
translate schinese m17cow_1eccb482:

    # MC "I've got a soft spot for those rare, rainy days we get."
    MC "我倒是挺喜欢那些难得一见的雨天。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10816
translate schinese m17cow_db42f417:

    # s "You too? I much prefer the winter. I don't really know if this is a chicken and egg situation, haha."
    s "你也喜欢？我更偏爱冬天。至于这到底是因果关系还是什么，我也说不好，哈哈。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10817
translate schinese m17cow_fac1bacc:

    # s "I love the cozy clothes and that kind of... juxtaposition between the safety of the indoors when facing the raging wind outside."
    s "我喜欢那种舒适的冬装，还有……外面狂风呼啸时，身处室内那种安稳感所形成的强烈反差。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10818
translate schinese m17cow_9532ce46:

    # MC "I totally get that."
    MC "我完全懂那种感觉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10819
translate schinese m17cow_de793fa0:

    # s "So as long as I'm not caught up in it, I adore rainy days. The sound alone can knock me into a deep sleep."
    s "只要不用在雨天出门，我就特别喜欢下雨。光是听着雨声，我就能沉沉睡去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10820
translate schinese m17cow_21ac4f4c:

    # MC "Didn't we get three days of rain last year?"
    MC "去年是不是下了三天雨来着？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10821
translate schinese m17cow_b120a2aa:

    # s "Something like that. I'd love to have a few more, but at some point you run the risk of spoiling the novelty."
    s "差不多吧。我倒是很想再多来几次，但有时候次数多了，那种新鲜感可能就没了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10822
translate schinese m17cow_ab7fc8b4:

    # s "I do, however, wish I could see some snow without traveling far away."
    s "不过，我确实希望能不用跑远路就能看到雪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10823
translate schinese m17cow_41fd42f0:

    # MC "It snowed once ages ago when I was a kid, I must've been, I don't know, five? Six?"
    MC "很久以前我小时候下过一次雪，当时我大概……五岁？还是六岁？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10826
translate schinese m17cow_e8a331c8:

    # s "I..."
    s "我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10827
translate schinese m17cow_ecd31201:

    # s "Don't remember..."
    s "记不清了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10828
translate schinese m17cow_30034a6e:

    # MC "Oh..."
    MC "哦……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10831
translate schinese m17cow_da8a4f47:

    # MC "Of course..."
    MC "也是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10832
translate schinese m17cow_62db86c6:

    # MC "Sorry. I didn't mean to."
    MC "抱歉。我不是故意的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10833
translate schinese m17cow_dd3901a6:

    # s "No... it's not like... it's not like it's sad or anything. You can't miss what you don't know but..."
    s "不……并不是说……并不是说这有什么好伤感的。对于从未经历过的事物，自然谈不上怀念，但是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10834
translate schinese m17cow_cff5386d:

    # s "It's confusing. Frustrating. There's a whole part of myself I don't know about or understand."
    s "这种感觉很混乱，也很让人沮丧。我对自己的一部分一无所知，也无法理解。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10835
translate schinese m17cow_c834146b:

    # s "Who was I? Where did I come from? Why was I alone? What happened to my memories? All these questions rush into my head, and it makes me feel... insignificant... it's all existential and overwhelming."
    s "我曾经是谁？我从哪里来？为什么我孤身一人？我的记忆发生了什么？所有这些问题涌入脑海，让我感到……微不足道……这种关于存在本身的思考让人感到难以承受。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10842
translate schinese m17choice2_1_08cf657d:

    # s "And how do you expect to do that? I can't imagine you have a plan, though I don't think it'd surprise me anymore."
    s "那你打算怎么做呢？我很难想象你会有什么计划——不过，就算你真有计划，我也不会感到惊讶了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10843
translate schinese m17choice2_1_51493a24:

    # MC "I made a habit of breaking the rules. I don't see why I can't do it one more time."
    MC "我向来习惯打破常规。我不觉得这次有什么理由不能再破例一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10844
translate schinese m17choice2_1_67a6f94c:

    # MC "So my plan is to do it by accident at some point, most likely."
    MC "所以我的计划是……大概会在某个时刻“不小心”做到吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10845
translate schinese m17choice2_1_6c2479a7:

    # s "Ahaha! If anyone is capable of pulling that plan off..."
    s "哈哈！如果有人能成功实施那个计划……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10846
translate schinese m17choice2_1_a3d50fa2:

    # MC "I'll do all I can to help you get to the bottom of this."
    MC "我会尽我所能，帮你查清事情的真相。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10847
translate schinese m17choice2_1_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10848
translate schinese m17choice2_1_ff864e0b:

    # s "Do you promise?"
    s "你保证吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10849
translate schinese m17choice2_1_56130bdc:

    # MC "I promise."
    MC "我保证。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10850
translate schinese m17choice2_1_6ed4d77b:

    # s "That's good enough for me."
    s "对我来说，这就足够了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10854
translate schinese m17choice2_2_984e3c12:

    # MC "Do you think it's even worth the stress?"
    MC "你觉得这真的值得让你这么费神吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10855
translate schinese m17choice2_2_b9138465:

    # MC "You said it yourself. You can't miss what you don't know so... why give yourself something to miss?"
    MC "这话可是你自己说的：不知道就不会觉得缺失……所以，何必非要给自己找个“缺失”的东西呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10858
translate schinese m17choice2_2_b31dc5bc:

    # s "Hmm. Maybe. I admit, stressing out about it can become tiring."
    s "嗯……也许吧。我承认，为此烦恼确实挺累人的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10859
translate schinese m17choice2_2_aa10396f:

    # s "Still, I wouldn't say I'm quite happy about the idea of giving up. You never know how important my past may or may not be."
    s "不过，要说我就这么放弃了，心里也并不怎么痛快。毕竟谁也不知道我的过去究竟有多重要。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10860
translate schinese m17choice2_2_56d26794:

    # MC "I'm just saying you might be happier if you let it go."
    MC "我只是觉得，如果你能放下这件事，或许会过得更开心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10861
translate schinese m17choice2_2_f011cd1a:

    # s "Perhaps. But I'm not ready to let it go. At least not yet."
    s "也许吧。但我还没准备好放下。至少现在还没准备好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10863
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_79a40670:

    # MC "Regardless... if it ever snows again. We'll watch it together."
    MC "不管怎样……如果哪天又下雪了，我们一起看吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10866
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:10869
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_a03b41d0:

    # s "Yeah!"
    s "好啊！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10870
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_33367181:

    # s "I'd love that!"
    s "我太期待了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:10873
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_78d29dfa:

    # MC "Hey, there's an alley this way, I usually take it on the way to Ron's place. Saves me like ten minutes."
    MC "嘿，这边有条小巷，我平时去罗纳德家都走这条路。能省下大概十分钟呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10876
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_fc989ccc:

    # s "Uhh... sure. As long as I don't have to go in there alone. A girl feels dread walking the streets alone at night."
    s "呃……好吧。只要不用我一个人进去就行。女孩子大晚上独自走在街上可是会害怕的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10877
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_278f2deb:

    # MC "Don't worry, I fully intend to be stabbed in your place."
    MC "别担心，我可是做好了替你挨刀的准备。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10878
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_06ce8fb7:

    # s "Please don't, I don't want to live knowing that I haven't seen your full magical arsenal."
    s "千万别，我可不想带着遗憾活下去——毕竟还没见识过你所有的魔法手段呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:10879
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_69f09446:

    # MC "Is that what I am to you? An illusionist?"
    MC "在你眼里我就是这种人吗？一个玩幻术的？"

# game/script2.rpyc:10880
translate schinese m17afterchoice2_f1f1a2d3:

    # s "I would find you far less intriguing if they were mere illusions, [name]."
