translate schinese main18_e358a6a6:

    # a "Hugo's got his birthday coming up, he's hosting this upper class circle jerk in his uncle's palace."
    a "雨果快过生日了，他要在叔叔的豪宅里举办一场上流社会的自嗨派对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11207
translate schinese main18_ce55e85e:

    # a "{i}We're{/i} in."
    a "{i}我们{/i}加入。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11208
translate schinese main18_7e93724d:

    # a "I'm extending those invitations to you."
    a "我把这些邀请函送给你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11211
translate schinese main18_4a84f576:

    # ma "What do you say, [name]? Care to live in high society with us for a night?"
    ma "怎么样，[name]？想跟我们一起体验一晚的上流社会生活吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11212
translate schinese main18_cdf38067:

    # ma "Drink the best wine, sit on the finest furniture, eat space-age fucking grade S wagyu beef or some shit?"
    ma "喝最好的酒，坐最顶级的家具，吃那种太空时代的S级和牛之类的玩意儿？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11213
translate schinese main18_52539c7c:

    # ma "All topped off with a side dish of {i}revenge{/i}?"
    ma "再来点配菜——{i}复仇{/i}？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11215
translate schinese main18_b05a9bc9:

    # a "We have enough pull to get three more people in. If you wanna bring a plus two and take advantage of the party, go nuts."
    a "我们的人脉够带三个人进去。如果你想带两个伴儿去蹭吃蹭喝，尽管去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11216
translate schinese main18_e81536e7:

    # a "But when it comes to the main event, I want you there. What do you say?"
    a "但到了重头戏的时候，我希望你在场。怎么样？"

