    # ch "You mean there aren't any more?"
    ch "你是说没有了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11245
translate schinese main18_4a16401f:

    # ch "That's it? No more Mr. Floppington?"
    ch "就这样？不会再有弗洛平顿先生了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11246
translate schinese main18_caf4a026:

    # ch "We watched it all?"
    ch "我们全看完了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11249
translate schinese main18_f2e9409f:

    # MC "Only until Tuesday. You get used to it, buddy. It'll pass."
    MC "得等到周二才有。你会习惯的，伙计。这阵子总会过去的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11250
translate schinese main18_2ab6159e:

    # MC "I've been going through what you are for weeks now."
    MC "这种感觉我已经经历好几周了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11251
translate schinese main18_501f5d14:

    # MC "Trust me. It just becomes part of life. It gets better."
    MC "相信我，这会成为生活的一部分。情况会好起来的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11254
translate schinese main18_64ad9929:

    # MC "So you're expecting me to party in a mansion? And you think there's a chance I'm gonna say \"no\"?"
    MC "所以你是想让我去豪宅参加派对？而且你觉得我可能会拒绝？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11257
translate schinese main18_721e2ed8:

    # a "We really gotta wait a whole week?"
    a "我们真的得等整整一周吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11258
translate schinese main18_4a3f5ce2:

    # ma "I wanna know what he's wearing next..."
    ma "我想知道他接下来会穿什么……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11259
translate schinese main18_73682afe:

    # MC "Ashley. The party."
    MC "阿什莉。关于那个派对……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11260
translate schinese main18_04348a0d:

    # a "I'm not really feeling it anymore..."
    a "我感觉自己没那个兴致了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11261
translate schinese main18_5e0f5f0d:

    # MC "Oh, hell no! Not on {i}my{/i} watch!"
    MC "噢，想都别想！{i}我{/i}可盯着呢！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11265
translate schinese main18_2bcfe917:

    # MC "What's the plan when you get him alone anyway?"
    MC "话说回来，等你单独见到他时，打算怎么做？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11270
translate schinese main18_eaf03514:

    # a "Hugo would fucking torture me for years and then run behind his daddy's connections and money."
    a "雨果肯定会狠狠折磨我好几年，然后躲到他老爸的人脉和金钱庇护之下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11271
translate schinese main18_f7a78b12:

    # a "I just wanted to express myself. And this guy expended so much fucking energy to make me feel that who I really am..."
    a "我只是想表达真实的自我。可那家伙费尽心思让我觉得，我本来的样子……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11272
translate schinese main18_31da9c3c:

    # a "How I wanted to live..."
    a "我想要的生活方式……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11273
translate schinese main18_19f5d055:

    # a "Was disgusting..."
    a "是令人作呕的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11274
translate schinese main18_af906053:

    # a "I wasn't welcome, I was filthy. Because I wasn't putting on an act, the way I talk, the way I look, the way I behave. This is me."
    a "我不受欢迎，我被视为肮脏下贱。就因为我没有伪装自己——无论是我的谈吐、外表，还是举止。这就是我。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11275
translate schinese main18_6539eb7f:

    # a "And I spent my teenage years learning that {i}who I am{/i} shouldn't exist..."
    a "而我在青少年时期学会的一件事就是：{i}像我这样的人{/i}……本不该存在于世……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11276
translate schinese main18_ebf9d2b1:

    # a "Then the thoughts started creeping in. If I shouldn't exist... then why do I continue to do so?"
    a "随后，那些念头便悄然滋生：既然我不该存在……那我又为何还要继续活下去呢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11277
translate schinese main18_802c39eb:

    # a "I'm sure you get it, [name]. Once you start asking yourself these questions... you're in a {i}very{/i} dangerous position..."
    a "我相信你懂的，[name]。一旦你开始问自己这些问题……你就处在一种{i}非常{/i}危险的境地……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11280
translate schinese main18_9b2054ed:

    # a "I've spent... so much money on therapy... so much time learning to love myself again and..."
    a "我花了大把的钱做心理治疗……也花了很多时间重新学习如何爱自己，而且……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11281
translate schinese main18_52339f05:

    # a "It all traces back to this one... pompous, hateful little shit..."
    a "这一切的根源，全都是因为那个……自以为是、令人憎恶的小混蛋……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11282
translate schinese main18_391cd1eb:

    # a "Why did I deserve those feelings more than he does?"
    a "凭什么我就该承受那些感受，而不是他？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11283
translate schinese main18_fa833318:

    # a "So I know what I must do..."
    a "所以我知道自己该做什么了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11284
translate schinese main18_20fecfef:

    # a "I'm putting an end to all of these bad memories."
    a "我要终结所有这些糟糕的回忆。"

