    stu "我知道……我这人天生就不擅长数学……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11508
translate schinese ft18end_2_0baf530b:

    # tea "Like it or not, math creeps its way into biology, you need to become well-rounded so we can get you the scholarship."
    tea "不管你喜不喜欢，数学总是会渗透到生物学里；你需要全面发展，这样我们才能帮你拿到奖学金。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11509
translate schinese ft18end_2_35037c77:

    # tea "We all want this. We know you can do it."
    tea "我们都希望你能成功。我们知道你做得到。"

