    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11527
translate schinese ft18end_2_7d677cf1:

    # stew "We've already held you back {i}one{/i} year. Don't force us to do it again."
    stew "我们已经让你留级一年了。别逼我们再来一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11528
translate schinese ft18end_2_b292f0d8:

    # ric "Heh, you wish, Mr. S. Just you watch, end of this year i'mma be outta here shredding my chopper down the freeway, cool breeze in my hair."
    ric "呵，想得美，S先生。等着瞧吧，今年年底我就要离开这儿了，骑着我的重型机车在高速公路上飞驰，感受凉爽的微风拂过发梢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11529
translate schinese ft18end_2_affd9c01:

    # stew "I believe you, Ricky, but I've gotta see {i}evidence{/i}, faith can only get you so far."
    stew "我相信你，瑞奇，但我得看到{i}证据{/i}——光靠信念是走不远的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11530
translate schinese ft18end_2_721cc108:

    # stew "You and I stick together, and there's no way you'll still be here in five years."
    stew "只要我们齐心协力，你绝不可能五年后还待在这里。"

