translate schinese ft18end_2_87581ce1:

    # C "I haven't seen anyone else of my breed in the city let alone the school."
    C "别说学校里了，就算在这座城市里，我也没见过其他同族的人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11577
translate schinese ft18end_2_0fd2fc7a:

    # stu "True, hehe, that thing is so much fluffier than most."
    stu "确实，嘿嘿，那玩意儿比大多数同类的都要蓬松。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11580
translate schinese ft18end_2_bf6e5fc3:

    # C "This thing? It's almost a fluffy as my mom's."
    C "这个吗？它蓬松得都快赶上我妈的尾巴了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11581
translate schinese ft18end_2_6ab00d95:

    # stu "Eh? No way! Is your mom single- I mean -is she accepting petting right now?"
