translate schinese ft18end_2_4e0e98de:

    # stu "Oh, wow! It's just as soft as it looks."
    stu "哇！摸起来跟看起来一样柔软。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11603
translate schinese ft18end_2_09589607:

    # C "It takes so much shampoo and time to take care of it. I'm glad you're enjoying the spoils of my efforts..."
    C "打理它可是要花很多洗发水和时间的。你能享受到我努力的成果，我也很高兴……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11604
translate schinese ft18end_2_66854733:

    # stu "Derive some happiness from it."
    stu "从中获得快乐。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11605
translate schinese ft18end_2_67927f67:

    # C "Oh, no, I love making other people happy, you know, as long as they're not being weird about it."
    C "噢，不，我喜欢让别人开心——当然，前提是对方别表现得太奇怪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11608
translate schinese ft18end_2_e6b0cc62:

    # stu "Be honest with me, do you ever do this to yourself?"
    stu "老实告诉我，你自己也会这么做吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11609
translate schinese ft18end_2_d446dffa:

    # C "Of course I do. Do you stroke your own hair?"
    C "我当然会啊。你会自己抚摸自己的头发吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11610
translate schinese ft18end_2_7891050e:

    # stu "Exactly."
    stu "没错。"

