translate schinese ft18end_2_9fef20e6:

    # tea "You said that last year. Suck it up."
    tea "你去年也这么说。忍着点吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11663
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_1:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11664
translate schinese ft18end_2_08b0f8d9:

    # Ct "She looks so pretty in her makeup..."
    Ct "她化了妆看起来真漂亮……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11665
translate schinese ft18end_2_9871364c:

    # Ct "Maybe I'll ask for some makeup for my birthday..."
    Ct "也许我生日的时候可以要一套化妆品……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11666
translate schinese ft18end_2_66834a76:

    # Ct "Gotta learn how to apply it first... maybe I could ask that Noelle to show me. She seems like a nice girl, if not a little simple."
    Ct "得先学会怎么化才行……也许我可以请诺艾尔教教我。她看起来是个好姑娘，就是有点单纯。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11667
translate schinese ft18end_2_5df83990:

    # Ct "I... don't think we're going to be in the same math classes... we're in different grades and well... I'm not {i}failing{/i} in math."
    Ct "我……不觉得我们会上同一堂数学课……我们年级不同，而且……我的数学又没{i}不及格{/i}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11670
translate schinese ft18end_2_51d6f81f:

    # Ct "This scholarship could change my life... it's not enough that I have to work as hard as I already do in biology... now I have to do the same for math?"
    Ct "这份奖学金可能会改变我的人生……光是在生物课上拼命努力还不够吗……现在还得在数学课上也这么拼？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11671
translate schinese ft18end_2_0e9643f9:

    # Ct "It never ends..."
    Ct "没完没了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11672
translate schinese ft18end_2_ef6ff640:

    # Ct "Sometimes I wish an angel would swoop down and turn my life on its head. Move me into a nice big house, traveling in a fancy car with padded seats and a hood ornament."
    Ct "有时候我真希望有个天使能从天而降，彻底改变我的生活。让我住进宽敞漂亮的大房子，坐着那种有软垫座椅、车头还带立标的豪华轿车到处跑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11673
translate schinese ft18end_2_5f639d51:

    # Ct "Have my food taken care of, never having to work, new clothes..."
    Ct "衣食无忧，不用干活，还有新衣服穿……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11677
translate schinese ft18end_2_6b61ff7b:

    # C "???"
    C "？？？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11688
translate schinese ft18end_2_5221e21d:

    # hoec "Oh no you don't!"
    hoec "想跑？没门儿！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11692
translate schinese ft18end_2_3cd270e6:

    # hoec "YEET!" with vpunch
    hoec "嘿！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:11712
translate schinese ft18end_2_ca76ac50:

    # hoec "Thought you could get away from me, did you?"
    hoec "以为能逃出我的手掌心吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11713
translate schinese ft18end_2_fb74f693:

    # ric "Aw shucks! I didn't know my company was so important to you, Mrs. P."
    ric "哎呀！我没想到我的陪伴对您来说这么重要，P夫人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11717
translate schinese ft18end_2_8a866b09:

    # tea "I don't think this is as serious as you're making it out to be, you're already on track to getting a C. I wouldn't worry too much about it."
    tea "我觉得事情没您说的那么严重，您现在的成绩已经能拿到C了。不必为此太过担心。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11718
translate schinese ft18end_2_0623fc19:

    # C "No, it's not about the math, it's about biology."
    C "不，这跟数学没关系，是关于生物学的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11719
translate schinese ft18end_2_2904f6b2:

    # tea "Hmm? Oh, right, I thought your name was familiar. Mason keeps mentioning you. He says you're probably the best biologist he's ever taught."
    tea "嗯？噢，对了，我就觉得你的名字很耳熟。梅森总提起你。他说你大概是他教过的最优秀的生物学学生。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11720
translate schinese ft18end_2_fc8ebb2e:

    # tea "So? How do {i}I{/i} factor into this?"
    tea "所以呢？这跟{i}我{/i}有什么关系？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11721
translate schinese ft18end_2_df080c2f:

    # C "...I keep getting the math wrong in the tests..."
    C "……我考试里的数学部分总出错……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11722
translate schinese ft18end_2_3a699bbc:

    # C "And... well... I'm on track for a scholarship so..."
    C "而且……嗯……我本来是有希望拿奖学金的，所以……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11723
translate schinese ft18end_2_11a2e7c6:

    # tea "Okay, okay, I get it."
    tea "好了，好了，我明白了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11724
translate schinese ft18end_2_fe4a0775:

    # tea "Sure, I'll help you, I'll need to look at a few biology tests to see what you need exactly."
    tea "没问题，我会帮你的。我得先看看几份生物试卷，弄清楚你具体需要什么。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11725
translate schinese ft18end_2_79e9d2bd:

    # C "Statistics and... um... logarithms... stuff like that."
    C "统计学，还有……嗯……对数……诸如此类的东西。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11726
translate schinese ft18end_2_285d7924:

    # tea "Don't worry about it, I'll figure it all out."
    tea "别担心，我会把这些都搞定的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11727
translate schinese ft18end_2_057d8ec0:

    # C "Thank you..."
    C "谢谢你……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11728
translate schinese ft18end_2_9bb0999c:

    # tea "..."
    tea "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11729
translate schinese ft18end_2_906ca511:

    # tea "Do you like soda?"
    tea "你喜欢喝汽水吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11732
translate schinese ft18end_2_b8e9a911:

    # C "Uh... yes?"
    C "呃……喜欢？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11735
translate schinese ft18end_2_34973423:

    # tea "Here. I don't really want it."
    tea "给你。我不太想喝这个。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11736
translate schinese ft18end_2_fc39ff74:

    # C "What? Why?"
    C "什么？为什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11737
translate schinese ft18end_2_3a2393b0:

    # tea "It's up to you, but as I said, I don't want it."
    tea "随你便，不过就像我说的，我不想喝。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11740
translate schinese ft18end_2_6553d0b1:

    # tea "Come see me again tomorrow. I'll talk to your math teacher as well."
    tea "明天再来找我吧。我也会去跟你的数学老师谈谈。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11741
translate schinese ft18end_2_470be5e6:

    # tea "We'll seal up those cracks in your skill set and get you that scholarship."
    tea "我们会补齐你能力上的短板，帮你拿到那份奖学金。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11742
translate schinese ft18end_2_50f31c35:

    # C "J-just like that?"
    C "就、就这样吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11743
translate schinese ft18end_2_83133d4b:

    # tea "I'm a teacher, Cadence. It's what I do."
    tea "我是个老师，凯登丝。这就是我的本职工作。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11744
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_2:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11745
translate schinese ft18end_2_99a94709:

    # C "Thank you very much!"
    C "非常感谢！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11748
translate schinese ft18end_2_71434c31:

    # C "Mmm... (Now my feet hurt...)"
    C "唔……（脚好痛啊……）"

# game/script2.rpyc:11749
translate schinese ft18end_2_046d2a61:

    # Ct "That's another pair of socks down."
    Ct "又穿坏一双袜子了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11750
translate schinese ft18end_2_48903488_3:

    # C "*Sigh*"
    C "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:11751
translate schinese ft18end_2_cd65c2d2:

    # Ct "It'll all be over once I'm out of school... That's multiple teachers pushing for my scholarship."
    Ct "等我毕业就好了……毕竟好几位老师都在帮我争取奖学金呢。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11754
translate schinese ft18end_2_2211ae89:

    # Ct "...Why did she give me this, anyway?"
    Ct "……话说，她为什么要给我这个？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11755
translate schinese ft18end_2_9a548ccf:

    # Ct "Who just buys a soda and changes their mind about it?"
    Ct "谁会买了汽水又突然改变主意啊？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11756
translate schinese ft18end_2_7ed0e657:

    # Ct "Hmm... I don't get it..."
    Ct "嗯……真搞不懂……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11757
translate schinese ft18end_2_7c957872:

    # Ct "I think I'll give this to dad."
    Ct "干脆把这个给老爸吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11760
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_3:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11773
translate schinese ft18end_2_94bfe2c5:

    # C "!!!"
    C "！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11789
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_4:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11792
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_5:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11795
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_6:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11796
translate schinese ft18end_2_4fdc2c67:

    # Ct "What a waste of money..."
    Ct "真是浪费钱……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11799
translate schinese ft18end_2_9eb820a2:

    # Ct "I wonder if I should get a boyfriend... Someone to spend time with, that's free, isn't it?"
    Ct "我在想是不是该交个男朋友……找个人一起打发时间，这可是免费的消遣，对吧？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11800
translate schinese ft18end_2_0e30a0d1:

    # Ct "Ugh, being poor is soooo boring... I should find a guy who can make me laugh, keep me engaged in conversation for hours..."
    Ct "唉，没钱的日子真无聊……我得找个能逗我笑、能跟我聊上好几个小时的男生……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11801
translate schinese ft18end_2_cf0912c8:

    # Ct "I don't even know what my type is. Makes me wonder what kind of guy I'm going to end up with... if any."
    Ct "我甚至不知道自己喜欢什么样的类型。真好奇我最后会和什么样的男人在一起……如果真能遇到的话。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11812
translate schinese ft18end_2_aada8888:

    # C "Huh?"
    C "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11854
translate schinese ft18end_2_d5b3d406:

    # C "Whaaahaah!!"
    C "哇啊啊！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11887
translate schinese ft18end_2_540c4f24:

    # l "Finally."
    l "终于。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11890
translate schinese ft18end_2_1da9f3cf:

    # C "H-hello?"
    C "喂……你好？"

# game/script2.rpyc:11893
translate schinese ft18end_2_e995229e:

    # l "I'm not interested in talking."
    l "我没兴趣聊天。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11908
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_7:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11911
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_8:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11912
translate schinese ft18end_2_4856d008:

    # C "N-no..."
    C "不……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11913
translate schinese ft18end_2_86ed50c1:

    # C "I didn't-"
    C "我没有——"

# game/script2.rpyc:11918
translate schinese ft18end_2_b64126d7:

    # l "Seeing is believing. It's {i}exactly{/i} as it looks."
    l "眼见为实。情况{i}完全{/i}就是你看到的那样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11919
translate schinese ft18end_2_f1ba0487:

    # l "Whether you choose to accept it is up to you. It makes little difference to me."
    l "至于你接不接受，那是你的事。对我来说都无所谓。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11920
translate schinese ft18end_2_6eebdb8c:

    # C "P-please. I don't... who are-"
    C "求、求你了。我……你是谁——"

# game/script2.rpyc:11921
translate schinese ft18end_2_de040595:

    # l "\"Master\"."
    l "“主人”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11924
translate schinese ft18end_2_9f3f6e59:

    # l "Now come along. I don't have time to entertain you. You'll have plenty of time to process it."
    l "跟我走吧。我没时间陪你耗。你以后有的是时间慢慢消化这件事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11925
translate schinese ft18end_2_dddeaccb:

    # C "You're... hurting me!"
    C "你……弄疼我了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11928
translate schinese ft18end_2_d0e85c50:

    # C "Let me go!"
    C "放开我！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11932
translate schinese ft18end_2_6f3c01d7:

    # l "Enough!" with vpunch
    l "够了！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:11933
translate schinese ft18end_2_e32725d3:

    # l "Get in the car. It's over for you. There is {i}no{/i} fighting. It's done."
    l "上车。你已经没戏了。{i}别{/i}再挣扎了。一切已成定局。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11934
translate schinese ft18end_2_ab58afe2:

    # l "You're {u}mine{/u}."
    l "你是{u}我的{/u}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11937
translate schinese ft18end_2_94bfe2c5_1:

    # C "!!!"
    C "！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:11943
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_9:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11955
translate schinese ft18end_2_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11959
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_10:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:11973
translate schinese ft18end_2_6ddd2435:

    # l "I feel like {i}that{/i} should make it pretty clear."
    l "我觉得{i}那句话{/i}应该说得很清楚了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11974
translate schinese ft18end_2_c9a382d4:

    # l "I don't particularly care if you believe it or not, it's simply a recommendation. We're such adaptable creatures, us humanoids."
    l "至于你信不信，我并不怎么在乎，这仅仅是个建议。我们这种类人生物，适应力可是很强的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11975
translate schinese ft18end_2_aeffdb09:

    # l "I should know, I've gone through a far more dramatic change than what you're facing right now."
    l "我对此深有体会，因为我经历过的变化，远比你现在面临的要剧烈得多。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11976
translate schinese ft18end_2_2317a289:

    # l "The difference is that I accepted my fate immediately."
    l "不同之处在于，我当时立刻就接受了自己的命运。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11980
translate schinese ft18end_2_3fe6210b:

    # l "It's up to you."
    l "这全看你自己了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11981
translate schinese ft18end_2_57890da4:

    # l "What happens to you isn't your choice. How you deal with it is."
    l "发生在你身上的事，不由你选择；但你如何应对，却由你做主。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11985
translate schinese ft18end_2_8fd231d7:

    # l "Everything has been taken care of."
    l "一切都已安排妥当。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11986
translate schinese ft18end_2_ffc7d998:

    # l "You have a room, a room{i}mate{/i}, a change of clothes."
    l "你有了房间、{i}室友{/i}，还有换洗的衣物。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11987
translate schinese ft18end_2_29b2c000:

    # l "Don't worry about your family either."
    l "也不必担心你的家人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:11990
translate schinese ft18end_2_fb1119bf:

    # l "*Exhale*"
    l "*呼气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:12013
translate schinese ft18end_2_c7484054:

    # l "*Inhale*"
    l "*吸气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:12014
translate schinese ft18end_2_c8e7daab:

    # l "Step two of seven..."
    l "七个步骤中的第二步……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12028
translate schinese ft18end_2_0b8e093a:

    # MC "That's it? I can't help but feel a little... underwhelmed..."
    MC "就这样？我不禁觉得有点……意兴阑珊……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12029
translate schinese ft18end_2_2549dd03:

    # MC "I mean, the whole thing is unbelievably abrupt, that was what? Four minutes?"
    MC "我是说，整件事发生得太突然了，简直不可思议，刚才那是……四分钟？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12030
translate schinese ft18end_2_97e530eb:

    # MC "I was expecting more conflict, more conversation, more politics, more fighting."
    MC "我原本以为会有更多的冲突、对话、政治博弈和打斗。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12031
translate schinese ft18end_2_a527779e:

    # MC "That was... just so utterly one-sided, like it was an afterthought for her."
    MC "那场面……简直太一边倒了，感觉对她来说那不过是顺带一提的事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12034
translate schinese ft18end_2_52469bdb:

    # C "Then it sounds like my storytelling did it justice."
    C "听起来，我的讲述倒是恰如其分地还原了那种感觉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12035
translate schinese ft18end_2_f11918d2:

    # C "Apart from when she looked at me, there wasn't an ounce of enthusiasm from her. It was all business."
    C "除了看向我的时候，她身上没有流露出丝毫热情。一切都公事公办。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12036
translate schinese ft18end_2_247ba762:

    # C "And that was it. But for me that was... well... a tangible divide between stages of my life."
    C "事情就这样结束了。但对我而言……嗯……那是我人生不同阶段之间一道切实的界限。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12037
translate schinese ft18end_2_8fe2a915:

    # C "It was all too much to process in that moment, the \"binding\" was all so authentic that I couldn't really deny what I saw and felt. It was kinda like... being arrested, or held at gunpoint..."
    C "那一刻的信息量实在太大，难以消化；那种“束缚”感如此真实，让我无法否认自己的所见所感。那种感觉就像是……被逮捕，或者被人用枪指着……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12038
translate schinese ft18end_2_ce0793f0:

    # C "You {i}don't{/i} get the time to work out your feelings but... you know you have to go along with it."
    C "你{i}根本{/i}没时间去理清自己的情绪，但……你知道自己必须顺其自然。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12039
translate schinese ft18end_2_68ac756f:

    # MC "So did you take her advice?"
    MC "那你听取她的建议了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12040
translate schinese ft18end_2_26a803bc_11:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12041
translate schinese ft18end_2_98cbe5ba:

    # C "Yes..."
    C "痛……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12047
translate schinese m19choice1_1_a87e137b:

    # C "That's easy for {i}you{/i} to say with all the knowledge you have."
    C "对{i}你{/i}来说当然轻松，毕竟你掌握着那么多内情。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12048
translate schinese m19choice1_1_6b9e3fa8:

    # C "Yeah, I should've ran, considering that the whole thing was a farce. But how could I have known that? You were the only one in five years who could see through it."
    C "是啊，既然整件事就是场闹剧，我当时确实该逃走的。可我怎么可能知道呢？这五年来，唯独只有你看穿了这一切。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12049
translate schinese m19choice1_1_40425e77:

    # C "I didn't really expect to hear that from you... you're usually smarter than this..."
    C "真没想到你会这么说……你平时明明更聪明的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12050
translate schinese m19choice1_1_f81dddeb:

    # MC "Oh, right... I'm sorry... I guess that was a little stupid of me..."
    MC "噢，对……抱歉……我刚才确实有点犯傻……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12056
translate schinese m19choice1_2_565d8c08:

    # C "Thank you, master."
    C "谢谢您，主人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12057
translate schinese m19choice1_2_af434777:

    # C "What's done is done. You needn't worry about the past, as much as I would've appreciated you being there with all the solutions I need; with the hidden benefit of having you in my life longer..."
    C "事已至此，不必再纠结过去。虽然我确实希望当时你在场，能提供我所需的一切解决方案——顺带还能让我生命中多有你陪伴一段时间……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12058
translate schinese m19choice1_2_83927dcd:

    # MC "Well... even if I {i}was{/i} there... my magic hadn't uh... {i}awakened{/i} so..."
    MC "嗯……就算我{i}在场{/i}……我的魔法也还没……{i}觉醒{/i}……所以……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12059
translate schinese m19choice1_2_946e4258:

    # C "Hmm... I suppose..."
    C "唔……也是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12060
translate schinese m19choice1_2_5223406f:

    # C "That's even {i}more{/i} reason not to dwell too hard on it. It's regretful, but as I said, unchangeable."
    C "正因如此，{i}更{/i}没必要为此耿耿于怀。虽然令人遗憾，但正如我所说，已无法改变。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12066
translate schinese m19choice1_3_87c86f8a:

    # C "Me too, master. Me too."
    C "我也是，主人。我也是。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12067
translate schinese m19choice1_3_b6d489f6:

    # C "I think it's safe to say that... well..."
    C "我想可以肯定地说……嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12071
translate schinese m19choice1_3_83ef3676:

    # C "You're well... um..."
    C "你……嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12072
translate schinese m19choice1_3_e4b41532:

    # C "You're the best thing that's ever happened to me and... yeah..."
    C "你是我生命中最美好的际遇，而且……嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12073
translate schinese m19choice1_3_dfe2ce2d:

    # C "Um..."
    C "嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12074
translate schinese m19choice1_3_e9b60548:

    # C "Thank you... and stuff..."
    C "谢谢你……还有……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12078
translate schinese m19choice1_3_26a803bc:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12079
translate schinese m19choice1_3_f54c2498:

    # MCt "Oof... that face... God, she's so cute sometimes. My heart skipped a beat. But I also ate fast food for the past three days and that may have simply been a side effect of increased cholesterol in my bloodstream."
    MCt "唔……那副表情……天哪，她有时候真的太可爱了。我的心跳漏了一拍。不过，过去三天我一直在吃快餐，这心跳加速说不定只是血液胆固醇升高带来的副作用。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12080
translate schinese m19choice1_3_0fc2ecad:

    # MCt "Regardless, she's all cute and shit."
    MCt "不管怎样，她就是可爱得要命。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12081
translate schinese m19choice1_3_4dc8b670:

    # "Though you can't help but feel as if she didn't say everything she wanted to just then..."
    "虽然还是忍不住觉得，她刚才似乎有些话没能完全说出口……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12085
translate schinese m19choice1_3_74c35dde:

    # C "You've changed my life completely! If it wasn't for you, I don't know what would become of me!"
    C "你彻底改变了我的人生！如果没有你，我真不知道自己会变成什么样！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12086
translate schinese m19choice1_3_64fecfab:

    # C "All I know is that I wouldn't be nearly as happy as I am now."
    C "我只知道，我绝不会像现在这么幸福。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12090
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_48903488:

    # C "*Sigh*"
    C "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:12103
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_54155e39:

    # MC "Cadence?"
    MC "凯登丝？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12106
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_13a92f3f:

    # C "Sorry, master... talking about that day just..."
    C "对不起，主人……提起那天的事，总是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12107
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_95fbb016:

    # C "Left me wanting for some kind of warmth..."
    C "让我渴望得到某种温暖……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12108
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_f1a016fc:

    # MC "...I understand..."
    MC "……我明白了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12109
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_4cd5b719:

    # MC "I like to believe I'm warm so... go ahead..."
    MC "我愿意相信自己能给人温暖……所以……请继续吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12110
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_d10a1009:

    # C "Thank you, master... even standing still; you're helping me..."
    C "谢谢您，主人……哪怕只是静静站着，您也在帮我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12113
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12114
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_fb65845e:

    # MCt "Her parents had been \"taken care of\"..."
    MCt "她的父母已经被“妥善安置”了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12115
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_1c0a635c:

    # MCt "I wonder what that means... I mean, I have ideas but..."
    MCt "那究竟意味着什么呢……虽说我心里有些想法，但……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12116
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12117
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_9eacab93:

    # MCt "Does she think that {i}I'm{/i} her family now?"
    MCt "她是不是觉得，{i}我{/i}现在就是她的家人了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12118
translate schinese m19afterchoice1_5f008d87:

    # MCt "What about me? Is {i}she{/i} family? We're bound for life..."
    MCt "那我呢？{i}她{/i}算是我的家人吗？毕竟我们已缔结了终身的羁绊……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12124
translate schinese m19choice2_1_17175038:

    # C "Hmmm...."
    C "嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12125
translate schinese m19choice2_1_790364bc:

    # C "No."
    C "不。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12128
translate schinese m19choice2_1_a7a3b826:

    # C "I'm quite a fan of this setup we have right here."
    C "我很喜欢我们现在的这种关系。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12129
translate schinese m19choice2_1_30df3687:

    # C "It's been a long time since I had someone to be reliant on. I think I'm going to maximize it."
    C "好久没有能让我依靠的人了。我想，我要好好享受这份依靠。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12138
translate schinese m19choice2_2_f19fb45b:

    # C "!!! M-"
    C "！！！ M——"

# game/script2.rpyc:12143
translate schinese m19choice2_2_fee0f762:

    # C "Master!"
    C "主人！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12144
translate schinese m19choice2_2_12cc93e9:

    # C "Ehehe! Good response."
    C "嘿嘿！回答得真好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12145
translate schinese m19choice2_2_1149e2d7:

    # C "You always know exactly which words to say, or not say in this instance."
    C "你总是很清楚该说什么——或者像现在这样，该保持沉默。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12151
translate schinese m19choice2_2_0ae9b838:

    # MC "Holy fuck! Your tits are huge, bro."
    MC "我靠！你的胸部真大啊，老兄。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12155
translate schinese m19choice2_2_e1b98087:

    # C "Oh my god, get over it."
    C "天哪，别大惊小怪的了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12156
translate schinese m19choice2_2_63448e23:

    # C "You've seen them like a million times already."
    C "你都看过无数遍了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12157
translate schinese m19choice2_2_325076d1:

    # MC "And every time feels like the first. You should look at them sometime. It changes your life."
    MC "但每次看都像初次见到一样。你应该好好看看它们，那会改变你的人生。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12160
translate schinese m19choice2_2_26a803bc:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12180
translate schinese m19choice2_2_85795b45:

    # C "Stop it."
    C "别这样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12185
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_7fd6030d:

    # "Cadence's smile is as warm and genuine as it gets, this situation, her life circumstances."
    "凯登丝的笑容无比温暖真诚；眼下的处境，还有她的人生境遇……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12186
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_fe2e3a74:

    # "Are enough for her to wear such a smile in a neutral state."
    "……都足以让她在平静的状态下流露出这样的笑容。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12187
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_91efcee2:

    # MC "By the way, when are you going to start paying rent?"
    MC "对了，你打算什么时候开始付房租？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12190
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_7cc8921d:

    # C "Haha! You wish but that isn't a slave's responsibility. It's my right to receive housing from you."
    C "哈哈！你想得美，那可不是奴隶该操心的事。由你提供住所可是我的权利。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12191
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_36c789c6:

    # C "Should've thought about that one before you took me in."
    C "当初收留我的时候，你就该想到这一点了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12192
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_73110935:

    # C "I've never been of any value and that's not gonna start now!"
    C "我从来就没什么价值，以后也不会有！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12207
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_abe24253:

    # MC "!!!"
    MC "！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12209
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_7ec14a2e:

    # MC "Hey... Cadence..."
    MC "嘿……凯登丝……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12212
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_e9b5d686:

    # C "Hmm? What is it, master?"
    C "嗯？怎么了，主人？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12213
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_5161f948:

    # MC "Back then... at the market."
    MC "那时候……在市场上。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12216
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_f378e207:

    # MC "You cast-... tried casting a spell on me..."
    MC "你施了……试着对我施了一个魔法……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12217
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_e75c0f09:

    # MC "It looked like it threw you back like... like it backfired or something..."
    MC "当时看起来你被震飞了出去……就像是……魔法反噬了之类的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12218
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_931c34ac:

    # MC "And then you asked me..."
    MC "然后你问我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12221
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_d5e8e12f:

    # MC "\"What {i}are{/i} you?\""
    MC "“你{i}是{/i}什么？”"

# game/script2.rpyc:12222
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_26a803bc:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12223
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_3fe22c6e:

    # MC "Cadence... what happened then? What was that spell?"
    MC "凯登丝……当时发生了什么？那是什么法术？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12226
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_26a803bc_1:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12227
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_e8f07eba:

    # C "I was reading your affinity."
    C "我在读取你的亲和力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12228
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_870b5053:

    # C "It's a hundred percent accurate when someone's affinity is lower than yours."
    C "当对方的亲和力低于你时，结果是百分之百准确的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12229
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_a9643672:

    # C "When it's higher, you only really interpret the results as feedback... it becomes distorted, muffled... like a sound that's so loud you can't understand what you're hearing."
    C "如果对方亲和力更高，你只能把结果解读为一种反馈……它会变得扭曲、模糊……就像声音大到让你听不清具体内容一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12230
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_6cc036c2:

    # C "The distortion gets higher in proportion to the gap between your affinities..."
    C "扭曲程度与你们亲和力之间的差距成正比……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12232
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_5b8a8787:

    # MC "Cadence... what did you see?"
    MC "凯登丝……你看到了什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12235
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_26a803bc_2:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12236
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_04236956:

    # C "You sent shockwaves throughout my body. Like you were taking over the magical equivalent of my nervous system."
    C "你向我的全身发送了冲击波。就像你要接管我体内相当于神经系统的魔法结构一样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12237
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_e7c75c4c:

    # C "But..."
    C "但是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12238
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_6e85e352:

    # C "It tasted different... good... familiar... warm... nostalgic..."
    C "味道很特别……很好……很熟悉……很温暖……让人怀念……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12241
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12242
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_692ee430:

    # MCt "What the fuck does that mean? Wait..."
    MCt "这到底是什么意思？等等……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12243
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_9962a353:

    # MCt "That sounds a lot like... the feeling that was drawing me to that room in the first place..."
    MCt "这感觉很像……当初吸引我走向那个房间的那种感觉……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12244
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_ac40f9a8:

    # MCt "Minus the shockwaves and all..."
    MCt "抛开那些冲击波之类的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12245
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_6d096fb3:

    # MCt "But there's also..."
    MCt "但还有……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12246
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_f6c8f250:

    # MC "I've... tried detecting people's affinities, but I couldn't get anything..."
    MC "我……试着感应过人们的亲和力，但什么也没能察觉到……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12247
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_ebad0899:

    # MC "No matter how I tried..."
    MC "无论我怎么尝试……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12254
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_1d9c5e3a:

    # C "Can you feel it?"
    C "你能感觉到吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12255
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_aa321b8f:

    # MC "Yeah... you're pushing magic into my hand..."
    MC "嗯……你正把魔力注入我的手心……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12256
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2ffe333c:

    # C "Push back... relax..."
    C "向后靠……放松……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12257
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_8ab7cc65:

    # MCt "The fuck is this? I've never interacted directly with someone's magic like this..."
    MCt "这到底是什么？我从未像这样直接与他人的魔力产生过感应……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12258
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_759573f6:

    # C "A little bit less... don't overpower me..."
    C "稍微收敛一点……别用太大的力压过我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12263
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_89ab1a6e:

    # C "Pay attention to how much magic you're using... Do you feel it? I'm pushing a little more..."
    C "注意你输出的魔力大小……感觉到了吗？我要稍微加把劲了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12264
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_fb7b76bc:

    # MC "Should I match it?"
    MC "我应该跟上吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12265
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_703a0318:

    # C "Mmhm. Remember how much you're using now, pay attention to how much more you're using."
    C "嗯。记住现在的输出量，留意你增加了多少。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12266
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_35bff394:

    # C "It might help if you close your eyes, master."
    C "闭上眼睛或许会有帮助，主人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12267
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_79678bb6:

    # C "Have a scale in mind, master. Something to put it into perspective."
    C "在脑海中设定一个尺度，主人。以此作为参照标准。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12268
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_d0397d07:

    # MCt "A scale?"
    MCt "尺度？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12269
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_657c4f8e:

    # MCt "I guess... the magnetism test makes sense here..."
    MCt "我想……用磁力测试的方法应该挺合适的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12270
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_fa4bf4ad:

    # MCt "So this is... what? Ten centimeters?"
    MCt "所以这是……多少？十厘米？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12278
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_1ac8950b:

    # MCt "Twenty..."
    MCt "二十……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12279
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12280
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_1bf47aef:

    # MCt "A little less... eighteen?"
    MCt "少一点……十八？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12281
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_134b3b29:

    # MCt "...twenty again... twenty-five... twenty-three, no, twenty-four..."
    MCt "……又是二十……二十五……二十三，不对，二十四……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12282
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_64b558b0:

    # MCt "...That's a lot more..."
    MCt "……那可多多了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12283
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_f71cfc87:

    # MCt "Forty... one?"
    MCt "四……十一？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12284
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_fa0a3f95:

    # MCt "Forty-four... forty-five..."
    MCt "四十四……四十五……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12285
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_efb9da41:

    # C "Good, master.... good."
    C "很好，主人……很好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12286
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_db359c67:

    # MCt "These numbers... I'm not even calculating them anymore..."
    MCt "这些数字……我甚至都不再计算它们了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12287
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_e738a664:

    # MCt "Forty-nine... just like that... fifty-one..."
    MCt "四十九……就这样……五十一……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12288
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2a4c852f:

    # C "Looks like you're getting it, master, just a few more moments to get you used to the feeling."
    C "看来您已经掌握要领了，主人，再过一会儿您就能适应这种感觉了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12289
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_08b6e966:

    # MCt "This isn't exactly what I wanted. Cadence could read my affinity without even touching me."
    MCt "这跟我预想的不太一样。凯登丝甚至不需要身体接触就能读取我的亲和力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12290
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_b2a708f6:

    # C "I think you're done."
    C "我想应该结束了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12291
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_aeb73a03:

    # C "Could you open your eyes now?"
    C "现在能睁开眼了吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12298
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_d28d2ee3:

    # C "Looks like we're done."
    C "看来我们完成了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12299
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2d204a49_2:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12300
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_339c3e89:

    # MC "When did you let go of my hand?"
    MC "你什么时候松开我的手的？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12301
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_ea0d4f6f:

    # C "Around twenty seconds ago."
    C "大概二十秒前吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12302
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_6157882f:

    # C "Could you try reading my affinity now?"
    C "你能试着读取一下我的亲和力吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12303
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_ba42c7bd:

    # MC "Sure I'll give it a go."
    MC "好，我试试看。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12306
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_ba6bf23d:

    # MC "Here goes nothing..."
    MC "试试看吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12307
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_ca931f18:

    # C "With your talents, I totally believe it's nothing."
    C "以你的天赋，我完全相信结果会是“什么都没有”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12330
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_abe24253_1:

    # MC "!!!"
    MC "！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12332
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_fa851469:

    # C "Master?"
    C "主人？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12335
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_b7d23866:

    # MC "What the fuck was that?!"
    MC "那到底是什么鬼东西？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12336
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_c8387c3e:

    # MC "It felt like space was breaking down around me!"
    MC "感觉周围的空间都要崩塌了一样！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12337
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_9a894c0b:

    # C "Are you okay? I didn't do anything different!"
    C "你没事吧？我没做什么特别的事啊！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12338
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_fd9c3b2b:

    # MC "I'm... fine."
    MC "我……没事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12339
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_1b02416c:

    # C "That sounds a lot like what happens when someone has higher affinity than you."
    C "那种感觉，很像是有人的亲和力比你高时会出现的状况。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12340
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_eaba0213:

    # MC "You have more affinity than I do?!"
    MC "你的亲和力比我高？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12341
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_35ea874f:

    # C "No, my affinity isn't even close to yours."
    C "不，我的亲和力远不及你。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12342
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_849ab841:

    # C "It's probably some of your own residue from when we were feeding magic into each other."
    C "那大概是你自己的残留气息——就是我们互相注入魔力时留下的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12343
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_9495c8e2:

    # C "I think you were feeling your own affinity."
    C "我想，你当时感受到的其实是你自己的亲和力。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12344
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_4fbff6a6:

    # MCt "That makes sense. I must be kinda scary."
    MCt "有道理。我肯定挺吓人的吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12345
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_86e91306:

    # MCt "Wait, no, wouldn't I be comfortable with my own affinity?"
    MCt "等等，不对啊，我面对自己的亲和力，不应该感到自在才对吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12346
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2b69eb58:

    # C "I think if we wait for a minute you can try again."
    C "我想如果我们稍微等一下，你可以再试一次。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12349
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_efc8de77:

    # MCt "Ninety centimeters..."
    MCt "九十厘米……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12350
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_f033713e:

    # MC "Your affinity is quite far above the average."
    MC "你的亲和力数值远超平均水平。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12351
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_2675ba5b:

    # C "Yeah. I'm still astounded by yours."
    C "是啊。我对你的表现依然感到惊叹。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12352
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_d4acb16b:

    # MC "Let me check something for a moment."
    MC "让我确认一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12354
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_c921a164:

    # MCt "No Embers... Was it the technique she used?"
    MCt "没有产生余烬……是因为她用的那种技巧吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12356
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_a18b95bb:

    # MC "The thing we did just now, exchanging magic, I had no idea you could do something like that."
    MC "刚才我们交换魔力的那种做法……我完全没想到你竟然能做到这种事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12357
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_503bee4d:

    # C "...I don't understand it either to be perfectly honest, master."
    C "……老实说，我自己也不太明白，主人。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12358
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_212f4129:

    # C "I can only do it for this spell."
    C "我只能在这个法术上做到这一点。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12359
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_71896aa5:

    # MC "I didn't produce any embers from it."
    MC "施展它的时候，我没有产生任何余烬。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12360
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_6fe6d640:

    # C "You were pulling from my knowledge."
    C "你是从我的知识储备中汲取了力量。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12361
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_90108635:

    # MC "That's... Really interesting..."
    MC "这……真是有趣……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12362
translate schinese m19afterchoice2_67273b43:

    # MC "How come you can do this spell anyway? {i}I'm{/i} the guy who shits out spells like he has magical diarrhea. I haven't produced anything like this."
