    s "{i}鳏夫{/i}。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12840
translate schinese m20choice1_1_9f50a8de:

    # MC "...I see..."
    MC "……我明白了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12841
translate schinese m20choice1_1_2186739b:

    # MC "I suppose that's why it hasn't been brought up..."
    MC "想必这就是为什么一直没提过这件事吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12842
translate schinese m20choice1_1_5fc727e2:

    # MC "Did you ever get to meet her?"
    MC "你见过她吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12843
translate schinese m20choice1_1_1bfae857:

    # s "No."
    s "不。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12844
translate schinese m20choice1_1_6b8cafce:

    # MC "So she-"
    MC "所以她——"

# game/script2.rpyc:12845
translate schinese m20choice1_1_dfecbc7c:

    # s "Died a long time ago."
    s "早就去世了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12848
translate schinese m20choice1_1_eea3f350:

    # s "He doesn't like talking about it and... he gets quite angry if you keep asking... or he does with me at least..."
    s "他不愿谈论这件事……而且如果一直追问，他会很生气……至少对我发过火……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12849
translate schinese m20choice1_1_b275c9e3:

    # MC "Wow, he gets angry at {i}you{/i}?"
    MC "哇，他会对{i}你{/i}发火？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12850
translate schinese m20choice1_1_7b025ca1:

    # s "I did a little research of my own and..."
    s "我自己稍微调查了一下，然后……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12851
translate schinese m20choice1_1_9b44c1c3:

    # s "I found out that she was an investigative journalist. I think whatever or whomever she was investigating got her killed."
    s "我发现她曾是一名调查记者。我觉得，不管她在调查什么人或什么事，那正是导致她丧命的原因。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12852
translate schinese m20choice1_1_8162c926:

    # MC "You think she was murdered?!"
    MC "你觉得她是被人谋杀的？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12853
translate schinese m20choice1_1_04c6c5cb:

    # s "I don't \"think\" so. There are articles about it."
    s "我不这么“认为”。有些文章专门讲过这件事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12856
translate schinese m20choice1_1_0fd9df11:

    # s "She was stabbed in the neck. Along with two others. A man who was shot, and a woman who died after a blow to the head."
    s "她的脖子被刺伤了。另外还有两人受害：一名男子遭枪击，一名女子头部遭重击身亡。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12859
translate schinese m20choice1_1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12863
translate schinese m20choice1_1_dc3e9705:

    # MC "Let's talk about something else for a while..."
    MC "我们换个话题聊聊吧……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12870
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_ee03fb62:

    # MC "As I said, I've got maybe a few hours..."
    MC "就像我说的，我大概只剩下几个小时了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12877
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_a58c9d2c:

    # MC "I... don't think I get the joke..."
    MC "我……不太明白这个笑话的梗在哪里……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12878
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_fccf4927:

    # s "The whole movie is a satirical parody of Saint Forlan's obsession with discovering a teleportation spell."
    s "整部电影是对圣福兰（Saint Forlan）痴迷于研发传送咒语这一行为的讽刺与戏仿。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12879
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_f98c36d1:

    # MC "I still don't understand why the movie ends with him turning into a butterfly..."
    MC "我还是不明白为什么电影结尾他会变成一只蝴蝶……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12880
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_34475852:

    # s "Because every time someone has made progress towards inventing teleportation, a butterfly somehow gets involved."
    s "因为每当有人在发明传送术方面取得进展时，总会有蝴蝶莫名其妙地卷入其中。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12881
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_acb8587b:

    # MC "Umm... yeah... I'm kind of ignorant of magical history..."
    MC "呃……是啊……我对魔法史不太了解……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12882
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_b090d9cc:

    # MC "What kind of experiments have there been?"
    MC "都有过什么样的实验？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12885
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_c7e8a216:

    # s "I guess the most famous one is the Spanish Monarch Generator."
    s "我想最著名的应该是“西班牙君主发生器”吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12886
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_cffc2123:

    # MC "What is that? It sounds like a prog metal album."
    MC "那是什么？听起来像是一张前卫金属专辑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12887
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_a9f97806:

    # s "It's the only ever \"successful\" teleportation experiment."
    s "这是有史以来唯一一次“成功”的瞬间移动实验。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12888
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_9c0cae06:

    # MC "Why did you emphasize \"successful\" like that?"
    MC "你为什么要那样强调“成功”？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12891
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_c00f19dd:

    # s "With two points in space;"
    s "空间中的两个点；"

# game/script2.rpyc:12898
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_058d028a:

    # s "A frog on the input point..."
    s "起点上的一只青蛙……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12914
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_a7c8f12f:

    # s "Teleporting it to the output point..."
    s "正在将其传送至输出点……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12921
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_96644c5c:

    # s "Produces a Blue Monarch Butterfly."
    s "产出一只蓝色黑脉金斑蝶。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12925
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_908513e4:

    # s "Every time, even when reproducing the experiment with different animals. Yet they couldn't \"teleport\" a Monarch Butterfly itself."
    s "每次都是如此，即便使用不同的动物重复该实验。然而，他们却无法将黑脉金斑蝶本身进行“传送”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12928
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_3678b1b9:

    # MCt "A butterfly... interesting... I can't think of a single reason why that would be..."
    MCt "蝴蝶……真有意思……我实在想不出这到底是为什么……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12929
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_47e85b8b:

    # MCt "Specific type every time... are they getting the spell wrong? No. Magic tends to conform pretty well with what you're {i}trying{/i} to do... it either happens or it doesn't..."
    MCt "每次都是同一种类……难道是咒语施展错了吗？不。魔法通常会很好地顺应施法者{i}想做的事{/i}……要么成功，要么失败……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12930
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_56d6f497:

    # MCt "Wait, doesn't that make it even {i}more{/i} strange? Side effects are one thing... but for a spell to behave differently from the way you intended..."
    MCt "等等，这岂不是更奇怪了？产生副作用是一回事……但如果魔法的表现与施法者的本意不符……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12931
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_2fae8423:

    # MCt "So that could mean..."
    MCt "那么这可能意味着……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12932
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_eccc5969:

    # MCt "What could it mean?"
    MCt "这可能意味着什么？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12933
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_000dd85d:

    # MCt "Something is interfering with the spell? Or maybe the spell being cast only dictates the end step and... something else is happening in the middle..."
    MCt "有什么东西干扰了那个法术吗？又或者，那个正在施放的法术只规定了最终步骤，而……中间还发生了别的事情……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12934
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12936
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_75038e18:

    # s "You told him."
    s "你告诉他了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12940
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_7f208eaa:

    # MC "Hmm?"
    MC "嗯？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12944
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_c5b93131:

    # s "You told Ronald what happened in the alley."
    s "你把小巷里发生的事告诉了罗纳德。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12947
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_e5d3450a:

    # MC "Oh, he uh... he let that slip, did he?"
    MC "噢，他……呃……他把这事说漏嘴了，是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12950
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_6ad833db:

    # s "I told you not to!"
    s "我告诉过你别这么做！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12951
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_76cec559:

    # s "But you did it anyway. Even though I didn't want him to know."
    s "但你还是这么做了。尽管我并不想让他知道。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12952
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_837f40e8:

    # s "Why?! Why would you do that? I trusted you to keep it a secret!"
    s "为什么？！你为什么要这么做？我本来以为你会替我保密的！"

# game/script2.rpyc:12955
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12956
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_44bfd46f:

    # MC "Stella, I..."
    MC "斯特拉，我……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12957
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_ae6d6055:

    # MC "What happened back in the alley was... like nothing I'd ever seen before..."
    MC "那条小巷里发生的事……简直是我从未见过的景象……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12958
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_3a3b471b:

    # MC "Ron knows you and... I thought he might know what's going on. And if something dangerous is happening to you..."
    MC "罗纳德认识你，而且……我想他或许知道发生了什么事。万一你正面临什么危险……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12959
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_b17f676d:

    # MC "I think he should know..."
    MC "我觉得他应该知道……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12962
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_56d617a2:

    # s "So why didn't you consult {i}me{/i} first?"
    s "那你为什么不先跟{i}我{/i}商量一下？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12963
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_22429b41:

    # s "Do you think I can't be reasoned with? Or do you just not care how I feel?"
    s "你觉得我是个不讲理的人吗？还是说你根本不在乎我的感受？"

# game/script2.rpyc:12965
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_85554841:

    # MC "Nononononononono! That's not it at all!"
    MC "不不不不不不不！根本不是那样！"

