translate schinese m20afterchoice1_539a160a:

    # MCt "I don't actually know why I did it... I... can't explain it..."
    MCt "其实我也不知道自己为什么要这么做……我……说不清楚……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12969
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_4e55633d:

    # MCt "Think..."
    MCt "想想看……"

