translate schinese m20afterchoice1_11e7a865:

    # MCt "I think... because it's Stella... my best course of action is..."
    MCt "我想……既然对象是斯特拉……最好的做法应该是……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12974
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_feb8cbe6:

    # MC "I'm sorry."
    MC "抱歉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12975
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_331f3adf:

    # MC "I... also didn't think it through..."
    MC "我……也没考虑周全……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12976
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_1f8af9e8:

    # MC "It was me just... expecting myself to be right. To know what's best..."
    MC "当时我只是……自以为是，觉得自己的判断才是对的，觉得我最清楚什么才是最好的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12977
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_2aa34502:

    # MC "I didn't put any thought into it either way..."
    MC "我根本就没有好好想过这件事……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12978
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_3bc24066:

    # MC "I'm sorry... I don't really have an explanation, just... I'm sorry."
    MC "对不起……我真的没什么好解释的，只是……真的很抱歉。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12981
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_dea7119d:

    # s "Well. Maybe you should add someones feelings as a buffer before you make decisions."
    s "嗯。也许你在做决定之前，应该把别人的感受也考虑进去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12982
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_f44698bd:

    # s "Even if you thought it was for the best."
    s "哪怕你觉得那是为了我好。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12983
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_3375ef5a:

    # s "Now I don't know if I can trust you with sensitive things anymore..."
    s "现在我不知道还能不能把敏感的事情托付给你了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:12986
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_dbc3ff7e:

    # s "You even pressured me into that photo shoot. I don't know what's worse;"
    s "你甚至逼着我参加了那次拍摄。我不知道哪种情况更糟："

# game/script2.rpyc:12987
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_3f092346:

    # s "You couldn't tell that I was too embarrassed to say \"no\". Or that you didn't care."
    s "是你没看出我当时因为尴尬而说不出“不”字，还是说你根本不在乎。"

# game/script2.rpyc:12990
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_224ab59e:

    # s "*Sigh*"
    s "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:12991
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_b24399d7:

    # s "I'm sorry. I don't like airing grievances like this."
    s "对不起。我不喜欢像这样抱怨不满。"

