    s "是啊！"

# game/script2.rpyc:13060
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_c937b13e:

    # s "Thank you for coming to check up on me. It really makes these kinds of ordeals so much easier to take in."
    s "谢谢你特意来看我。有你在，这种难熬的时刻真的好受多了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:13061
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_a4ed6431:

    # s "I always have to deal with these things on my own. But having someone there with you does {i}so{/i} much to ease the tension."
    s "这种事我向来都是独自应对的。但有你在身边，真的{i}能{/i}极大地缓解紧张情绪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:13064
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_77c44eb7:

    # s "In only ten minutes I think I'd forgotten why you were even here in the first place."
    s "才过了十分钟，我想我就已经忘了你最初来这儿是为了什么了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:13067
translate schinese m20afterchoice1_830ea3df:

    # s "All the anxiety had completely gone."
    s "所有的焦虑都烟消云散了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:13070
