translate schinese hobospell_271e71f5:

    # MC "Yeah. Spicy."
    MC "没错。辣辣的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14022
translate schinese hobospell_e46e5444:

    # MC "So. A \"chemistry spell\" for medical emergencies."
    MC "所以，这是一个用于医疗急救的“化学法术”。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14023
translate schinese hobospell_05ca7f39:

    # trent "That's not its only application, but yes."
    trent "这并非它的唯一用途，但确实如此。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14024
translate schinese hobospell_39bdb4c8:

    # MC "I know we can ionize some shit using magic. Is this related?"
    MC "我知道我们可以利用魔法让某些东西电离。这和那个有关吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14025
translate schinese hobospell_5880307a:

    # trent "It follows the same principles."
    trent "原理是一样的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14037
translate schinese hobospell_4dad7553:

    # trent "Ah. There it is."
    trent "啊，找到了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14067
translate schinese hobospell_5272afda:

    # trent "High Elf hemorrhaging poison. Nasty stuff."
    trent "“高等精灵出血毒素”。这东西可真够呛。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14068
translate schinese hobospell_98f88faf:

    # trent "I've never seen such controlled vomiting before. Your shirt is still pristine. Good thing you don't have to go home and put on another."
    trent "我从没见过呕吐还能控制得这么好的。你的衬衫竟然一点都没弄脏。幸好你不用回家换一件。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14069
translate schinese hobospell_645927e6:

    # MC "I don't *Cough* have any other shirts..."
    MC "我……*咳嗽*……没有别的衬衫了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14070
translate schinese hobospell_561a7bf5:

    # trent "I understand that you're in shock, but you should also be coherent. So I'll explain what just happened while you recover."
    trent "我明白你现在处于震惊之中，但你也得保持清醒。趁你恢复的时候，我来解释一下刚才发生了什么。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14071
translate schinese hobospell_e65571f7:

    # trent "Oh, and don't worry, despite the dramatic bleeding, you should make a full recovery in less than an hour."
    trent "哦，别担心，尽管出血看起来很吓人，但你应该不到一小时就能完全康复。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14072
translate schinese hobospell_f98e6441:

    # trent "Despite the name it's actually a human invention. I don't know how familiar you are with the High Elf war..."
    trent "虽然名字叫这个，但它其实是人类的发明。不知道你对“高等精灵战争”了解多少……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14077
translate schinese hobospell_6fafff2f:

    # trent "This..."
    trent "这……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14080
translate schinese hobospell_0143fec0:

    # trent "Is the poison that ended it."
    trent "就是终结那场战争的毒素。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14081
translate schinese hobospell_b1558f3a:

    # trent "While present in the body, it modifies the permeability of the digestive system. Causing blood to osmose into the stomach and intestines."
    trent "它在体内时，会改变消化系统的渗透性。导致血液渗透进胃肠道。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14082
translate schinese hobospell_ce89464f:

    # trent "It can still prove fatal to humans, depending on dosage and ingestion speed."
    trent "根据剂量和摄入速度的不同，它仍可能致命。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14083
translate schinese hobospell_0507e656:

    # trent "You've had more than enough to kill an average human."
    trent "你摄入的量足以杀死一个普通人了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14084
translate schinese hobospell_bd250552:

    # trent "The high Elves had a much more... explosive reaction..."
    trent "高等精灵的反应要……剧烈得多……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14085
translate schinese hobospell_e0ce930a:

    # trent "One of them would've been dead before you had even reached haematemesis."
    trent "他们中的任何一个，恐怕还没等到吐血就已经没命了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14088
translate schinese hobospell_97c8d33f:

    # trent "So why are you still alive?"
    trent "那你为什么还活着？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14089
translate schinese hobospell_34c6a48b:

    # MC "*Pant* *Pant*"
    MC "*喘息* *喘息*"

# game/script2.rpyc:14090
translate schinese hobospell_802da1c3:

    # MC "Heh. Maybe the poison went down the wrong hole."
    MC "呵。也许是毒药呛进气管里去了吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14091
translate schinese hobospell_3958cff4:

    # trent "I'm surprised that you're being sarcastic. I didn't poison you for comedic effect."
    trent "真没想到你还有心情说俏皮话。我下毒可不是为了搞笑。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14092
translate schinese hobospell_953333cb:

    # MC "What other reason is there?"
    MC "那还能有什么理由？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14093
translate schinese hobospell_e2b3f4e7_1:

    # trent "*Sigh*"
    trent "*叹气*"

# game/script2.rpyc:14094
translate schinese hobospell_8f6c4261:

    # trent "If I poisoned someone else, or just told you that I could neutralize toxins with magic. You wouldn't believe me. It's not unnatural for homeless people to perform scams."
    trent "如果我给别人下毒，或者直接告诉你我能用魔法中和毒素，你肯定不会信。毕竟，流浪汉搞些骗人的把戏也不算什么稀奇事。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14095
translate schinese hobospell_d89765d6:

    # trent "You felt it firsthand. You were going to die."
    trent "你亲身体会到了那种感觉。你当时觉得自己死定了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14096
translate schinese hobospell_1319a58c:

    # trent "So whatcha think? Pretty cool, right? I've spent years developing this. Close to a decade, I believe."
    trent "怎么样？很厉害吧？我可是花了好几年才把它研发出来的。大概有十年了吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14099
translate schinese hobospell_d7487eda:

    # trent "I'm actually a qualified toxicologist. I find this stuff truly fascinating. That poison was a nightmare to reverse-engineer, especially using the few samples the government gave us access to at the lab. I'm sure you understand that this stuff is {i}very{/i} illegal."
    trent "其实我是一名合格的毒理学家。我对这东西着迷得很。要逆向解析这种毒药简直是场噩梦，尤其是考虑到我们在实验室里能接触到的样本少之又少。你应该明白，这玩意儿可是{i}绝对{/i}违法的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14102
translate schinese hobospell_93ee8882:

    # MC "So you're just going to give me those secrets?"
    MC "所以你就打算把这些秘密告诉我？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14103
translate schinese hobospell_d2c74153:

    # trent "We made a deal. I actually have a good use for those couple thousand Embers."
    trent "我们可是有约定的。那几千枚“余烬”对我来说确实很有用。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14104
translate schinese hobospell_a4bef0bb:

    # MC "Enough heroin to {i}literally{/i} send you into space?"
    MC "足以让你{i}真正{/i}飞上太空的海洛因？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14105
translate schinese hobospell_a906bf7c:

    # trent "Besides, while I'll explain the mechanics and theory behind the spell, it's going to take you years master it. In fact, someone with a lack of biochemical background such as yourself could take a lifetime to put the spell into action."
    trent "再说，虽然我会讲解这个法术背后的原理和机制，但你还得花上好几年才能真正掌握它。事实上，像你这种缺乏生化背景的人，恐怕得花上一辈子才能把这道咒语施展出来。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14106
translate schinese hobospell_c3a0fe4c:

    # trent "Better late than never, I guess."
    trent "总比永远不做好吧，我想。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14107
translate schinese hobospell_5bb9e7cb:

    # MCt "If he thinks I'm going to take years to learn this spell... I've got some bad news for him..."
    MCt "如果他以为我得花好几年才能学会这道咒语……那他可要失望了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14108
translate schinese hobospell_f4175d1d:

    # MC "*Sigh* You're right. We {i}did{/i} have a deal. Let's get this over with."
    MC "*叹气* 你说得对。我们确实有约定。那就赶紧把这事儿了结了吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14116
translate schinese hobospell_6cb524b9:

    # bob "No fucking way, man. Eight-thousand big ones!"
    bob "绝无可能，伙计。整整八千大洋！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14117
translate schinese hobospell_dd8b0dcb:

    # trent "I did it..."
    trent "我做到了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14122
translate schinese hobospell_6765f0e5:

    # gumz "Do you think if you return the money I can get my old name back?!"
    gumz "你说，如果把钱还回去，我能拿回原来的名字吗？！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14126
translate schinese hobospell_b773885d:

    # MCt "...Ron was right..."
    MCt "……罗纳德说得对……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14127
translate schinese hobospell_14838e0b:

    # MCt "Poor Trent... He doesn't know..."
    MCt "可怜的特伦特……他根本不知道……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14128
translate schinese hobospell_c6725913:

    # MCt "That I've mastered the spell already..."
    MCt "我已经掌握了那个咒语……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14129
translate schinese hobospell_7ab217ad:

    # MCt "Even more notable, I've produced some of those spent Embers by learning it..."
    MCt "更值得一提的是，在学习它的过程中，我还弄到了一些“余烬”……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14132
translate schinese hobospell_27808e18:

    # MCt "He said the spell works like an algorithm... so it will eventually purge any kind of poison..."
    MCt "他说这个咒语的运作原理就像算法一样……所以最终能清除任何毒素……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14133
translate schinese hobospell_f2d505a4:

    # MCt "I have no idea if this will ever become useful..."
    MCt "我不知道这玩意儿以后能不能派上用场……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14134
translate schinese hobospell_a7610080:

    # MCt "But if it does, I'll be thankful to have it... which is better than to regret not having it..."
    MCt "但万一真用得上，有它总比没有强……毕竟有备无患嘛……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14135
translate schinese hobospell_e0d79d76:

    # MCt "Now..."
    MCt "好了……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14136
translate schinese hobospell_069de89e:

    # MCt "I've got a party to attend..."
    MCt "我得去参加个聚会……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14145
translate schinese m20afterhobos_2289ee7f:

    # m "Of all things... you don't know how to tie a tie?"
    m "真是的……你竟然不会打领带？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14146
translate schinese m20afterhobos_279d38e6:

    # MC "The school uniform used a clip-on tie..."
    MC "学校制服配的是那种夹扣式领带……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14147
translate schinese m20afterhobos_7563f3ef:

    # m "Where would you be without me?"
    m "要是没有我，你可怎么办啊？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14148
translate schinese m20afterhobos_c60e8b54:

    # m "I'm glad we found a workaround to keep this suit clinging to your body."
    m "真高兴我们找到了让这套衣服继续贴在你身上的办法。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14149
translate schinese m20afterhobos_588a417b:

    # m "I've never known anyone who's literally incapable of wearing other clothes before."
    m "我从来没见过有人真的完全没法穿别的衣服。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14150
translate schinese m20afterhobos_4c44d0e4:

    # MC "Yeah, quick thinking on your part. I was too busy focusing on the impossibilities."
    MC "是啊，你反应真快。我当时光顾着想那些“不可能”了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14151
translate schinese m20afterhobos_dda7485d:

    # m "And there I was with a solution."
    m "就这样，我找到了解决方案。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14152
translate schinese m20afterhobos_28b04318:

    # MC "Appreciate it."
    MC "谢了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14155
translate schinese m20afterhobos_a01de232:

    # m "Let's take a look at you."
    m "让我看看你现在的样子。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14158
translate schinese m20afterhobos_8c6085bc:

    # m "Wow... I can't believe it..."
    m "哇……真让人难以置信……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14159
translate schinese m20afterhobos_329355f6:

    # m "[name] wearing a three-piece suit... I never thought I'd see the day."
    m "[name]竟然穿着三件套西装……我从没想过能看到这一天。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14160
translate schinese m20afterhobos_9d76686b:

    # m "Gotta say, you're pulling it off well. It makes you look... slimmer?"
    m "不得不说，你穿起来效果真不错。这让你看起来……更苗条了？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14162
translate schinese m20afterhobos_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14163
translate schinese m20afterhobos_52b856a2:

    # m "What's with that face?"
    m "你那是什么表情？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14164
translate schinese m20afterhobos_ba457bc2:

    # MC "You don't notice anything else?"
    MC "你没注意到别的什么吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14165
translate schinese m20afterhobos_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14166
translate schinese m20afterhobos_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14167
translate schinese m20afterhobos_e612037c_2:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14168
translate schinese m20afterhobos_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14169
translate schinese m20afterhobos_14b321f1:

    # m "Uh... I'm sorry, [name]... I don't think I do..."
    m "呃……抱歉，[name]……我想我没注意到……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14184
translate schinese m20afterhobos_4b33c37a:

    # MC "FUCKING WASTE OF MONEY!" with vpunch
    MC "简直是浪费钱！" with vpunch

# game/script2.rpyc:14187
translate schinese m20afterhobos_ce2c515c:

    # m "Mmm..."
    m "嗯……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14188
translate schinese m20afterhobos_796ca73f:

    # MC "You okay? You're looking a little disgruntled."
    MC "你还好吗？看起来有点不高兴。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14189
translate schinese m20afterhobos_e612037c_3:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14190
translate schinese m20afterhobos_7271fe63:

    # m "I wanted to go..."
    m "我本来想去的……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14191
translate schinese m20afterhobos_18c3d64f:

    # MC "Aww... you can come to the next upper-class birthday party I'm invited to."
    MC "哎呀……下次我受邀参加上流社会的生日派对时，你可以跟我一起去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14192
translate schinese m20afterhobos_1915c789:

    # MC "Sorry you didn't get picked. I mean, one of you was an obvious choice, but I left the third guest up to her."
    MC "很遗憾你没被选中。其实，你们其中一人本来是板上钉钉的人选，但第三位宾客的名额我交由她来决定了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14195
translate schinese m20afterhobos_25ed01fc:

    # m "Ahh, well."
    m "唉，好吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14196
translate schinese m20afterhobos_8ed33d2a:

    # m "You'll make this up to me some other time."
    m "你以后得找机会补偿我。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14197
translate schinese m20afterhobos_17f890e2:

    # MC "Will I?"
    MC "是吗？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14198
translate schinese m20afterhobos_8cb62253:

    # m "Yes."
    m "对。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14199
translate schinese m20afterhobos_d26316ad:

    # m "You better run along to your little rich people party."
    m "你还是赶紧去参加你们那富人派对吧。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14200
translate schinese m20afterhobos_ad66fb7c:

    # m "Don't enjoy the taste of champagne too much, lest you resent returning to my humble upper-middle-class abode."
    m "香槟别喝得太上瘾了，免得你回来后嫌弃我这寒酸的中上层阶级小窝。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14201
translate schinese m20afterhobos_ec11376b:

    # MC "Ugh, I'm gonna go first and meet up with the boys anyway. The girls say they're gonna take a little longer to sort themselves out."
    MC "哎，反正我得先走了，还要去跟那帮男生会合呢。姑娘们说她们还得再花点时间收拾一下。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14202
translate schinese m20afterhobos_155b36e5:

    # MC "Like, they're literally fulfilling the \"why do women take so long to get dressed\" Boomer joke."
    MC "她们这简直是在亲身演绎那个“女人为什么穿个衣服要那么久”的“婴儿潮一代”式老梗。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14203
translate schinese m20afterhobos_c6df6778:

    # MC "Catch you later, Miya."
    MC "回头见，米娅。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14271
translate schinese m20afterhobos_f5d1f129:

    # MC "The fuck you mean you ain't got a plan?"
    MC "你他妈什么意思？你竟然没有计划？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14272
translate schinese m20afterhobos_3f693811:

    # a "Dude, I'm here to kick his balls, not tear down his estate."
    a "老兄，我是来踢他蛋的，又不是来拆他家庄园的。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14273
translate schinese m20afterhobos_92377617:

    # a "We find a way to isolate him. I show him my face. I slam dunk his nuts back into his torso with my foot."
    a "我们想办法把他引到没人的地方。我亮出真面目。然后一脚把他的蛋给踹回肚子里去。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14274
translate schinese m20afterhobos_be95c409:

    # a "That's the plan."
    a "计划就是这样。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14277
translate schinese m20afterhobos_87cc190f:

    # ch "Either of you know the hottie?"
    ch "你们俩谁认识那个辣妹？"

# game/script2.rpyc:14287
translate schinese m20afterhobos_633ce1c9:

    # g "!!!!"
    g "！！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14299
translate schinese m20afterhobos_07c13433:

    # g "A suit!"
    g "穿西装的！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14300
translate schinese m20afterhobos_314fe448:

    # g "[name] in a suit!"
    g "[name]穿西装了！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14301
translate schinese m20afterhobos_edf94252:

    # g "How?! I didn't know it was possible!"
    g "怎么做到的？！我以前都不知道这还能实现！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14302
translate schinese m20afterhobos_a6e85252:

    # g "I need to back these photos up immediately. I don't know if I'll ever get to see this again!"
    g "我得赶紧把这些照片备份。天知道以后还能不能再见到这种场面！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14308
translate schinese m20afterhobos_8e7d75c0:

    # gt "Oh. My. God."
    gt "天哪。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14309
translate schinese m20afterhobos_99a6b191:

    # gt "[name] in a suit is so... hot!!!"
    gt "穿西装的[name]简直……太性感了！！！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14310
translate schinese m20afterhobos_af23ec06:

    # gt "What the fuck do I do? I don't know if I can contain myself."
    gt "我该怎么办？我怕自己快控制不住了。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14311
translate schinese m20afterhobos_ac35fa04:

    # gt "I'll try to hold back until I get home but... these photos..."
    gt "我会尽量忍到回家，不过……这些照片……"

# game/script2.rpyc:14323
translate schinese m20afterhobos_d31d3187:

    # eg "That's right. You should definitely rub one out to these photographs when you get home."
    eg "没错。你回家后一定要对着这些照片打一炮。"

# game/script2.rpyc:14324
translate schinese m20afterhobos_b9d8a4ab:

    # eg "Think about it, this is the nicest [name] has ever looked!"
    eg "你想想看，这可是[name]看起来最迷人的一次！"

# game/script2.rpyc:14325
translate schinese m20afterhobos_9f223cfc:

    # eg "What's the harm in using the sight for a little masturbation session?"
    eg "借着这番美景来场自慰，又有什么坏处呢？"

